window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3901,"title":"Chapter 3901: Master Wang, Are You a Ninja or Something!","paragraphs":["\"Hehe, isn’t Guan Yan Sister Qiao’s girlfriend too? You certainly aren’t a cook, a cook wouldn’t have your aura.\" Qin Si shamelessly requested.","Ye Wangchuan, perhaps swayed by his words, lowered his long eyelashes and, in an elegant, lazy manner, said, \"Alright, I’ll make a tomato pot.\"","Qin Si immediately flattered him, \"Thank you, Master Wang, you’ve worked hard, Master Wang!\"","He didn’t forget to flatter everyone, turning to look at Qiao Nian, still full of praise, \"And also thank Sister Qiao for finding a good boyfriend, so we can enjoy a tomato pot~\"","Qiao Nian was left speechless by him and directly ignored him, walking over and tilting her head up, \"Aren’t you going to rest for a while?\"","She wasn’t very good at caring for others but, seeing the dark circles under Ye Wangchuan’s eyes, she pursed her lips and said, \"I can skip the hotpot.\"","\"Don’t!\" Qin Si wailed from behind.","Fortunately, Ye Wangchuan’s brows relaxed, and he said very gently, \"I’ve already bought the ingredients, and there will be a lot of people tonight, perfect for a gathering.\"","He was referring to Mo Xi and a few main members of the Red Alliance, like Tattoo Arm, who hadn’t left and were still in Guan Yan’s room.","When there are many people, hotpot is indeed the easiest and most effective way to liven up the atmosphere.","Qiao Nian didn’t continue the topic, extending her hands as she headed to the kitchen, \"Then I’ll go help.\"","But she was suddenly grabbed by the wrist and pulled back. Ye Wangchuan pressed her down onto the sofa, speaking in a tone filled with helpless indulgence, \"I don’t need you to do anything, just sit here and wait for me!\"","**","The dinner gathering concluded at half past midnight.","Mo Xi, Ji Lin, Tattoo Arm and the others don’t live here, so they called for a driver to pick them up, staggering.","Qin Si saw them off and then took Guan Yan back to her room, leaving only Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan in the living room.","\"Master Wang, leave the table where it is. I’ll clean it up when I get up tomorrow.\" Qin Si didn’t forget to say that to them before heading upstairs.","Qiao Nian saw the living room return to its quiet state and also prepared to get up and go to her room. She glanced at the person across from her, \"Going back to sleep?\"","She said it naturally, without realizing how suggestive her words were.","Ye Wangchuan raised an eyebrow at her, using a teasing tone to ask, \"Nian Nian, are you inviting me?\"","\"?\"","Qiao Nian might not have understood at first, but since they were both adults, she wasn’t clueless. She quickly realized what he was implying.","Her dark eyes looked over, using a rather careless tone, \"Yeah, are you accepting the invitation?\"","Ye Wangchuan didn’t expect her to be so direct. He chuckled softly and looked at her right hand, \"Who was it last time that complained about a sore hand for a day? Haven’t you learned from that?\"","Qiao Nian’s arm was sore for a whole day that time. But refusing to admit defeat, she boldly met his gaze, a challenging look in her eyes, \"My soreness wasn’t because of how good you were, it was because I was inexperienced before, you get it?\"","What man could accept such a challenge.","Ye Wangchuan felt a rush of blood at her brief provocation, but managed to maintain a sliver of clarity. He reached out to gently touch the girl’s forehead with his fingertips, brushing away her dark hair, his deep sea-colored eyes looking into Qiao Nian’s. \"Don’t tease, I don’t have the patience you think. But at least my Nian Nian’s first time shouldn’t be here, it should have a sense of ceremony.\"","Qiao Nian didn’t quite understand the need for ceremony but was still captivated by his gaze and did not continue the conversation.","She didn’t want to think about that sort of thing, so she relaxed against the back of the chair, casually leaning in a slumped manner, suddenly talking to Ye Wangchuan, \"I plan to find Di Xicheng.\""]},{"number":3902,"title":"Chapter 3902: Sister Nian: I Just Happen to Have Some Money","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan couldn’t detach himself from the ambiguous atmosphere so easily, unlike her. This might be the natural difference between men and women, so his voice still had a slight hoarseness: \"Hmm?\"","The rising tone of his voice was like a feather brushing past Qiao Nian’s ear, prompting her to rub her ear involuntarily, her expression becoming a tad complex as she looked at him: \"Are you really not going to reconsider?\"","\"Reconsider what?\" Ye Wangchuan got the answer from her eyes, laughed suddenly, and flicked her forehead, moving on to the main topic: \"I’m afraid it’s not that easy to find him.\"","Di Xicheng is cunning and deceitful. Since he wants to hide and create conflicts, he wouldn’t let himself be found easily.","Of course, Qiao Nian understood this, but she shrugged it off and said arrogantly: \"I simply hadn’t planned on actively finding him before.\"","\"Now that I’ve decided to find him, it’s just locating someone. Unless he’s no longer in the illegal zone, there’s no one I can’t find!\"","The illegal zone is her territory.","Even Nie Qingru has to be cautious there.","Di Xicheng thinks he can play cat and mouse with her in the illegal zone, but he’s overestimating himself.","\"Starting tomorrow, I will have the Red Alliance people spread out and search for him. Additionally, I will issue a bounty order.\" Qiao Nian was resolute and incredibly swift to act.","Her deep eyes turned towards Ye Wangchuan: \"The illegal zone is a lawless territory; here, money is more effective than power.\"","\"Though the Red Alliance doesn’t have many people, it can’t withstand me throwing money around. She can hire mercenaries to do things; I can use the same crews to capture him.\"","This is a place ruled by money.","Plenty of people here will do anything for money.","Nie Qingru wants to play? She’ll play to the end!","**","The next day.","A staggering bounty task was posted through illegal zone’s dark web channels.","The task was simple: find someone.","But the person issuing the task was clearly extremely wealthy, offering nearly an eight-figure reward for this ordinary task. Even in the illegal zone, few tasks carried such a price.","Moreover, the task simply involved finding this person.","Only a fool wouldn’t jump at the chance.","Suddenly, people in all strata and all forces within the illegal zone were talking about it.","\"Did you hear about the latest task on the dark web?\"","\"You mean the high-priced task?\"","\"Oh, I heard it’s backed by the Red Alliance, with Zhui Guang personally issuing the bounty. What’s this Di Xicheng guy’s background to warrant this mysterious big shot’s involvement?\"","\"Who knows? I’ve never even heard of him; he’s probably not from the illegal zone.\"","\"Someone from outside came to our illegal zone?!\"","\"...\"","Along with the bounty task, Qiao Nian provided Di Xicheng’s basic information, including a recent photo for easy identification.","The photo was a composite made using the customs photo Di Xicheng left in the independent continent, almost identical to the actual person.","Di Xicheng probably never expected that the photo he left behind to manipulate people would become the identification for a bounty on him.","But how he felt about it was no longer any of Qiao Nian’s concern.","...","Less than three days after the Red Alliance issued the task.","In the illegal zone, people were treating the task like a lottery jackpot, with many eager to try and find this person.","Even ordinary people without connections were tempted to try their luck, wandering the streets hoping to stumble upon ’billions’.","The most active participants in this were mercenaries and professional treasure hunters.","Among the professional treasure hunters, some were bounty hunters themselves, specializing in tracking and treasure hunting.","As for mercenaries, they are typically willing to do anything for the right price."]},{"number":3903,"title":"Chapter 3903: It’s Time for Her to Find Lu Zhi","paragraphs":["Such a big contract is out.","Even the mercenaries stationed at Nie Qingru’s estate are starting to get restless; more and more people have been asking for leave and slipping away early lately.","Shadow has a splitting headache over it, and at the same time can’t do anything about this group.","After all, these peripheral mercenaries are just hired muscle they spent money to bring in. Now that this bunch has found something more profitable, of course their hearts are wavering, and hardly anyone is willing to take his orders.","\"Empress.\"","Shadow had just dealt with a few people asking for leave outside and came in, only to see Nie Qingru sitting in the chair with a dark expression, lifting her eyes to look at him.","\"How many people left today?\"","\"...\"","Shadow lifted his eyes and dropped them again, really not wanting to provoke her.","Nie Qingru pressed him, forceful as ever: \"Speak!\"","Shadow had no choice but to answer bitterly, \"Ten. Up to now we’ve already lost one-third of our manpower.\"","\"Hmph.\" Nie Qingru let out a cold laugh, \"A bunch of low-level trash. If I hadn’t hit a rough patch I wouldn’t have gone to them in the first place. They’ve got some nerve, daring to treat me like this.\"","Shadow tried to placate her: \"Empress, please don’t get angry. These people are desperados to begin with, they don’t give a damn about loyalty or morals. If they don’t want to work for us, we’ll find new people to replace them.\"","\"Of course I know that.\" Nie Qingru’s tone was still unpleasant. She propped a hand against her forehead, like she was having another headache: \"But over at Xicheng...\"","\"Young Master Di...\" Shadow didn’t know how to comfort her either.","He’d told the empress from the start that Qiao Nian wasn’t the type to lie. Since Qiao Nian kept saying Young Master Di wasn’t in her hands, then he definitely wasn’t.","But the empress wouldn’t listen, stubbornly convinced Young Master Di’s disappearance had something to do with Qiao Nian, and in the middle of this standoff, when both sides’ swords were already drawn, she went and grabbed Guan Yan.","That completely enraged Qiao Nian, who then started a massive manhunt for Young Master Di, hell-bent on making the accusation stick.","The empress is usually sharp and capable, but this time even Shadow has to admit Nie Qingru was too rash, which led to the current situation.","They’re really on the back foot now.","\"No one could have expected Qiao Nian to pull something like this.\" Shadow could only lower his voice, controlling his breathing. \"You need to take care of your health.\"","Nie Qingru’s face was full of rage, features twisted to the extreme. She slammed the table hard and growled, \"I say she just doesn’t want to let me live in peace. Otherwise how could she do something like this! My health... with such a ’good’ granddaughter thinking about my health, how good do you think it can get!\"","It’s already a blessing she hasn’t died early like they all wish!","In the face of her fury, Shadow didn’t dare lift his head.","Fortunately, Nie Qingru’s temper flares fast and dies fast. Soon she pulled her anger back, leaving only a chilling coldness in her brows and eyes: \"She wants to go looking for Xicheng, doesn’t she? Perfect. It’s about time I paid Lu Zhi a visit too.\"","\"If he can keep still and not make a move, he’ll get to attend my good granddaughter’s wedding in due time! He must be reaching the limit of his patience too.\"","\"...\"","Shadow raised his head, saying nothing.","He doesn’t think Lu Zhi is an ideal partner.","But right now, on their turf in the illegal zone, they’re hemmed in on all sides. Without Lu Zhi’s help, it’ll be very hard not to be suppressed by Qiao Nian.","Shadow said softly, \"Let’s hope Lu Zhi doesn’t disappoint you.\"","Nie Qingru was utterly confident. She turned her gaze away and said coolly, \"He won’t let me down, because this time he’s not doing it for me—he’s doing it for himself. I’m nothing more than his stepping stone, but I’m not afraid of shouldering that. Heh. At this point, with how far things have gone between me and her, I’m not afraid of adding a little more hatred to the mix.\"","Lu Zhi wants to move against Ye Wangchuan, but he can’t afford the anger and hatred he’d face from Qiao Nian if he touches Ye Wangchuan."]},{"number":3904,"title":"Chapter 3904: Zhui Guang Won’t Make It Back Tomorrow","paragraphs":["But she was different; she and Qiao Nian had long reached a point of no return.","Whether Qiao Nian hated her a little more or a little less, it was all the same to her.","What Lu Zhi needed was exactly what she didn’t care about.","And their goals largely aligned.","Collaborating for profit was the most solid partnership for them.","Shadow had always been too emotional, unable to understand why she trusted Lu Zhi.","She doesn’t trust Lu Zhi; she trusts a man’s love and possessiveness!","**","Early spring was still cold.","On January 24th, Qiao Nian finally received news from Di Xicheng.","Someone discovered Di Xicheng at a supermarket on White Deer Lane, buying some daily necessities. The sharp-eyed supermarket owner recognized that his features resembled the person in the bounty photo that had recently sensationalized the entire illegal zone, so he secretly snapped a few shots of the man’s profile with his phone when he picked up items...","After taking the photos, the supermarket owner waited for the man to leave and quietly followed to observe where he settled.","Then he rushed to report to the Red Alliance, hoping to earn that lucrative reward.","Once Qiao Nian got the photos secretly taken by the owner, she immediately connected to the network and performed a computer 3D skeletal analysis, quickly confirming that the captured person was indeed Di Xicheng in disguise.","Early in the morning, she took Tattoo Arm and others to go capture him.","Qin Si and Guan Yan were left at home.","Ye Wangchuan initially said he would go with her, but Qiao Nian didn’t agree, leaving in haste and asking him to stay behind to help look after the Red Alliance headquarters and the injured Guan Yan...","...","Meanwhile.","In the top-floor office on the 33rd floor of Tian Chen Headquarters.","The 360° panoramic skylight provided a view over the entire scenery of the illegal zone; Lu Zhi sat alone by the window, gazing through the glass at the landscape below—the traffic flowed over viaducts, as if the illegal zone was lying at his feet.","\"Knock knock.\"","At that moment, someone knocked on the door outside.","Lu Zhi moved his gaze, his raven-black eyelashes slightly lowered, turning his wheelchair to face the door and said indifferently, \"Come in.\"","The person outside pushed the door open and entered.","It was Jian Jin’s assistant.","The assistant wore a fitted suit vest with a white shirt underneath, his hair meticulously groomed, his square face young and serious, with a very capable appearance.","He held a file, stopped in front of Lu Zhi, immediately lowered his head, not daring to make eye contact with Lu Zhi, and whispered, \"Mr. Lu, everything is ready.\"","While speaking, the assistant handed over the file he had brought, daring only to look at the shiny tips of the man’s leather shoes resting on the wheelchair throughout.","Lu Zhi looked at the folder in front of him for a long time without reacting.","It wasn’t until the assistant, seeing no one take it for a while and his hand was numb, dared to timidly raise his head and called him, \"Mr. Lu?\"","Lu Zhi finally expressionlessly reached out to take the file, untied the white string wrapped around it, and pulled out the report with his slender hands.","It was a complete surveillance record, precisely marking every minute and second of what the monitored person was doing.","Lu Zhi held two files in total, one of Qiao Nian, and the other was unexpectedly Ye Wangchuan!","He first reviewed the one about Qiao Nian.","Lu Zhi quickly scanned through it, raising his head slightly as if pondering, \"Are you sure she’s gone north with her group?\"","The assistant immediately replied, \"I am sure.\"","\"After receiving the message from the spy, I immediately contacted our people in the north and confirmed with them that Zhui Guang is in the north; judging by the time, she won’t be able to rush back by tomorrow.\""]},{"number":3905,"title":"Chapter 3905: I Never Tried, So Why Should I Give Up","paragraphs":["\"...\"","Lu Zhi clasped his fingers around the thin paper, his eyes flickering, uncertain what he was thinking.","After a long time, he opened the second document, lowered his gaze and carefully read it, then tightened his thin lips and again fell into prolonged silence.","The assistant didn’t know what he was thinking, nor did they dare to interrupt his thoughts at this time, forced to endure Lu Zhi’s intense pressure, hands neatly crossed in front, hoping this psychological torment would end soon.","Lu Zhi had already discussed everything with the empress, hadn’t he? Everything is now unfolding according to their plan, so why isn’t Lu Zhi giving the order?","The assistant, after all, was not Jian Jin and didn’t understand Lu Zhi’s character.","They didn’t know what Lu Zhi was hesitating about, only thinking this was the first time they had seen Lu Zhi so indecisive and unresolute.","After a long silence in the office, the assistant couldn’t help stretching their neck and speaking.","\"Lu Zhi?\"","Lu Zhi’s gaze focused into a beam and suddenly looked at them, asking an inexplicable question: \"If you like someone, what would you do?\"","The assistant was confused: \"Lu Zhi?\"","Lu Zhi’s face appeared emotionless: \"Answer me.\"","The assistant dared not meet his eyes, lowered their head and honestly said: \"If I really liked her, I would tell her, ask if she wants to be with me.\"","\"What if... you can’t bring yourself to say it...\" Lu Zhi asked again.","The assistant couldn’t help but glance at him: \"Uh... then maybe I don’t like her enough?\"","\"No!\" This time Lu Zhi firmly corrected them: \"You really like her!\"","\"...\"","The assistant felt they were about to go crazy.","They tentatively whispered: \"Lu Zhi has someone they like?\"","Lu Zhi didn’t answer.","They suddenly felt sympathy for Jian Jin, everyone in Tian Chen knew Assistant Jian had deep feelings for Lu Zhi, staying beside him for so long, and Lu Zhi had affection for someone else.","No wonder Assistant Jian left so decisively not long ago.","It turns out they were hurt by love.","Thinking of this, the assistant felt slightly more at ease amidst their chaotic mood, hesitantly said: \"If I can’t tell her, perhaps I would choose to watch from afar and bless her.\"","Lu Zhi showed a contemplative expression, then curled his lips, let out a disdainful sneer, placed his hand on his leg, and his sharp gaze fell on the assistant, coldly said: \"If you like them, chase them, if you can’t catch them, then take them. What’s blessing them? If you can bless them, is that still liking?\"","\"...\"","The assistant was taken aback by his words, actually feeling slightly persuaded.","Lu Zhi turned his wheelchair facing toward the direction of the floor-to-ceiling window, his gaze once again fixed on the elevated bridge outside, watching the fleeting vehicles.","He softly said: \"Humans are animals by nature, liking is about possession, that is animal instinct. A man who can bless from afar only shows he’s too weak, not even daring to take!\"","The assistant looked at the back of his head, unsure how to respond.","Immediately, he heard Lu Zhi’s low voice again: \"Why give up when I haven’t tried!\"","**","Elsewhere.","Shadow finished a call from Tian Chen, quickly walked over to Nie Qingru and cautiously reported: \"Empress, Lu Zhi is preparing to act. What about us?\"","\"Heh.\" The darkness in Nie Qingru’s eyes disappeared in an instant, elegantly adjusting the scarf around her neck, indifferently said: \"Let’s prepare too.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shadow turned to leave to make arrangements.","Nie Qingru suddenly said behind him: \"Tell our people to listen to Lu Zhi this time, don’t touch that nuisance and Red Alliance’s Guan Yan. As for the others... tell them if Lu Zhi’s people don’t act, they can act on his behalf at the critical moment.\""]},{"number":3906,"title":"Chapter 3906: Sister Nian Arrives in the North","paragraphs":["Shadow turned around, understood her meaning, and respectfully lowered his eyes, saying, \"Empress, rest assured. Ye Wangchuan has repeatedly hindered our plans, he should pay the price!\"","\"It’s just the Ye family from Beijing...\" Shadow had his own considerations, very worriedly brought up to Nie Qingru: \"The family concepts in Beijing are strong, the Ye family may not be willing to let it go easily.\"","The illegal zone is known as a lawless area, where anyone who comes here and runs into trouble cannot seek revenge outside.","This is a rule tacitly accepted by the major continents, powers, and families.","He mainly worried that by then the Ye family would not follow this unwritten rule and relentlessly pursue them.","The Ye family might not be able to harm them fundamentally, but relying on Ye Maoshan’s prestige and status, if they insist on a fight to the death, it would cause them considerable trouble.","Smith Bank still has to do business, with such large daily transactions, they cannot afford to lose any continent.","The empress wanting to deal with Ye Wangchuan is tantamount to uprooting the Ye family.","The Ye family would find it hard not to retaliate.","Nie Qingru listened to him finish, didn’t even bother to lift her eyelids, and disdainfully shifted the responsibility onto Lu Zhi: \"They are not fools, they will naturally investigate the true cause of Ye Wangchuan’s death. Once they find the real culprit, they naturally won’t trouble me, the ’scapegoat’.\"","\"Besides, our two families are in-laws, even if they know I was involved a lot, so what?\"","\"Isn’t Qiao Nian Ye Wangchuan’s fiancée? In their grief, they would transfer that resentment onto Qiao Nian, after all, if it weren’t for her being such a great fiancée, how would the dignified Young Master Ye from Beijing get into such a situation? As an elder, I only need to perfectly hide and watch them be torn apart by these entanglements of love and hate...\"","Ye Maoshan can only retaliate against one person, it is impossible for him to have the energy to deal with two ’enemies’ at once.","With her having the connection with Qiao Nian, even if the two families are not close, under such circumstances, Ye Maoshan would not choose to retaliate against her.","\"So don’t give him a chance to live!\"","\"Yes, Empress.\"","Shadow said no more, retreated to quickly make arrangements.","**","The storm was brewing in the illegal zone.","However, the atmosphere at the Red Alliance headquarters was good, and no one was aware of the imminent danger.","Guan Yan and Mo Xi were still chatting casually about business and local customs in Continent F and Continent M.","Both of them were people who traveled all over the world.","Before, they hadn’t chatted together, and were not familiar with each other.","After spending a few days together, Guan Yan found that she had quite a lot of common topics with Mo Xi, and Mo Xi could dabble a bit in everything.","And she happened to be the same kind of person, so the two chatted about everything under the sun, and during their conversations, they could even exchange tips about their work.","Mo Xi had a lot of authority, and given her relationship with Qiao Nian, whenever Guan Yan brought something up, Mo Xi generously indicated he could help or offer a portion of the profit to collaborate with Guan Yan.","Guan Yan was naturally delighted.","These past few days, she was making money hand over fist.","Qin Si watched with anxiousness, but fortunately, Mo Xi realized it later and specifically had a chat with him, stating that even he could see that Guan Yan only wanted to do business with him, without any other intentions.","Only then did Qin Si stop whistling around nearby whenever they were talking.","...","At noon, Qiao Nian arrived in the northern part of the illegal zone.","They were in no rush to immediately find someone, but first booked a hotel, letting Tattoo Arm scout around before preparing to capture someone.","While Tattoo Arm was scouting, she took a shower in the hotel room, changed into a bathrobe, and dried her hair."]},{"number":3907,"title":"Chapter 3907: Master Wang Still Understands Chen Chen","paragraphs":["After she finished doing all that.","It was already afternoon in the north, the sky outside was filled with a fiery sunset.","Qiao Nian picked up her phone, walked to the window, took a photo, and sent it to the contact pinned on her WhatsApp.","Soon, a video call came from the WhatsApp contact named Y.","Qiao Nian smiled, her fair face relaxed as she swiped her finger to answer.","The dark screen soon connected, revealing Ye Wangchuan’s excessively handsome face on the screen, with the background showing a room.","Qiao Nian coughed once and started the conversation: \"Why didn’t you go out?\"","Ye Wangchuan pulled out a chair and sat down: \"Waiting for you to come home.\"","Qiao Nian’s ears warmed slightly, not looking at him, she said softly: \"I’m not going back so soon, if things go smoothly, maybe the day after tomorrow. If not... it’ll take more time.\"","Ye Wangchuan smiled slightly: \"No worries, I’ll wait for you.\"","Qiao Nian didn’t know what to say.","She’s not someone who’s being in a relationship, so she fell silent, thinking about finding a topic to discuss.","The person on the other side of the video seemed to know her thoughts like an old friend. With just a glance and hesitant expression, he could see her mind.","Qiao Nian didn’t have to rack her brains for a conversation because he naturally brought it up: \"Tattoo Arm? He’s not at the hotel.\"","\"He went to the supermarket to get news.\" Qiao Nian relaxed and answered easily.","Ye Wangchuan immediately asked: \"Have you eaten yet?\"","Qiao Nian glanced at the fiery sky outside, regretting not watching it with him. Distracted by this thought, she replied absent-mindedly: \"Um? Ah... no...\"","Ye Wangchuan’s voice was rich and smooth: \"Send me your hotel address.\"","\"?\"","Qiao Nian instinctively backed out, pursed her lips, and shared her location with him.","After about two minutes, she heard the composed man on the other end say: \"I ordered food for you, the hotel room service will deliver it, remember to answer the door.\"","It turned out he wanted the hotel address to order food for her.","Qiao Nian felt warmth in her heart, turned and walked inside, speaking as she went: \"Chen Chen’s birthday is coming soon, after I’m done here, let’s go back together.\"","\"Alright.\" Ye Wangchuan replied casually, paused, and then added: \"It’s just a child’s birthday, don’t worry too much.\"","Qiao Nian glanced at him, knowing the child’s psychology well: \"You tell Chen Chen, he’s agitating to cut his hair again.\"","\"Then let him go.\" Ye Wangchuan chuckled, his expression refined and darkly charming, raised an eyebrow, his eyes deep: \"I’ll tell him, unless he shaves it completely, it’s not sincere enough. Besides, you... prefer men with hair.\"","Qiao Nian: \"...\"","Ye Wangchuan was just joking with her, seeing her speechless, he stopped at the right moment, his thin lips curved, speaking softly: \"If God Qiao doesn’t return soon, I’ll want to come find you.\"","Qiao Nian took her backpack from the bedside, preparing to take out her notebook, but paused at his words: \"I seemed... to have just left.\"","\"Yes, a day feels like three autumns apart. Now it’s been half a day, it feels like I’ve waited for a year and a half.\" Ye Wangchuan said with no hesitation.","Qiao Nian looked at his outstanding features, and the clearly raised corners of his mouth, knowing he was teasing her, still felt her heartbeat quicken, lowering her eyelids: \"I... never mind, I’ll be back soon.\"","...","Qiao Nian hung up the video with Ye Wangchuan, set aside her mood, and focused on her work."]},{"number":3908,"title":"Chapter 3908: Sister Nian’s Sixth Sense at Work","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian began using the network in the north to investigate the whereabouts of Di Xicheng, calculating how to cast the net to ensure that nothing goes wrong, preventing him from escaping again.","When she works, she’s extremely focused, yet her demeanor still exudes the usual laid-back and devil-may-care attitude. Her gaze remained on the rapidly moving codes on the screen, fingers tapping the keyboard, one leg stretched, the other lazily bent, a nonchalant expression on her face, with eyes dark as ever...","After 10 minutes, Qiao Nian pushed the keyboard away, picked up the phone on the table, and called Tattoo Arm.","\"Beep.\"","Tattoo Arm answered immediately: \"Zhui Guang.\"","Qiao Nian, leaning lazily against the armrest of her chair, asked: \"Have you reached that supermarket? What did the boss say?\"","\"The boss handed over his phone to me. I’m preparing to bring it back so you can check if he tampered with the videos.\" Tattoo Arm replied crisply and efficiently.","Qiao Nian agreed with a sound, then said: \"You guys come back first.\"","Tattoo Arm responded with a sound, seemingly turned back to explain something to someone beside him, as Qiao Nian heard noise from his end.","After a while, Tattoo Arm returned and reported: \"I’ve already told them to get in the car.\"","Qiao Nian heard the sound of a door closing on the other end.","She thought for a moment: \"Drive slowly on the way.\"","\"Okay, Zhui Guang.\"","Tattoo Arm responded softly to her concern.","...","Qiao Nian quickly put the phone back, her gaze drifted once more to the computer.","The computer screen displayed numerous tracks of Di Xicheng’s activities in the north. These traces seemed to suddenly emerge overnight.","Previously, I hadn’t been able to trace Di Xicheng at all.","However, since the supermarket boss appeared and provided a clue, I found the investigation going unusually smoothly... so smoothly that Qiao Nian couldn’t help but suspect if someone was deliberately ’helping’ her behind the scenes.","Qiao Nian pursed her lips, raised her hand, and pressed it against her heart.","Under her palm, her heartbeat was strong and rhythmic, thud—thud—thud—clear, yet she felt an inexplicable sense of restlessness.","——Which part went wrong?","Qiao Nian half-closed her weary eyes, unable to pinpoint any issues or understand where her agitation stemmed from.","She rested her hand on her knee, half-closing her eyes, temporarily giving up on delving deeper.","**","The night in the illegal zone always arrives especially early.","Around six-thirty in the evening, the fiery clouds gradually disappeared, as the sky began to be shrouded in darkness...","Red Alliance headquarters.","Mo Xi didn’t come today.","Qiao Nian and Tattoo Arm were also in the north.","Inside the white mansion, only Guan Yan, Qin Si, Ji Lin, and Ye Wangchuan were residing.","Guan Yan woke up from a nap and found it was already dark outside.","She draped on a jacket and pushed the door open, seeing Ji Lin and Qin Si busy preparing dinner, the air filled with molecules of the fragrance.","She couldn’t help but twitch her nose and grabbed the passing man: \"What are you guys cooking? Smells so good.\"","Qin Si still held an exquisite porcelain plate, his eyelids lowered at her words, lips curling: \"My craftsmanship. You’ll know soon enough.\"","Seeing his mysterious demeanor, Guan Yan clicked her tongue and let go.","Qin Si called to her softly: \"You go wash your hands first, just sit at the dining table and wait. It’ll be ready soon.\"","\"Oh.\" Guan Yan slightly averted her gaze, hiding her momentary heartbeat.","Qin Si, busy with the kitchen and also grabbing dishes, didn’t notice her momentary emotional shift, and watched Guan Yan obediently go to wash her hands, then walk towards the dining room.","Assured, he dove back into the kitchen."]},{"number":3909,"title":"Chapter 3909: Qin Si: Discussing Wedding Dates","paragraphs":["Only Ye Wangchuan had just finished a call and came over to the restaurant.","Guan Yan greeted him and pulled out a chair to sit down.","Qin Si and the others were still waiting, so it was just the two of them in the restaurant for now. Guan Yan couldn’t sit still after a while.","She turned her head to look at the night outside the window to break the silence, forcing a conversation: \"It seems darker unusually early today.\"","\"Really?\" The man sitting across from her looked at the sky outside, his superior jawline akin to God’s masterpiece.","Guan Yan glanced and retracted her gaze, worried: \"I wonder how things are going on Zhui Guang’s side.\"","Ye Wangchuan also withdrew his gaze from the window, his eyes falling on her. Seeing Guan Yan’s somewhat unhealthy pale complexion, he said gently: \"I just called her, she and Tattoo Arm have reached the north.\"","Guan Yan couldn’t help asking: \"Then Di Xicheng...\"","\"He’s still being chased.\" Ye Wangchuan crossed his hands on the table, leaning back casually, his whole demeanor lean and charming: \"It will take some time.\"","\"...\" Guan Yan pressed her lips, seemingly not asking further, but she was worried about Qiao Nian’s safety.","Just as the two exchanged a few words shortly.","Qin Si and Ji Lin came over with trays from the kitchen.","Qin Si, placing the steaming steaks in front of the two respectively, curiously asked Ye Wangchuan: \"Master Wang, what were you guys talking about just now.\"","He served Guan Yan first, then Ye Wangchuan.","Not waiting for Ye Wangchuan’s answer, he continued: \"I think I heard you say you need time... need time for what? You or Sister Qiao. Oh! Are you saying your marriage needs time?\"","Guan Yan gave him a fierce glare, almost cursing out loud: Dumbass!","But she remembered that this person had once recklessly stormed into the dark prison to find her, and clenched the knife and fork in her hand, suppressing the momentary speechlessness Qin Si provoked, brutally dividing the steak on her plate.","...She endured!","Qin Si still felt he guessed right, turned to glance at her and curiously asked: \"You’re hungry so early today? Didn’t eat enough at noon?\"","He didn’t notice the darkness on Guan Yan’s face as it turned black, then turned back to talk to Ye Wangchuan giddily: \"Alright, Master Wang, when you guys get married, I’ll give you a big red envelope!\"","\"...\" Ji Lin silently found a place to sit down, directly ignoring his foolish demeanor.","He didn’t know what Master Wang had just discussed with Guan Yan, but he was sure it wasn’t what Young Master Qin had mentioned.","Qin Si cheerfully sat beside Ye Wangchuan, patted his shoulder like a buddy: \"So, Sister Qiao agreed to your proposal? When did you propose? How come you didn’t inform me? Tell me in advance, so I can give you some advice to make it romantic.\"","\"Stay away from me.\" Ye Wangchuan pinched the hand resting on his shoulder with two fingers, the obvious disgust showing on his expressionless face.","\"Why?\" Qin Si was unwilling: \"Why?\"","Before he could dramatically lament, he heard the man’s merciless voice: \"I’m allergic to fools.\"","Qin Si: \"When did you... wait, damn it! How could you curse me???\"","Guan Yan couldn’t hold back and stuffed a piece of steak in her mouth, chewing as she mumbled: \"You deserve it!\"","Qin Si, still confused, glanced at her again, sheepishly touched his nose, with a very wronged expression: \"You’re all targeting me.\"","However, none of the people present paid attention to him, all ignoring his grievance, causing Qin Si to become increasingly depressed and puzzled."]},{"number":3910,"title":"Chapter 3910: Did You Notice Something Strange Tonight?","paragraphs":["Why is everyone targeting him?","He was just concerned about Master Wang and Sister Qiao’s wedding location and wanted to offer some romantic suggestions, is that wrong?","If that’s wrong, then his mistake is being too damn nice.","Qin Si seems to have found an excuse.","Looking around at everyone ignoring him, he became more convinced that these people were just damn jealous of his good looks and kind heart, envious of such a handsome guy like him.","At this meal, only Qin Si’s world ended up wounded.","Guan Yan, however, was satisfied after the meal and patted his belly, unable to help but ask: \"Did you study culinary arts in Beijing?\"","The Western food he made was quite delicious.","Qin Si had been frustrated ever since, and hearing this made him even more exasperated as he looked at her, blurting out: \"Young master studied finance, finance!\"","\"Have you considered changing your career?\" Guan Yan asked with a serious face.","Qin Si: \"...\"","\"Have you really thought about it?\" Guan Yan propped up her chin.","Qin Si felt like he couldn’t stay any longer. He got up, intending to help Ji Lin clean up the mess, leaving a sentence: \"Even if you change careers, I won’t!\"","Guan Yan watched his departing figure regretfully. Just as she was about to turn back, she heard Ye Wangchuan’s deep voice: \"It’s too quiet outside tonight.\"","Guan Yan looked out the window at the pitch-black surroundings: \"Is it?\"","Ye Wangchuan said nothing.","Guan Yan furrowed her brows, suddenly realizing something was wrong. Her expression became serious as she quickly turned to the man who spoke: \"...There’s no sound of insects outside.\"","The illegal zone is in a subtropical region.","The temperature remains around 20° year-round.","Even in the coldest winter, there is a local insect that makes a vibrating sound with its wings at night.","They used to hear these sounds every night.","Guan Yan herself didn’t really mind.","But she remembered when Qiao Nian came to the illegal zone once, she stayed at the headquarters. At night, when Qiao Nian couldn’t sleep, she encountered her coming down for a drink. She specifically asked why the boss wasn’t sleeping.","Guan Yan remembered Qiao Nian said it was too noisy outside.","Later, she learned that Zhui Guang had severe insomnia, and even a little noise outside could keep her awake...","Guan Yan recalled that she had discussed with Slim Waist Control about buying some insecticide to spray the lawn outside the next time Zhui Guang came.","Tonight, everything seemed normal, yet the insects outside were silent.","Guan Yan, with her rich wilderness experience, quickly realized the most likely reason— insects are highly alert creatures that hide themselves to survive in unsafe environments.","There are people nearby! Only at such times do insects become especially silent.","Guan Yan looked at Ye Wangchuan and saw the man, who first noticed this unusual difference, lower his long eyelashes to hide the coldness in his eyes. He reached for the phone on the table and spoke to her in a low voice: \"Don’t alert the enemy just yet.\"","\"I’ll notify Mo Xi.\"","He began to call Mo Xi.","Guan Yan got up to return to her room: \"I’ll call someone over too.\"","But Ye Wangchuan stopped her: \"Don’t go.\"","Guan Yan turned back in confusion: \"Why?\" Isn’t it more convenient for her to call someone here in the illegal zone?","\"This is the Red Alliance headquarters.\"","\"So what?\" Guan Yan still didn’t understand, what does this have to do with her calling someone?","Ye Wangchuan’s slender fingers held the phone, his tall body leaning back in the chair as if he had a magical ability to make people believe that with him here, there’s no worry, his eyes indifferent and profound."]},{"number":3911,"title":"Chapter 3911: What Are We Waiting For? Let’s Get Moving","paragraphs":["\"Is there anyone in the illegal zone who doesn’t know what this place represents? Then why do you think they came here, knowing full well where this is?\"","\"...\"","Ye Wangchuan spoke each word clearly, yet his tone carried an accidental coldness: \"Who in the illegal zone could have the guts to target the Red Alliance?\"","Guan Yan felt as if a bucket of ice water was dumped over her head, chills running from the soles of her feet upwards, her spine enveloped by a chilling cold.","She wasn’t foolish; on the contrary, she was quite clever, having seen more of the world than most women, and quickly grasped the meaning behind Ye Wangchuan’s words: \"Are you saying... Tian Chen?\"","\"Impossible! How could Tian Chen...\" She instinctively rejected the idea.","Lu Zhi liked Zhui Guang, and everyone knew that except Zhui Guang.","Lu Zhi would have to be crazy to target Zhui Guang.","Unless...","Guan Yan widened her eyes again, looking at Ye Wangchuan sitting there, an epiphany dawning: \"Does he want to target you?\"","Ye Wangchuan said nothing.","At this moment, silence was the answer.","Guan Yan couldn’t describe the feeling in her heart at that moment, only thinking that Lu Zhi was insane, yet his actions seemed logical.","Her first reaction was: \"I will call Zhui Guang immediately.\"","At this point, Ye Wangchuan had already put down his phone, curling his distinct knuckles; he had clearly just called Mo Xi.","His sharp, cold face was composed and energetic, his deep black eyes were calm and restrained: \"No need, our signal has been cut off.\"","**","Outside.","Five kilometers outside the Red Alliance, snipers to close combat specialists had all arrived.","Many of them were familiar faces on the black market, ranking high on dangerous lists of various countries, carrying extremely high danger levels.","These dangerous individuals, hard to see gathered together, were now assembled outside the Red Alliance headquarters, each bowing and scraping submissively before the young man.","\"Mr. Lu.\" A man with a thick beard and thick glasses bowed and scraped before Lu Zhi, saying quietly: \"We have already cut off communications inside.\"","The young man referred to as Mr. Lu sat in a wheelchair, a dark gray blanket covering his knees, hiding his legs, yet his shoe tips were visible on the wheelchair.","He was not a sound person.","Such a young and handsome man, yet a cripple, would evoke regret and pity from anyone who saw him.","However, in the illegal zone, no one dared to do so.","Only because this crippled man was called Lu Zhi.","Brutally skilled, with a dark heart.","Within a mere decade, he had led a newly emerged force to swallow up numerous old guard families in the illegal zone, becoming the absolute KING.","Lu Zhi had long been the crowned king here.","The only one who could challenge him was Zhui Guang, but Zhui Guang dealt in technology, and was a low-key and mysterious figure, rarely seen in person.","Moreover, both Tian Chen and Red Alliance maintained excellent relations, the two bosses were private friends... who would have thought good friends might one day turn against each other.","Like now... Lu Zhi was actually targeting Zhui Guang’s base!","The technicians from Tian Chen dared not raise their heads, much less look closely at the expression on this big boss’s face, only lowering their voices to report: \"They are unable to contact the outside now... if anyone tries to make a call, they would quickly find there’s no signal.\"","Beside Lu Zhi stood Shadow and a dozen others from the reclusive family, all trusted aides brought over from Continent M by Nie Qingru.","These aides, having long been by Nie Qingru’s side, held prominent positions in Continent M, accustomed to a transcendent status.","Upon hearing the technician’s words, they interjected before Lu Zhi could speak: \"What are we waiting for, let’s act quickly!\""]},{"number":3912,"title":"Chapter 3912: He Is a Pure Madman","paragraphs":["Shadow’s heart skipped a beat, immediately looking towards Lu Zhi.","Lu Zhi’s expression remained as indifferent as always, with his hand resting on his leg, showing no hint of emotional fluctuation, as if he hadn’t heard the man speak.","Shadow’s heart involuntarily sank, he opened his mouth: \"Lu Zhi...\"","He still had time to plead.","The young man sitting in the wheelchair slightly raised his eyelids, still looking straight ahead, completely ignoring them, and instructed the personal bodyguard pushing his wheelchair.","\"Know my rules?\"","The bodyguard behind him stood at 2 meters tall, with a burly physique akin to a moving mountain, nodded solemnly upon hearing the words: \"I know.\"","Lu Zhi raised his hand and softly said, \"Take him away.\"","\"Yes.\"","The bodyguard released his hand and walked straight to the man who had interrupted, who looked at him with a fearful and anxious expression, questioning him: \"What are you doing?\"","The bodyguard pursed his lips, like a mute, stretched out his long arm, grabbed him by the collar, and walked him to a less crowded place.","\"What are you doing! I’m from the reclusive family!\"","\"Let me go! How dare you touch me!\"","\"Lord Shadow, help me!\"","The towering bodyguard dragged the struggling man as if holding a chick; no matter how much he flailed, he couldn’t escape from the bodyguard’s grip.","Shadow listened to the man’s cries for help, subconsciously furrowed his brow, and just started to speak to the person in the wheelchair: \"Lu Zhi, he...\"","He hadn’t finished his sentence when a gunshot rang out.","\"Bang!\"","Shadow abruptly turned his head, seeing the man who was struggling earlier getting shot in the head by Lu Zhi’s personal bodyguard. The toweringly tall man didn’t blink while releasing his grip, allowing the breathless man’s body to slide to the ground. He wiped his hands with a piece of paper, turned silently back to Lu Zhi’s side, and said in a low voice, \"Sir, it’s done.\"","\"Mm.\"","Lu Zhi responded quietly, not turning his head, looked politely at Shadow as if finally noticing him, and with a slightly apologetic tone said calmly, \"Sorry, dealt with a rule-breaker for you.\"","He even smiled and asked, \"The empress won’t mind, will she?\"","Shadow, initially stunned, gradually calmed down, then faced Lu Zhi’s eyes that openly smiled but held no warmth.","He forcibly controlled his face’s twitching muscles, clenched his fist, held back the humiliation in his heart at that moment, and nodded to the other party: \"Lu Zhi, please go ahead.\"","\"That’s good.\"","Lu Zhi stowed away his smile, took a clean white handkerchief from his pocket, and began to wipe his fingers, which were slender and elegant, proportionate as if extremely soft.","He didn’t look at Shadow or the other members of the reclusive family, his long eyelashes drooped down, hiding the harshness in his eyes, his tone cold and forlorn.","\"I don’t like others interrupting, especially in front of me. That’s the rule. You didn’t know before, but now you should.\"","Having said that, he just finished wiping his left hand.","Everyone watched as he dropped the used handkerchief to the ground, rolled his wheelchair over it, the once clean handkerchief quickly soiled completely.","Lu Zhi seemed to greatly appreciate this violent aesthetic, glanced around at the people Shadow brought: \"Everyone, you may speak now.\"","The members of the reclusive family looked at each other, glancing back and forth, their mouths seemed sealed shut, no one dared to speak.","You must be joking.","Their companion’s bloody scent was still permeating the air.","Who would dare to cross Lu Zhi?","Lu Zhi chuckled lightly, seeming in a good mood: \"Why, now I’ve given you a chance to speak and you’re quiet? If you really don’t say anything, I’ll assume you have no objections.\""]},{"number":3913,"title":"Chapter 3913: Zhui Guang, the Key","paragraphs":["Shadow stepped forward at this moment: \"Lu Zhi, since the technician has already cut off the signal inside, in order to keep those inside from noticing, we should act quickly...\"","This was what the others wanted to say but dared not to.","Lu Zhi glanced back at him.","Shadow met his gaze for a moment, unwavering, firmly stating: \"This is also the cooperation you agreed upon with the empress.\"","Lu Zhi’s eyes were expressionless, he looked down and said: \"Let’s wait another ten minutes.\"","Shadow frowned deeply, holding his breath to remind him: \"Ye Wangchuan is not someone easy to deal with. If he becomes aware, it’ll be hard for us to succeed.\"","Yet Lu Zhi paid no mind to the voice of opposition: \"I know what I’m doing, just ten minutes.\"","He was waiting for an answer.","**","Meanwhile.","In the northern part of the illegal zone.","Tattoo Arm brought the phone back to the hotel and handed it directly to Qiao Nian. Qiao Nian had just connected the phone to a data cable, preparing to check the original files of those few photographs.","At this moment, her phone lit up.","Qiao Nian was focused on her task and didn’t pay attention to the screen’s light.","However, Tattoo Arm, who stood beside her, noticed the lit screen and told her: \"Zhui Guang, you have a new message.\"","Qiao Nian’s rhythm was interrupted, somewhat irritated, she looked away from the computer, picked up her phone, and glanced at the screen to find a message from an unknown number.","A strong sense of unease surged in her heart once again.","Qiao Nian suddenly pulled her chair back, stood up, and said to Tattoo Arm: \"Wait. Let me check the message.\"","\"Okay.\" Tattoo Arm was still examining the photos she had transferred to her computer, not looking up.","Qiao Nian walked away, her pale white fingertips opened the anonymous text message, which simply stated – Ye Wangchuan will die.","Qiao Nian’s pupils constricted, heart stalling, her pitch-black eyes unblinking as she stared at those words. Her body instinctively reacted, turning swiftly to close the laptop, stuffing it into a shoulder bag, before immediately turning to instruct Tattoo Arm.","\"Get a car ready for me, I need to go back.\"","\"Huh?\" Tattoo Arm didn’t react immediately, his gaze swept past her towards the pitch-dark night outside the window, slightly puzzled: \"Zhui Guang, now?\"","Qiao Nian was packing her things as she dialed Ye Wangchuan’s number: \"Right now, immediately!\"","Tattoo Arm, always known for following orders, noticed her genuine urgency and went to arrange things straight away: \"Zhui Guang, what kind of car do you need?\"","\"A supercar.\" Qiao Nian replied without hesitation.","Tattoo Arm hurriedly said: \"I’ll have someone bring one over right away.\"","With that, he opened the door and went quickly to make arrangements.","Qiao Nian waited in the room for a dozen seconds when a mechanical female voice came from the other end of the phone: \"Sorry, the number you have dialed is currently unavailable. Please try again later...\"","Qiao Nian hung up before the recording finished, then found the internal line for the Red Alliance headquarters and dialed in.","\"Beep beep...\" This time it connected.","But quickly the same mechanical voice returned: \"Sorry, the number you have dialed is currently unavailable, please try again later.\"","Qiao Nian was now fifty percent sure that the message she received was not just a simple scare but a warning or perhaps a ’warning’?","She couldn’t immediately determine who sent the message or why?","She just grabbed her shoulder bag and rushed outside the hotel, calling Tattoo Arm to hurry, to be even faster.","Outside the hotel.","Tattoo Arm had already arranged for a dark blue supercar to be parked below, the driver inside got out and handed over the keys: \"Zhui Guang.\""]},{"number":3914,"title":"Chapter 3914: Survival Instincts in Front of Lu Zhi","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian couldn’t wait to take it, opened the car door and got in, tossing her shoulder bag onto the passenger seat.","Tattoo Arm stood outside the passenger side, looking worriedly at the girl inside fastening her seatbelt, and said in a low voice, \"Zhui Guang, are you sure you don’t want me to go back with you?\"","\"No need, you stay here.\"","\"But it’s too dangerous for you to go back alone. Why don’t I come with you? I can be a helping hand.\" Tattoo Arm rarely showed concern.","Qiao Nian fastened her seatbelt, turned the car key, gripped the steering wheel to try out the feel, without even lifting her eyelids: \"I need you to stay here and help me catch Di Xicheng.\"","\"But...\"","\"I also need you to contact Jian Jin and ask her what exactly is happening at the Red Alliance headquarters.\"","\"Okay.\"","\"Call me back when you find out.\"","Qiao Nian pressed the accelerator, and the deep blue sports car shot out like lightning into the night, quickly disappearing down the road.","She preferred Jeeps and other large cars, which drove more neatly and looked cooler, but she was racing against time, and nothing could be faster than a supercar.","Tattoo Arm watched the sports car vanish into the night, walking back while making various calls, and according to Qiao Nian’s arrangements, made a call to Jian Jin, far off in the East.","...","\"You said the Red Alliance headquarters? Jiang Yao asked you to inquire with me? That’s odd, what could possibly happen at the headquarters? Who would have the audacity to cause trouble at the Red Alliance headquarters?\"","Tattoo Arm was left dizzy by her seven or eight consecutive rhetorical questions, and despite being unskillful with words, he managed to utter: \"I’m not sure either, Zhui Guang asked me to call Miss Jian.\"","\"... Alright.\" Jian Jin probably sensed his ’pain’ and restrained herself, saying: \"Wait a moment, I’ll get up right away and send someone to check.\"","Tattoo Arm was filled with gratitude: \"Thank you, Miss Jian.\"","Jian Jin waved away his thanks grandly: \"My relationship with your Zhui Guang is well-known, no need to thank me.\"","\"Still, thank you.\"","Jian Jin didn’t continue to quibble over the thanks, and straightforwardly said: \"Wait for me, I’ll call back once I find out.\"","She hung up the phone, got up, and draped on a robe, went downstairs to get a cup for water, while contacting her people in the illegal zone to make a phone call to inquire.","Initially, Jian Jin didn’t take the matter too seriously, doubting that anything could happen to the Red Alliance, thinking Qiao Nian just had a sudden whim and wanted her to see why they weren’t answering the phone.","When she received the feedback from her contacts, Jian Jin put down the water cup, her unconcerned expression gradually replaced by seriousness.","She quickly sent a message back to Tattoo Arm—[The area around the Red Alliance headquarters has been locked down by someone, my people haven’t yet found out who did it.]","After editing and sending the message successfully, she returned to her room, changed clothes, and decided to go check it out in person, to see who dared to dance on a grave.","**","Meanwhile.","When Tattoo Arm received the message, someone at the hotel also sent out a text message.","kilometers outside the Red Alliance headquarters.","The cold wind hit everyone’s face, yet no one dared to complain of hardship and fatigue, just because the person who had been brutally executed earlier was still lying there, not yet carried away.","Everyone knew that Lu Zhi was definitely not as mild and easygoing as he appeared; his seemingly gentle and harmless manner masked a ruthlessness beyond imagination.","In front of such a person, survival became everyone’s instinctive desire."]},{"number":3915,"title":"Chapter 3915: He Tests Qiao Nian’s Reaction in Ten Minutes","paragraphs":["The confidants of Nie Qingru brought by Shadow finally understood why so many people on the blacklist were acting so subservient in front of Lu Zhi.","They weren’t afraid of Lu Zhi’s power.","They were afraid of how crazy Lu Zhi was, enough to do anything.","\"8 minutes have passed.\" Shadow glanced at the time on his wristwatch.","Lu Zhi didn’t even bother to blink, responding leisurely: \"Aren’t there 2 minutes left?\"","Shadow couldn’t help but ask: \"Can you tell me, what exactly are you waiting for?\"","He thought Lu Zhi might not bother to answer him.","But who knew Lu Zhi would pull on the blanket draped over his legs and slightly curl his lips: \"Waiting for someone.\"","\"?\"","At first, Shadow was puzzled, but soon his face changed dramatically as if he’d realized something, reacting intensely: \"Are you talking about Zhui Guang?\"","Zhui Guang is coming?","Isn’t she in the north?","Ever since losing to Qiao Nian a few times, Shadow had developed a conditioned reflex that made his heart race almost out of his chest.","He couldn’t control the surge of anxiety, furrowed his brows, and nervously confirmed with Lu Zhi: \"Has she returned?\"","\"...\" Lu Zhi didn’t speak, only looking at the phone in his hand, his head down, unmoved by external distractions.","Shadow couldn’t stand the atmosphere any longer and immediately said: \"That shouldn’t be possible; even if she rushed back immediately, she wouldn’t make it in time.\"","He looked at Lu Zhi, seemingly wanting to dissect his heart to know what Lu Zhi was thinking.","Just then.","Lu Zhi’s phone rang abruptly.","In such a quiet and tense environment, this ringtone was extremely prominent, instantly drawing everyone’s attention.","Lu Zhi answered: \"Hello.\"","Although it wasn’t clear what was said on the other end, the light in his eyes extinguished.","Then Shadow and the others heard him say: \"She left everything behind without hesitation and drove away?\"","\"Yes.\" Came the brief reply from the other end.","\"Heh.\"","Lu Zhi looked down and smiled inexplicably, but no one thought he was smiling out of happiness.","\"Alright, I know.\"","Putting down the phone, Lu Zhi looked at Shadow and the others again, saying slowly: \"Looking at it this way, he truly deserves to die!\"","He was waiting for an answer.","He gave Qiao Nian ten minutes to answer.","As long as within those ten minutes, Qiao Nian didn’t leave the hotel because of the message, he would give Ye Wangchuan a chance to live.","But obviously, he placed his bets and lost.","For an unknown message, Qiao Nian didn’t hesitate to abandon the opportunity to catch Di Xicheng and rushed back.","— Just for this, Ye Wangchuan must die!","There was no longer any trace of hesitation in Lu Zhi’s eyes, only a coldness colder than the Arctic ice fields, commanding the bodyguard behind him: \"Do it.\"","**","Inside a house 5 kilometers away from Lu Zhi.","Guan Yan was on the rooftop, using a telescope to monitor every move of those several kilometers away.","When she saw through the telescope that Lu Zhi and the others began to take action, her expression slightly changed, and she immediately pressed the micro intercom in her ear and told the people below: \"Young Master Ye, they’ve made a move. What should we do next?\"","Qiao Nian wasn’t there.","Ye Wangchuan had become the backbone.","The man in the living room downstairs glanced at the night outside, which appeared quiet without any suspicious signs, holding a weapon in one hand and pressing the intercom switch with the other to tell Guan Yan: \"Wait for my command.\"","\"Alright.\"","Guan Yan’s gaze slightly darkened, not fearing the lurking danger in the dark."]},{"number":3916,"title":"Chapter 3916: The Entire Road Is Blocked Off","paragraphs":["Instead, like she remembered something, she suddenly said to Ye Wangchuan, \"Young Master Ye, Qin Si, he...\"","She didn’t care about herself.","Grew up in the illegal zone.","Encountered wind and rain since childhood, brushed shoulders with death countless times, and mocked death’s incompetence.","She wasn’t afraid of dying, even looked forward to playing a thrilling game with her life. Previously, facing these situations alone didn’t matter, but now she felt that someone shouldn’t face such danger.","Guan Yan hesitated for a moment but remained true to her inner feelings, whispering a plea, \"I’m not at liberty up there, please help take care of him for me.\"","Ye Wangchuan, however, didn’t agree outright but said solemnly, \"Guan Yan, he’s a man.\"","\"...\"","\"Even if you’re up there, even if I tell him to hide, he wouldn’t listen to me.\"","Guan Yan’s eyes flickered slightly, remembering how Qin Si had barged into the dark prison and refused to leave, she burst out laughing, \"Exactly.\"","She figured it out, seemingly no longer troubled, looking into the darkness at the unknown number of lurking enemies, she said heartily, \"Then let’s give them hell!\"","...","The night is the best cover, all dangers love to hide within the night, just like the undispersible blackness that can mask all sins.","When Jian Jin sped all the way here, she was stopped 5 kilometers from the bungalow.","If it had been mere human roadblocks, she might have dashed forward recklessly... but Jian Jin noticed that besides the people blocking the way, the road was covered with speed bumps.","The cold, fierce spikes glistening with a ghostly light under the strong beams warned every vehicle wishing to force its way through—no passage here!","Jian Jin slammed on the brakes, the tires screeched against the ground as the sports car swerved left, crashing into a roadside tree.","The violent impact made many people notice the ’incident’ that happened here.","After the initial dizziness, Jian Jin gritted her teeth, unbuckled the seatbelt, grabbed a handgun from the car’s storage compartment, and got out.","Dressed in black from head to toe, she looked like a female demon stepping out of the smoking million-dollar sports car, without glancing at the damaged luxury car, she walked straight towards the crowd.","This was the perimeter.","Managed by a confidant of Nie Qingru, the rest were mainly Lu Zhi’s people.","These people were no strangers to Jian Jin.","When they saw Jian Jin getting out of the sports car and walking over, their expressions shifted slightly, showing signs of panic.","\"Who is she?\"","Only Nie Qingru’s confidant, who had long stayed in the territory of Continent M and hadn’t stepped into the illegal zone, didn’t recognize Jian Jin, looking at the woman driving in and getting out with a gun, was momentarily stunned.","\"Where did this woman come from? I’ll go take a look.\" He said as he grabbed the weapon beside him to approach Jian Jin.","Fortunately, a strong man who usually had a good relationship with Jian Jin held his hand, warning in a low voice, \"That’s Assistant Jian, our Mr. Lu’s friend. Put down your weapon!\"","Nie Qingru’s confidant broke into a cold sweat immediately, recalling Lu Zhi’s previous ruthless methods, he relented without arguing with the strong man and silently put down his weapon.","The strong man then removed his gaze from him, looked again at the approaching person, and went over to his companion, whispering, \"Hurry and inform Mr. Lu, tell him Assistant Jian is here, and ask if he wants to release the person.\"","\"Got it.\" That person also knew of Jian Jin and Lu Zhi’s relationship, glanced at Jian Jin, and hurriedly ran off to contact the people in the inner circle."]},{"number":3917,"title":"Chapter 3917: Where Is Lu Zhi? I Want to See Him!","paragraphs":["Jian Jin walked closer, step by step.","She was about to break through their blockade.","The burly man patted his cheeks, taking a deep breath, forced a smile, and stepped forward: \"Assistant Jian, why are you here? Who told you?\"","Jian Jin didn’t stop walking forward, nor did she spare him a glance, only coldly admonishing: \"Get out of the way!\"","The burly man felt bitter in his heart, bracing himself to block her way again, smiling apologetically: \"Assistant Jian, you can’t go in.\"","Jian Jin halted abruptly, her short hair sharp, her gaze coldly fixed on him: \"Oh? Why can’t I go in? What’s in there that can’t be seen?\"","She didn’t even give the burly man a chance to make excuses: \"If I remember correctly, that’s Zhui Guang’s territory inside. You’ve brought so many people and each carrying weapons, what do you intend to do?\"","Facing her aggressive questioning, the burly man dropped his head, avoiding eye contact with her, speaking with great difficulty: \"Assistant Jian, please don’t make it difficult for me. You know Mr. Lu’s temper, I’m just a person doing my job. Unless Mr. Lu agrees, if you ask me, I can only say I know nothing...\"","Jian Jin understood he was telling the truth.","She gathered her anger, pursing her lips: \"Where is Lu Zhi? I want to see him!\"","...","Lu Zhi came out to see her after getting the message and arranging matters inside.","Jian Jin waited by the roadside for a few minutes, finally seeing the man arriving late.","Lu Zhi was still in a wheelchair, looking the same as he did when she left Tian Chen Headquarters a dozen days ago, dressed in a white shirt, as beautiful as a deity.","Behind him was a silent tower-like bodyguard pushing the wheelchair, the two scarcely exchanged a word, and not until the bodyguard pushed Lu Zhi in front of her.","Jian Jin heard the bodyguard’s crisp voice, announcing: \"Mr. Lu, we’re here.\"","Lu Zhi’s eyelashes lifted slightly.","The large, seemingly clumsy man instantly understood and stepped aside, leaving space for the two of them to talk privately, standing several meters away.","Lu Zhi waited until people were distant.","He then looked at Jian Jin: \"Why are you here? Who told you?\"","Jian Jin had many things she wanted to ask him, but after Lu Zhi spoke those words, all her questions stuck in her throat, unable to be voiced.","Her eyelids twitched, stunned as she stood in place, gazing longingly at the man in front of her, unable to believe Lu Zhi would do something to hurt Qiao Nian.","But from just those two questions Lu Zhi asked, she already knew the answer.","Jian Jin’s fingers trembled, as if making a difficult decision, finally lifting her heavy arm to press a gun to the man’s temple.","\"Tell your people to leave!\"","The others not far away were all shocked by this scene.","Including Lu Zhi’s men.","They were unsure whether the two were joking or serious, not knowing whether to rush over and control the seemingly crazy Jian Jin immediately.","Assistant Jian actually had the gun pointed at Lu Zhi’s head; is this world going mad?","Jian Jin, however, didn’t care about the shocked gazes around, gritting her teeth, suppressing her trembling hand to grip the gun handle tightly and push it forward: \"Boss, I told you to let them go!\"","Lu Zhi remained motionless in the wheelchair, only looked gently at the trembling woman: \"Do you want to turn against me?\"","\"Lu Zhi!\" Jian Jin shouted loudly, holding the gun in both hands as if forcing herself to confront him directly, her eyes red with blood vessels screaming: \"Do you know what you’re doing? Do you know that by doing this, you’ll ruin our friendship! That’s QIAO’s territory, that’s Red Alliance! We came out of that man-eating place together, she helped you so much, and you treat her like this? Are you crazy? Were you kicked in the head by a donkey when you went out, or did someone whisper nonsense in your ear. How could you think of doing this?\""]},{"number":3918,"title":"Chapter 3918: Lu Zhi: I Told Her","paragraphs":["She bit her lip, looking at the unyielding man in front of her, lips trembling as she said, \"...Qiao already knows.\"","She thought that at the very least Lu Zhi would be shaken by this and would quickly heed her words and stop.","To her surprise, Lu Zhi merely lowered his head and chuckled lightly, those impeccably beautiful eyes betraying no emotion as he looked at her, \"I know.\"","\"?\"","\"I told her.\"","\"!\"","Jian Jin’s mind rang with a loud noise, and her brain went blank, nearly unable to believe her eyes and ears, unable to believe what she heard or what she saw.","Lu Zhi, is he truly insane?","At this moment, Lu Zhi slowly raised his hand to grip the muzzle of the gun, pulling the barrel toward his own head, eyes cold as he spoke to Jian Jin, \"Shoot here.\"","\"...\" Jian Jin’s hand trembled violently at the moment he grabbed the muzzle, her thumb on the trigger frozen like a stone, not daring even to shake.","She was afraid of accidentally pulling the trigger and causing the gun to fire... This fear overpowered her anger toward Lu Zhi, reflexively pulling her hand back, \"You, let go.\"","Lu Zhi held the handgun firmly, not letting her pull away, his deep teacolored eyes unblinking as he fixated on her, rose-colored lips parting to say, \"You still have the chance to kill me now. Jian Jin, if you don’t act, then don’t stop me from doing what I need to do.\"","Jian Jin’s eyelids quivered as she looked up, her pupils filled with painful struggle, \"Don’t push me.\"","Unfazed, Lu Zhi still held the barrel against his temple, saying softly, \"I’m not pushing you; I’m merely giving you a choice.\"","Jian Jin bit her lip fiercely, \"...\"","Lu Zhi had the nerve to laugh, \"I’ll count to three; you have three seconds to decide.\"","Jian Jin’s heart fluttered, her fingers gripping the gun so tightly the skin turned white, \"You’re crazy?! Don’t push me!\"","But Lu Zhi seemed determined to push her, lowering his gaze to start counting, \"Three.\"","\"Boss.\"","\"Two.\"","\"Don’t push me...\"","Lu Zhi watched her quietly, \"You have one second left to decide whether or not to pull the trigger.\"","Jian Jin’s pupils dilated violently, overwhelming pain and despair surged up, nearly drowning her.","\"Ah!\" She let out a painful cry, flinging her hand away, not giving the man sitting in the wheelchair a chance to further coerce her, stepping back three paces, standing there watching him.","\"Lu Zhi, you’re insane.\"","This time she didn’t call him boss.","Jian Jin’s eyes were lined with bloodshot marks, her left hand holding the gun hung uncontrollably trembling, she looked at Lu Zhi as if he were a stranger.","\"I don’t understand why you’ve become like this, but you still have time to stop. If you continue, you’ll only reach an irreparable point with Qiao...\"","\"If it’s not the kind of relationship I want, what does it matter if it’s irreparable?\" Lu Zhi retorted.","Jian Jin only felt that he was beyond saving, her mouth opened, thousands of words stuck in her throat yet ultimately left unsaid.","Lu Zhi manipulated the wheelchair to turn around, stating, \"I just gave you the chance to stop me, but since you’ve made a choice, don’t stop me anymore. You can’t stop me.\"","While he was speaking.","\"Mr. Lu.\" The towering bodyguard beside Lu Zhi silently walked forward, perceptively moving behind him to wheel him away.","Jian Jin watched their backs, then looked at the desolate, wind-swept warning line that had been cordoned off by Lu Zhi and the reclusive family.","She took a deep breath, turned around, and headed towards her crashed and deformed sports car.","...","\"Assistant Jian.\"","On the road, she encountered the robust man who had just spoken to her."]},{"number":3919,"title":"Chapter 3919: Jian Jin Didn’t Leave, Contacted Sister Nian","paragraphs":["The burly man also saw the scene of Jian Jin pointing a gun at Lu Zhi’s head and greeted her politely, filled with apprehension in his eyes.","\"Assistant Jian, where are you going?\"","\"Get out of the way!\"","Jian Jin, without even looking at him, bumped into him and walked straight away.","The burly man watched her dispiritedly walk to the sports car, open the door, then watched as she drove the deformed car out, turned around, and left.","It was not until Jian Jin’s car disappeared on the road in the night that he breathed a long sigh of relief, turned around, and went back to greet the others.","\"What are you looking at? Do you all have nothing to do?!\"","\"Disperse, all of you, disperse!\"","**","Jian Jin didn’t go far.","She reached the end of the road and didn’t turn back, instead, she stepped on the gas pedal and went into the wilderness outside the greenery.","Fortunately, she came in a sports car, whose tires naturally have some anti-slip effect, so the cobalt blue sports car didn’t get stuck in the damp night grass and mud.","\"Damn.\"","Jian Jin struggled to press the gas pedal all the way down to move forward slowly, she could only comfort herself that this turtle-speed movement was better than not moving at all.","Meanwhile, she quickly picked up the phone left in the car and dialed Qiao Nian’s number.","\"Ring.\"","The call was answered in seconds.","The girl’s voice, edged with the howling night wind, reached her eardrum: \"Hello.\"","\"QIAO, you asked Tattoo Arm to find me, didn’t you? Did he pass on what I found out to you?\" Jian Jin spoke succinctly.","\"He did.\" Qiao Nian’s tone was calm.","Jian Jin watched the road ahead that the light couldn’t penetrate, driving forward while tilting her head to hold the phone between her neck and shoulder: \"Listen. What I’m going to say next is important.\"","\"Mm, go ahead.\"","Jian Jin, however, couldn’t speak: \"I...\"","The wind sound whizzed across from the other side.","Even though she hesitated several times, unable to continue, Qiao Nian remained quietly without urging her.","Under this tolerant gentleness, Jian Jin gradually calmed down, gritted her teeth, and said in one breath: \"I came to see for myself.\"","\"It’s Lu Zhi.\"","\"How did you know?!\" Jian Jin was shocked, just as there was a blocking stone below, she couldn’t see clearly in the dark, the car bumpy almost stalled again.","Jian Jin barely braked in time, just in time to hear Qiao Nian say: \"Besides him, I can’t think of anyone who would cooperate with Nie Qingru.\"","\"...QIAO.\" Jian Jin’s feelings were incredibly complicated.","Qiao Nian continued: \"We grew up together, and I can forgive him for any other mistakes, but I can’t forgive him if he targets my people.\"","Jian Jin parked the car by the roadside, said sullenly: \"I know.\"","\"As long as you understand.\" The girl’s voice remained sober and rational, casually yet revealing a hint of warmth.","Jian Jin barely held back tears, her eyes slightly hot, the veins bulging in her hands gripping the steering wheel tightly, choked: \"I never thought Boss Lu would do this. When you asked me before, I honestly didn’t know... I never thought he would do something to hurt you. He...\"","Indeed, how could Lu Zhi hurt QIAO.","In her memory, even if Lu Zhi was always so dark and scheming, he never used those means on her and Qiao Nian.","Especially Qiao Nian... the one Lu Zhi liked.","Boss Lu always kept QIAO dearly in his heart, Jian Jin never thought that one day Lu Zhi would bring people to surround the Red Alliance.","And yet, cooperating with QIAO’s enemy.","To this day, she still can’t comprehend what’s going through Lu Zhi’s mind!","\"I had a chance to stop him, but I...\" Jian Jin’s hands clenched on the steering wheel, she apologized dejectedly: \"I’m sorry.\""]},{"number":3920,"title":"Chapter 3920: Jian Jin Breaks into the Center of the Encirclement","paragraphs":["She couldn’t bring herself to do it.","She couldn’t pull the trigger.","Jian Jin took a deep breath, then looked up and said to the person on the phone: \"I’m already taking a shortcut to rush inside. Don’t worry, even if it costs my life, I will guard the Red Alliance for you!\"","Who knew Qiao Nian would say without thinking: \"Go back.\"","Jian Jin didn’t understand: \"Why? I’m almost there! I can still make it if I rush over now, Lu Zhi just saw me, it means they haven’t started yet...\"","Tattoo Arm and others are outside.","The Red Alliance headquarters has few people inside.","Jian Jin knows exactly what having one more person here means—it means an extra chance for the people inside to survive!","Of course, as far as she’s concerned personally, this decision isn’t so friendly.","She could’ve stayed out of it, but chose to get involved.","If a confrontation happens, the side she’s on will definitely be at a disadvantage... Jian Jin is risking her life to make up for her inability to pull the trigger to stop Lu Zhi.","\"Go back!\" Qiao Nian obviously understands her mentality, so she doesn’t let her go: \"I’m almost there. Don’t worry about this matter.\"","\"QIAO!\" Jian Jin couldn’t accept this arrangement.","She argued with Qiao Nian on the phone, her face pale: \"No, I can’t listen to you.\"","Before Qiao Nian could speak, she immediately said: \"Don’t you trust me? Do you think I’ll be useless even if I go, just standing on Lu Zhi’s side?\"","Qiao Nian’s tone was a bit frustrated: \"I don’t mean that.\"","Jian Jin knows she doesn’t mean that, but the guilt in her heart is like a tide about to swallow her: \"Anyway, I’m heading back. If you’re not assured, hurry over, before you get here I’ll try my best to guard your ’home’.\"","The Red Alliance is Qiao Nian’s home in the illegal zone.","Qiao Nian was silent for a moment, ultimately not rejecting her goodwill: \"It’s very dangerous there.\"","Jian Jin just laughed: \"Do I look like a fool?\"","\"Tut.\" Qiao Nian clicked her tongue, didn’t say anything.","The atmosphere between them relaxed.","Jian Jin said: \"I know it’s dangerous, I’ll be careful. You too, take care.\"","**","Qiao Nian hung up the call, tried to call Ye Wangchuan again.","\"Sorry, the number you dialed is out of service area, please try again later...\" the mechanical female voice sounded again.","Qiao Nian hung up and tossed the phone on the passenger seat, flooring the gas pedal, the sports car shot into the night like a streak of light.","...","At the same time.","Under the cover of darkness, the atmosphere reached freezing point.","Both sides were on the verge of erupting, even the air outside seemed to solidify, and the sound of the wind quieted down.","That’s when Jian Jin drove into the Red Alliance headquarters.","\"Calling, calling, an unidentified sports car has appeared in the target area.\"","\"Calling, calling, an unidentified person has appeared.\"","\"Calling...\"","Jian Jin burst into the center of the crowd’s blockade through a muddy area, something no one expected.","She didn’t just break in, she boldly pushed open the car door and got out.","In front of Lu Zhi’s men and Nie Qingru’s confidants, she tossed her hair and strode towards the bungalow.","...","On the other side, on the top floor.","Guan Yan was ready to act the moment she saw the royal blue sports car come into view.","Luckily, Ye Wangchuan had sharp eyes and saw the license plate number in the dark sky, quickly stopping her: \"It’s Jian Jin’s car, let her through.\"","\"Hmm.\" Guan Yan also recognized Jian Jin, put down the sniper rifle aimed at the front car tire, pulled off her goggles, irritated: \"Why did she come?\"","Coming at a time like this is asking for trouble!"]},{"number":3921,"title":"Chapter 3921: Master Wang’s Plan Was Disrupted","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan didn’t speak, watching Jian Jin walk in under the gaze of everyone, and felt a bit of a headache telling the people in the living room: \"The plan has changed.\"","His original plan was to wait for the people outside to rush in, and at that moment, have Qin Si cut off the power to the bungalow, plunging the room into darkness to facilitate their action...","Now that Jian Jin has come, the people outside will surely understand that they knew about the ambush.","In this way, the previously agreed-upon tactic of cutting the power unexpectedly won’t work.","Because their opponents were now on alert.","Many of their actions became restricted.","...","\"Mr. Lu, Assistant Jian went in.\"","\"I’m sorry, Mr. Lu, we didn’t know there was a small path besides the main road leading to Red Alliance headquarters.\"","\"It’s my dereliction of duty, please punish me, Mr. Lu!\"","Lu Zhi had already reached just outside the nearest center circle of the encirclement, where seven or eight people stood bowing in front of him.","Each admitted their mistakes, their expressions ugly, apologizing and begging for forgiveness.","Shadow had also received the message that someone broke through their encirclement and entered the bungalow, hurried over, with a tense, stern look: \"Lu Zhi, what’s going on here? How did your people not watch the perimeter and let someone inside! Now Ye Wangchuan knows what we’re up to. I said before he’s not easy to deal with. It would be better if we acted when he didn’t expect, but now that he knows we exist before making a move, we won’t have the advantage...\"","Lu Zhi ignored him, raising his gaze a bit with a stern rebuke: \"Are you blaming me?\"","Shadow froze, hearing the impatience in the other’s tone, recalling Lu Zhi’s previous methods in dealing with the empress’s confidants.","He held back, softened his tone: \"Lu Zhi, I just don’t want any unexpected changes to affect everyone’s plan...\"","\"I won’t let her affect the plan.\" Lu Zhi placed his left hand on the wheelchair, squinted his eyes and said: \"In my plan, there’s only Ye Wangchuan and his men, excluding any from the Red Alliance. You promised to ensure Guan Yan’s safety, so adding one more of my assistant shouldn’t be a problem, right?\"","Shadow’s face turned beet red, immediately flaring up: \"Lu Zhi, you should know very well what we’re here for tonight!\"","Lu Zhi also looked at him, his cold and clear eyes always carrying a trace of menace: \"You should also know that what I decide doesn’t change easily.\"","\"...\" Shadow’s eyelids twitched.","Until Lu Zhi said: \"Besides, you’re the ones asking me.\"","Shadow clenched his tongue against his cheek, forcibly suppressing his anger, and turned to shout at Nie Qingru’s confidants: \"Don’t touch the two women inside...\"","Nie Qingru’s confidants responded in unison: \"Yes, Lord Shadow.\"","Lu Zhi watched them walk away, and the tower-like bodyguard behind him slightly lowered his head and whispered in his ear: \"Mr. Lu, are we ignoring Assistant Jian?\"","Lu Zhi’s gaze was distant: \"I won’t change the plan.\"","The tower-like bodyguard paused for a second and said: \"But Assistant Jian is inside.\"","Lu Zhi tugged the blanket he was holding upwards, his bangs fell covering his prominent eyebrows and eyes, making it difficult to see his expression at the moment.","\"I will try my best to ensure her safety.\"","Even if the tower-like bodyguard was slow to react emotionally, he understood what Lu Zhi meant clearly, indicating that he wouldn’t spare the people in the bungalow for Jian Jin’s sake.","But he would try his best to ensure Jian Jin wouldn’t get harmed.","The bodyguard fell silent.","Born tall and burly, blessed by heaven in one aspect, he was much more emotionally insensitive compared to ordinary people..."]},{"number":3922,"title":"Chapter 3922: Zhui Guang Coming by Water Route?","paragraphs":["The bodyguard’s senses only felt that Lu Zhi’s actions were somewhat off, but he couldn’t understand exactly what was wrong, so he instinctively quieted down.","Lu Zhi ignored him, signaling someone to bring over his laptop.","Soon someone brought the laptop over.","Lu Zhi placed the laptop on his lap, opened it, and his slender fingers flew across the keyboard, quickly pulling up a map.","He entered a string of codes.","The map on the computer screen started to zoom in precisely as he continued to input codes, focusing until it centered on a small glowing dot.","Lu Zhi looked at the position of the small glowing dot and paused: \"Northern Ferry? She wants to take a boat?\"","**","The locked small glowing dot was precisely Qiao Nian’s location.","At this moment, the sports car was speeding like the wind, almost reaching the northern dock area.","Nighttime is the busiest time at the docks.","The illegal zone serves as a transit station for goods from the independent continent and Continent F, with countless goods being shipped worldwide daily from here.","And some tasks that aren’t suitable for daytime are often shipped from the dock at night.","At nine PM, the dock was brightly lit.","The busy ferry was bustling with freight workers everywhere.","Just then.","Everyone heard the roar of an engine, and soon, a red sports car shot in like an arrow loose from its bow, stopping right by the dock.","\"Who’s that?\"","\"Whose car is it?\"","Some of the people whose attention was drawn by the commotion of the sports car couldn’t help but whisper as they looked at the red sports car parked there.","\"Why is someone coming to our dock at this hour in the night?\"","Before they could speculate further.","\"Make way, make way.\" A person ran over from behind, pushing them aside, and jogged all the way over.","\"Damn it...\" Those caught off guard and pushed were initially furious and wanted to pull him back, but when they turned and saw it was a Red Alliance member running past,","they had to suppress their anger and immediately backed down.","\"Red Alliance?\"","\"Someone from the Red Alliance in that car?\"","\"Who would come to the docks at this late hour? Guan Yan or Slim Waist Control? Slim Waist Control seems not to be in the illegal zone; rather, recently, I’ve heard a lot about her. Could it possibly be... Zhui Guang!\"","\"You’re saying the person in the car is Zhui Guang?!\"","The crowd who had been discussing buzzed upon hearing this name, with more people putting down their work and watching the scene from the sidelines.","The Red Alliance member ran up to the car but didn’t open the car door; instead, he waited respectfully outside, while the driver’s seat opened just a crack, making it impossible to see what the person inside looked like.","From a distance, they could only see the person inside talking with the Red Alliance member, who nodded continuously.","Soon after.","The crowd at the ferry saw the Red Alliance member walking over to them, stopping one of the transport workers and saying: \"Arrange for us a speedboat to return to headquarters.\"","\"Alright.\"","\"And get a forklift ready to help me load that sports car onto the speedboat.\" He pointed to the red sports car behind him.","Even though the transport worker in charge of the ferry didn’t understand why the person in the car wouldn’t come out and insisted on the trouble of loading the car onto the speedboat,","since the Red Alliance had spoken, he, a small figure, couldn’t do anything but comply: \"Sure, please wait a moment.\"","...","\"Mr. Lu, Zhui Guang seems to want to make a quick return by waterway.\" The bodyguard glanced at the dot on the screen and softly asked when Lu Zhi finished his call.","Lu Zhi’s brow was tightly furrowed, his fingertip was pressing against his brow, seemingly contemplating a problem, and he didn’t answer him immediately."]},{"number":3923,"title":"Chapter 3923: Lu Zhi Realizes Something Is Wrong","paragraphs":["The bodyguard was very patient, waiting with a wooden expression, not feeling that Lu Zhi ignoring him was inappropriate.","It wasn’t until Lu Zhi snapped back to reality, his gaze returning to the computer screen, that he spoke softly: \"She’s traveling by water, and even had someone bring the car along. Is she taking the car to come back faster? Or is it too troublesome to prepare a new car because she’s used to driving that one?\"","Lu Zhi always felt that Qiao Nian’s refusal to get out of the car, instructing the people under him to transport her along with the car onto the speedboat, was somewhat... unconventional.","He just couldn’t figure out what Qiao Nian was trying to do at the moment.","He vaguely felt that they couldn’t delay any longer and waved the bodyguard over.","The bodyguard immediately lowered his head: \"What are your orders, Mr. Lu?\"","Lu Zhi squinted, glancing at the calm-looking bungalow after Jian Jin went inside, no longer held back his boiling murderous aura.","\"Take action!\"","**","The wind howled, tearing through the surface tranquility.","As the first team approached the bungalow, the power to the building was immediately cut, plunging the interior into darkness.","\"Attention, the lights are out.\"","\"Everyone, be careful.\"","\"They must be hiding.\"","Similar to what Ye Wangchuan had expected.","Because Jian Jin unexpectedly barged in halfway, Lu Zhi’s people did not panic upon discovering the power outage and falling into darkness.","Instead, they were already mentally prepared and began orderly communication via their walkie-talkies.","However, this was still within Ye Wangchuan’s control.","Someone standing at the second-floor corner was seen in the darkness, pressing the switch on a makeshift jammer.","The first group to break in quickly realized their walkie-talkies they brought with them were useless, starting to lose contact with their companions.","Luckily, the Red Alliance headquarters wasn’t large.","Compared to Tian Chen’s tall skyscraper, the Red Alliance headquarters was more like a living space.","The four-story bungalow didn’t occupy much area, so as long as they spoke loudly, they could still communicate and hear each other.","It just wasn’t as convenient as communicating with walkie-talkies.","\"Damn, no signal! Everyone, be cautious!\" They were all on the black market’s list of dangerous individuals, each highly skilled and extremely vigilant.","They immediately adjusted their tactics based on the situation, forming groups of three, each group starting to search inside.","As soon as they dispersed, a gust blew through.","The doors and windows in the living room slammed shut.","Realizing something was wrong, everyone nervously raised their weapons, aiming around.","Just then, something emitted a rolling sound on the floor, and it wasn’t just one, but three to five rolled out from different directions, stopping at their feet.","Someone reacted quickly, shouting out: \"Bomb!\"","Others instinctively ran, while a few remained slightly calmer, used their phone lights to see that the objects rolling onto the floor were indeed bamboo-like tubes, but not bombs.","More like...","Before he could clearly see what the things on the ground were.","There was a sudden ’pop,’ and white smoke began to emerge from both ends.","He didn’t have time to pinch his nose, unexpectedly inhaling, his brain buzzing, head throbbing.","\"No, it’s not a bomb.\"","He used all his strength to shout, alerting his companions: \"This thing is poisonous! Hold your breath!\"","As he spoke.","His vision darkened, and unable to control his body, he fell with a thud.","He just collapsed straight in front of everyone, while the others, shocked and furious, immediately covered their mouths and noses, searching for water and towels."]},{"number":3924,"title":"Chapter 3924: Master Wang Uses All the Little Gadgets Sister Nian Left Behind","paragraphs":["But they quickly realized that all the faucets inside the mansion had been sabotaged, and they couldn’t find any water. Simply using sleeves or towels to cover their mouths and noses was not a long-term solution.","One by one, the people who came in couldn’t hold on and collapsed.","In the blink of an eye, only two or three people remained.","At this moment.","As the last two or three people strained to the point where the veins in their necks bulged, their target for the night casually appeared at the staircase on the second floor.","\"Ye, Ye...\"","They watched helplessly as the person walked before them, lacking the strength to pick up their weapons, and instead seeing the person looking down on them from above.","Then slowly, resentfully, they sank into darkness.","It was only in the last second before losing consciousness that they realized—Ye Wangchuan never intended to use bombs or anything like that against them.","What he wanted was to resolve this group of intruders without bloodshed!","In such a short time, he had prepared so many ’gifts of greeting.’","This man was terrifying!","**","With the last person who burst in falling resentfully.","The lights in the living room came on again.","Jian Jin, Qin Si, and Ji Lin came out of the room.","They were the ones responsible for throwing the smoke bombs Ye Wangchuan had given them.","However, those smoke bombs were not genuine smoke bombs but rather little gadgets Qiao Nian had tossed into the Red Alliance warehouse.","It seemed to be something she had made herself and never used, finishing them and leaving them in the warehouse without caring.","Ye Wangchuan had discovered these miscellaneous gadgets abandoned in a corner of a cardboard box when Guan Yan took him to see the warehouse.","He carefully studied their functions and took them out for use.","The effects were evidently good.","No wonder he had a good relationship with the Pharmacy Association.","He’s skilled at handling medicines.","He’s also skilled at handling poisons.","Jian Jin squatted down and furrowed her brow as she tried feeling their breaths on the people lying horizontally on the ground, finding that they were still breathing, as she heard Ye Wangchuan’s calm voice.","\"It’s all tranquilizers inside. They won’t die, they’ll just sleep for a while.\"","Jian Jin rose to her feet, awkwardly explaining, \"I just wanted to check their situation, to see if we should drag them to the corner.\"","Ye Wangchuan knew she was here for Qiao Nian, had a good relationship with Lu Zhi, and was also a person of Tian Chen.","It’s perfectly normal for Jian Jin to care about these people’s lives and deaths, entirely a normal human reaction.","He didn’t have much of an opinion and turned to Qin Si and Ji Lin, saying, \"Next, go to the warehouse and find a handy weapon.\"","Ji Lin was accustomed to such scenes and nodded in agreement, \"Yes, Master Wang.\"","\"No problem. I’ll pick out a submachine gun and give those who come in a good time!\" Despite growing up in wealth, Qin Si was quite bloodthirsty, or else he wouldn’t be hanging out with Ye Wangchuan and Bo Jingxing.","He even found time to laugh, and after laughing, he put away his frivolous expression and suddenly turned sideways to speak to Ye Wangchuan, \"Master Wang, I don’t care about myself. Please take care of Guan Yan for me. You know! I’m not skilled at this stuff, and I don’t know how long I can last. Anyway... keep an eye on her for me.\"","He studied finance and hadn’t trained like Ye Wangchuan from a young age in the military compound.","His exposure to these things was limited to racing and shooting he played at the club before. Of course, he could certainly do it.","Among the people in their circle in Beijing, there were few who hadn’t touched a weapon; everyone had handled the real stuff.","But handling and using are two different things.","Qin Si understood his own limits.","So he was worried that he wouldn’t have the ability to protect the woman when the time came."]},{"number":3925,"title":"Chapter 3925: Master Wang: There’s Still a Hard Battle Ahead","paragraphs":["\"Hmm.\" This time Ye Wangchuan agreed, and as he watched Qin Si confidently follow Ji Lin to select weapons, he lazily said, \"Guan Yan also told me the same thing.\"","A surge of indescribable emotion washed over Qin Si’s heart. He suddenly turned his head and saw Ye Wangchuan biting a cigarette, his expression genuine.","He suddenly laughed, his handsome face radiating casual relaxation, \"That’s good! Then I’m not losing out!\"","Ye Wangchuan no longer bothered with them, glancing sideways at the night outside, knowing that the people lying scattered in the living room were just appetizers Lu Zhi had prepared for him tonight.","No one knew how many were outside.","Without turning his head, he spoke to Jian Jin, Qin Si, and the others, \"There’s a tough battle ahead, prepare yourselves mentally.\"","\"Got it.\"","Apart from Qin Si, who was a rookie, everyone else had gone through too much.","Jian Jin had brought a revolver herself, which was clearly insufficient for the current situation. Seeing Ji Lin and Qin Si select their weapons, she turned calmly and said, \"I’m going to choose a weapon.\"","Ji Lin happened to brush past her. Seeing Jian Jin enter the warehouse, he then approached Ye Wangchuan, lowering his voice to say, \"Master Wang, after all, she’s from Tian Chen. Could it be...\"","Ye Wangchuan raised his hand to stop him, his clear and distinctive brows holding an air of assurance, with a voice calm yet indisputable, \"She’s Qiao Nian’s friend.\"","Ji Lin immediately showed a shut-up expression, no longer speaking.","**","Outside.","The first batch went in without sending out a signal and went silent, and the lights in the once-dark mansion turned bright again.","In such a tense night scene.","The mansion’s lights seemed like a silent mockery and provocation to the ’beasts’ outside trying to devour them under the cover of darkness.","The second batch contacted those inside for a long time without any response, ultimately forced to steel themselves and walk up to Lu Zhi.","Lowering their heads, they murmured, \"Mr. Lu, we can’t reach them. What’s our next step?\"","Just then.","Shadow also approached from another direction, accompanied by a close associate of Nie Qingru, looking equally troubled as he asked Lu Zhi, \"Did you manage to contact the people inside?\"","The man by Lu Zhi’s side answered his question, \"We can’t contact anyone inside.\"","Shadow’s face turned extremely grim, \"You too...\"","He immediately glanced at Lu Zhi, his expression solemn, \"We can’t reach our own people either.\"","This time Lu Zhi and Nie Qingru were in a cooperative relationship.","Neither trusted the other.","Hence, the first batch included people from Lu Zhi and members of the reclusive family.","No one expected those people to lose contact so quietly after entering as if they were fish released into the sea, quickly swallowed up by the mansion.","\"Ye Wangchuan is indeed a remarkable figure!\" Shadow, frustrated, couldn’t help but mention Jian Jin again, \"If it weren’t for your people running off to leak information suddenly, he wouldn’t have prepared in advance. Now none of our people have come out, and there’s no news. What’s the next step?\"","Lu Zhi sneered coldly, in a very disdainful tone, \"What are you afraid of?\"","Shadow, long serving by Nie Qingru’s side, held a distinguished position. Despite being publicly scolded, his face slightly changed yet dared not to directly confront, could only swallow his pride and say, \"I’m not afraid, just concerned...\"","Lu Zhi interrupted him, \"Hah, they only have a few people inside. No matter how clever he is, he can’t change the inherent disadvantage. We have so many people here; they only have a few. What are you worried about?\""]},{"number":3926,"title":"Chapter 3926: Tell the Sniper to Prepare Cover, Force Our Way In","paragraphs":["Shadow’s face turned blue, white, then red, lacking any hint of a good expression. He wanted to refute several times, yet couldn’t.","He just acted like he was afraid of Ye Wangchuan.","Lu Zhi insisted on using this point to humiliate him, and he was helpless!","Fortunately, Lu Zhi remembered that they were still in a period of cooperation, so he only said a few words and didn’t utterly humiliate Shadow, then raised his hand, his handsome face devoid of emotion, extremely cold and stern: \"I originally wanted to give him a chance to beg for mercy, but he refused, so let’s have our men forcefully break in!\"","Shadow immediately raised his eyes.","— What does Lu Zhi want to do?","Lu Zhi called a bodyguard behind him: \"339.\"","The bodyguard bowed, bending his burly figure, incredibly respectful: \"Mr. Lu.\"","Lu Zhi’s eyebrows slightly arched: \"Tell our snipers to prepare cover, storm in!\"","\"Yes.\"","The bodyguard methodically went off to execute his orders.","Lu Zhi seemed alone beside him, but Shadow didn’t dare underestimate him even a bit, paused for half a second, then said in a dry, hard tone: \"I’ll have our guys get ready too.\"","\"Remember what you promised me.\" Lu Zhi didn’t even glance his way, as if casually mentioning it in conversation.","Shadow felt the threat, his steps halted, but he didn’t turn back, soon hurriedly striding away.","Lu Zhi heard Shadow’s footsteps fade into the distance, once more lifted his gaze towards the only illuminated house in the dark night, sighed a bit regretfully: \"She used to love it here...\"","A gust of evening wind swept in, dispersing his murmured half-sentence, also dispersing the last hint of chill in the air.","Perhaps to fit the atmosphere of impending action tonight, even the wind turned hot and restless.","Just a spark would ignite everything here!","Lu Zhi has always been decisive and swift.","The men under him have followed for years, long accustomed to high-efficiency execution.","The bodyguard had barely conveyed Lu Zhi’s orders, and they had already assembled, ready to storm in any moment.","Meanwhile, snipers lurking in the dark were thoroughly prepared, beginning to aim infrared lights at the people inside the house.","On the rooftop.","Guan Yan was the first to notice changes outside, communicated in a deep voice with everyone in the living room via walkie-talkie: \"They’re about to make a move.\"","She noticed infrared lights aiming over, slightly dodged to avoid the opponent’s camera, lowered her voice: \"There are snipers outside, an unknown number of them.\"","The atmosphere inside the walkie-talkie turned extremely tense.","Even Jian Jin pursed her lips tightly, standing in the place Ye Wangchuan arranged for her, holding her weapon tightly, fully prepared.","The public channel of the walkie-talkie for the moment had only Guan Yan’s voice: \"They’re coming in.\"","\"500 meters.\"","\"452 meters.\"","\"300 meters.\"","\"...\"","The people outside had learned their lesson, even prepared a spotlight above each head, always preventing a blackout situation inside.","Ensuring they could see the people within the villa even in darkness.","\"150 meters.\"","Guan Yan hid by the wall on the rooftop to avoid the snipers’ aiming devices, gripped the switch valve, nervously asked: \"Young Master Ye, can we begin?\"","\"I’ll count to three.\" Ye Wangchuan’s voice transmitted through everyone’s earpiece, incredibly calm and powerful, even if they hadn’t seen him, just listening to his commands brought peace.","Guan Yan indeed steadied herself, saying: \"Okay.\"","And the man’s countdown voice came through the earpiece.","\"3.\"","\"2.\""]},{"number":3927,"title":"Chapter 3927: They Won’t Have Many Stingers","paragraphs":["Guan Yan stuck his head out from the night and glanced at the situation below.","Lu Zhi and Nie Qingru’s people were infinitely closing in on them.","Her heart was pounding like a thunderous drum, the thumping heartbeat sounding even louder than any other noise of the night.","\"1.\"","Guan Yan swallowed and closed his eyes as he pressed the switch.","Outside, screams erupted chaotically in response to the unexpected firelight, followed by an explosion that illuminated half the sky.","The crowd outside was in an uproar.","Someone shouted: \"Missile, it’s a Stinger!\"","Lu Zhi and Shadow’s camp was in turmoil.","A bodyguard resembling a tower hurriedly pushed Lu Zhi’s wheelchair, evacuating him to a safe area.","Though Shadow didn’t react as quickly as the bodyguard, he managed to dodge immediately, appearing somewhat disheveled, his face and clothes covered with many exploded fragments.","He briskly approached Lu Zhi, exasperated: \"How could Red Alliance headquarters have a Stinger? This...\"","Lu Zhi was impeccably clean, taking out a white handkerchief to wipe his palm, calmly asking: \"Is it really surprising that her territory has these things?\"","Shadow suddenly thought of Qiao Nian.","Recalling Qiao Nian’s frequent chaotic maneuvers, he swallowed all his complaints, his eyes flaring with anger: \"Mr. Lu, you didn’t tell us there were dangerous toys like this here!\"","Lu Zhi raised his head, finally looking directly at him, still gentle and speaking slowly: \"What? Did Nie Qingru not consider folding all these people here before cooperating with me?\"","\"...\" Shadow was rendered speechless.","Lu Zhi curled his lips disdainfully, retracting his gaze from Shadow’s face, continuing to wipe his hands, lowering his eyes, and speaking softly: \"Our cooperation involves you taking the fall for me, bearing the responsibility for this action. Since they’re destined to die, whether sooner or later or how doesn’t matter, why be bothered whether there are Stinger missiles among the weapons? I only care about the result, not the process!\"","Shadow witnessed Lu Zhi’s ruthlessness firsthand, veins pulsing on his forehead, fists clenched tightly, glancing sideways: \"Mr. Lu is right, then let’s hope we all achieve our desired goals.\"","\"As long as you don’t touch the people you promised me. The empress’s goals will not fail.\" Lu Zhi replied indifferently.","Shadow had nothing more to say and could only leave with his people.","At this moment, 339 bowed his head, inquiring the man whose expression had become indifferent: \"Mr. Lu, shall we continue?\"","Without raising his head, Lu Zhi issued orders: \"Since I’ve done it, expended manpower and resources. Tonight we must achieve the desired result at all costs. Order them to keep advancing, they don’t have much inventory, they won’t last long!\"","\"Yes.\"","After all, Red Alliance is a tech-oriented organization, not one dealing in weapons, only Qiao Nian has personal hobbies of creating small gadgets.","But Red Alliance headquarters is the residence of several key members, not a traditional stronghold, Qiao Nian only occasionally visits once or twice.","There definitely aren’t many munitions inside.","Otherwise, with Ye Wangchuan’s means, it wouldn’t be just one or two Stinger missiles, it would be a whole row catching them unawares.","If he guessed right.","After these two Stinger missiles, Ye Wangchuan and his team would be out of big guns.","Lu Zhi swiftly rotated the jade wrench on his thumb, hiding the calculation in his eyes."]},{"number":3928,"title":"Chapter 3928: Sister Nian’s Golden Cicada Escape Trick","paragraphs":["At the same time.","On a helicopter right next to the ferry dock, the girl stood in the cabin doorway without a seat belt, one hand gripping the overhead handle, the other holding a small pair of binoculars as she looked down.","Below the helicopter, a sea of lights, skyscrapers packed together—nothing really visible.","Qiao Nian lowered the binoculars, let go, and walked toward the pilot’s seat, her face dark: \"How long until we get there?\"","The helicopter pilot took a moment to glance at the navigation map: \"About another half hour.\"","Qiao Nian swung one leg over and sat on the co-pilot seat, her voice low: \"Can you go any faster?\"","The pilot just felt an overwhelming pressure from the person beside him; he was so nervous he almost forgot how to fly: \"Uh, Zhui Guang, this is already the top speed.\"","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes, checked the numbers on the instrument panel herself, and knew he was telling the truth, but she still couldn’t help feeling insanely on edge.","She asked, \"If we don’t follow the planned route, how much time can we save?\"","The pilot snapped his head toward her, scared out of his wits: \"But... but Zhui Guang, if we don’t follow the designated flight corridor, it’s very easy to have an accident. In this kind of airspace, accidents happen easily—a single bird hitting the rotor could make the helicopter crash. We...\"","\"I know!\" Qiao Nian cut him off, casting him an impatient glance: \"Just tell me how much time we can save.\"","The pilot had no choice but to press his lips together, quickly did the math in his head, and gave her an approximate number: \"Eight minutes.\"","\"OK.\" Qiao Nian didn’t waste words, stood up, slapped his shoulder, and said to him, \"You take the co-pilot seat. I’m flying from here.\"","The helicopter pilot obeyed instinctively, getting up to move aside, his face still catching up as shock spread across it: \"Zhui Guang, you know how to fly?\"","Qiao Nian took his place in the pilot’s seat, casually tested the instruments and control sticks, eyelids not even lifting as she said offhandedly, \"I’ve played with one before.\"","\"...\" So, no license!","The pilot’s face went green in an instant.","Qiao Nian didn’t give him a chance to back out, made him sit down, and even kindly reminded him: \"There’s emergency parachute gear next to you. Just in case, you should put it on first.\"","Sitting in the co-pilot seat, the pilot felt like he was on pins and needles, scared to death, but with the boss’s status right there, he didn’t dare say anything, even as cold sweat broke out all over him.","Only when Qiao Nian took the initiative and told him to put on the escape gear did he not even dare be polite, very sensible as he went to grab the kit, thanking her as he moved: \"Thank you, Zhui Guang.\"","He was really afraid Zhui Guang might overplay it and send the helicopter crashing.","As long as he had a parachute on, at least the risk went down and he had a shot at staying alive.","He’d originally wanted to ask if Qiao Nian wanted to gear up too, but by the time he finished strapping on the chute and turned around, he saw the girl fully focused on flying.","The pilot, perceptive enough, shut his mouth and returned to his co-pilot seat, doing his best to feed the girl information on wind direction, speed, and flight tips.","Qiao Nian had already flown a helicopter a few times back on Continent F with David—no license, sure, but she made up for it with raw talent and crazy good motor skills. With the pilot coaching beside her, she quickly adjusted the helicopter’s route and pointed it straight toward the Red Alliance headquarters.","This time she was playing a real-and-fake itinerary game.","Right now no one knew she wasn’t in that sports car on the speedboat up north, but had instead dodged any possible surveillance and was heading to headquarters by helicopter.","So whether it was Lu Zhi’s surveillance or Nie Qingru’s surveillance, both had their attention locked on the car at the dock, and neither noticed Qiao Nian had long since switched to a helicopter."]},{"number":3929,"title":"Chapter 3929: So What If It’s the Red Alliance Headquarters?","paragraphs":["The other side.","Lu Zhi’s people have already broken into the villa.","Leading the group was a young man, with short spiky hair and an eagle hook nose, his eyes fierce: \"You, you, you, you guys go to the second floor.\"","He casually pointed out a few people, directing them up.","\"Yes.\" Those he pointed at went towards the dim stairway with guns in hand.","Nie Qingru’s confidants also followed in.","They ignored the young man’s orders, arrogantly barging inside and started searching the living room.","Things were turned over with a ’pit-a-pat’, the young man frowned a bit, took a glance at the dozen people who mixed in and caused trouble. He shouted back in annoyance: \"What are you doing!\"","Nie Qingru’s confidants glanced up at him, dismissive: \"Looking for someone...\"","\"This is Red Alliance, you’re making such a big commotion...\" The young man’s words were cut off.","The other party impatiently interrupted him: \"What about Red Alliance? It’s just a hacker organization. I don’t understand what you’re afraid of, so cautious.\"","\"I’m afraid? Ha ha!\" The young man was provoked by his bold words, the blood vessel on his forehead throbbing, holding back, then said: \"Fine, you’re not afraid! You’ll go first...\"","He didn’t give that man a chance to refuse, coldly mocking and blocking the conversation: \"You’re not afraid, right? If not, you go first.\"","He didn’t even mind admitting publicly: \"I’m not daring to act wildly at the Red Alliance headquarters. Mr. Lu instructed us to only find someone and not touch anything inside.\"","He put it bluntly, even if Nie Qingru’s confidants realized they were put on the spot by his few words, they had no choice.","Unless they admitted defeat.","But they, as elites of the reclusive family, could hardly show a timid face in the illegal zone.","The person hesitated briefly, then slightly raised his chin, tone full of disdain towards the small place: \"Fine, we’ll go first, if that’s what it takes. It’s no big deal, a bunch of cowards!\"","Several of Lu Zhi’s people got angry, ready to act.","\"Everyone stop, let them go.\" The young man stopped them.","Nie Qingru’s confidants sneered, glanced sideways at everyone, faces seemingly saying ’a bunch of cowards’. Turned around and waved the others: \"Brothers, let’s go up!\"","\"Yes!\"","The people of the reclusive family, to show their superiority, deliberately answered loudly in unison.","Each person who passed by the young man gave him the middle finger in contempt, extremely arrogant and uncooperative.","The young man managed to swallow his breath, just kept a straight face, emotionless as he watched this group of clowns swaggering towards the second floor...","He cursed in his heart: A bunch of idiots!","Maintained his composure outwardly, only observing with his eyes, his mind on high alert, not missing any odd detail.","Didn’t forget to remind his people: \"Ignore them, be careful yourself.\"","\"Understood.\" The others nodded, didn’t take these fools from Continent M seriously, just thought they were brainless.","This is the Red Alliance headquarters.","They know very well who Zhui Guang is. They are doing something on Tai Sui’s territory now, Guan Yan and Assistant Jian are here, not to mention the outsider Mr. Lu specifically named, just Guan Yan and Assistant Jian alone mean tonight will be a tough battle.","They wouldn’t dare be careless."]},{"number":3930,"title":"Chapter 3930: You Haven’t Heard This Name, But You Should Know Y","paragraphs":["Just as the young man nodded, preparing to lead his people towards the kitchen to investigate, a very faint muffled sound was heard.","\"Ah, Boss!\"","\"There, there’s an ambush! There’s a sniper!\"","He turned back to see the reclusive family’s people in chaos, some shouting, others squatting on the ground trying to drag back a fallen man.","The whole scene was in chaos.","The young man cursed, \"F*ck!\"","Immediately, he told the subordinates by his side, \"Go and see from which direction the bullet was fired.\"","He himself then strode over to the useless crowd, grabbing the loudest one, slapping left and right.","\"Smack! Smack!\" The two slaps landed.","They hit the man so hard his eyes were seeing stars, blood seeping from the corner of his mouth.","He then released the man’s collar, glanced at the man on the ground with blood oozing from his forehead, remembering how he was bantering with him just a second ago, not taking the illegal zone seriously, and now he lay there with a burst head...","He took a deep breath, suppressing the ominous feeling rising in his heart, and glanced sharply at each of the reclusive family’s people, his knife-like gaze weighing heavily on their hearts.","\"Do you still think the Red Alliance is not scary?\"","\"...\"","Those people, looking at the man on the ground who began convulsing due to excessive blood loss, fell silent, each saying nothing.","The young man, satisfied seeing them close their mouths, said coldly, \"I’ll say it again, this is the illegal zone, this is the Red Alliance! Those who don’t want to die, stay alert. The opponent’s gun is equipped with a silencer, making it very hard to determine the location by sound alone. As long as we can’t find the shooter, we’ll continue to suffer casualties. So from this second, I expect every smart person to search hard for the hidden shooter, only then can we minimize losses. Understand?\"","Nie Qingru’s confidants nodded like pecking chickens, their expressions shifting from panic to having a backbone.","\"Now scatter and each go find the person.\"","\"Yes.\"","Even they didn’t realize they had unconsciously started following Lu Zhi’s orders.","The young man watched them disperse, feeling extremely irritable.","Soon, his subordinate, who was sent to check the bullet trajectory, returned, standing before him and whispered, \"Sangs, the situation is not good.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"I followed the bullet’s embedded angle from the shot person back to look for the shooter, and found no trace of anyone firing. The opponent is an expert.\"","The young man was not surprised, as he loaded the handgun he brought, coldly saying, \"Ye Wangchuan, you may not have heard of this name, but you should have seen a symbol on the rankings we visited.\"","The subordinate was puzzled, waiting for him to elaborate.","The young man, not intending to show off, opened his lips and said, \"Y.\"","The subordinate’s face suddenly changed, eyes widening as he stared straight at him, \"You mean he is...\"","The young man nodded, \"Yes. For a time, on Continent F, there was a person who got very close with Dark Fort and several weapons merchants, with a strong, domineering style, topping the black market’s dangerous individual list. However, this person usually keeps a low profile, not taking jobs. He stayed on the list for a long time without anyone noticing him, he is Y. He doesn’t take jobs despite being on the list because he is from a prestigious family and not short of money, hence not needing to take life-threatening jobs to earn money. Being on the list might have been an accident for him. But this accident also reveals the terrifying hidden power of this person!\""]},{"number":3931,"title":"Chapter 3931: Ye Wangchuan Told Them to Leave First","paragraphs":["He patted his subordinate’s shoulder with his backhand and said, \"So tell our people to be careful, don’t let your guard down just because Zhui Guang isn’t here, it doesn’t mean there’s nothing to fear.\"","He glanced at the man on the ground who had stopped convulsing and no longer breathed, his expression indifferent: \"See, that’s his end!\"","**","The people forcing their way in to search were like clockwork one after another, nerves highly tense as they began a large-scale, methodical sweep to find the person.","During this time, no less than 20 people went down.","Each person who fell only made the already tense atmosphere even more so, even the people brought by Nie Qingru dared not let down their guard, trying to move in groups as much as possible...","The mansion was not very big to begin with, dozens of people searched floor by floor, and even though their speed was forced to slow down, they quickly searched to the last floor.","Guan Yan had already come down from the rooftop and retreated to the final floor with Jian Jin and the others. Through the surveillance Qiao Nian had previously set up everywhere, they watched the people below starting to frequently glance toward their floor, a thin layer of sweat forming on her palms.","\"Young Master Ye, they’ll be up here in ten minutes. Do you have any ideas?\"","Ye Wangchuan stood behind her and looked at the laptop showing the people preparing to come up, his rose-colored thin lips lightly touching: \"No.\"","Guan Yan looked back at him, seeing the man’s outstanding face with no hint of joking, she also fell silent. Their current situation was indeed difficult to have a good solution... the natural disadvantage in numbers couldn’t be compensated for with strategy! But she felt a bit unwilling.","Just as she was silently grappling with this, she heard the man calmly say to her again, \"But we’re not at a dead end.\"","Guan Yan puzzledly lifted her head: \"...Isn’t this a dead end?\"","They were surrounded here with no room to retreat, they could only have a direct confrontation with the people below.","She wasn’t afraid to die, but in the current situation, Guan Yan found it hard to say there’s still a chance, they were too passive.","Ye Wangchuan straightened up from the wall he had been leaning against, walked up to them and calmly instructed: \"We have a few minutes left. Listen to what I say next, I’ll clear a path for you using smoke bombs to cover your escape. When I say go, you go. Guan Yan and Jian Jin, take care of the other two. Lu Zhi probably won’t act against you. Once you get out, see if there’s a chance to find a vehicle, if not, then delay. As long as you buy some time, Mo Xi will bring reinforcements...\"","Qin Si’s eyes were bloodshot as he looked at him: \"And what about you? What are you going to do?\"","Ye Wangchuan was extremely calm: \"Their target is me. If I go with you, no one can get away.\"","Qin Si punched the wall beside him, speaking harshly: \"Damn it, I’m not leaving! Whoever wants to go can go! I can’t just leave my brother behind and walk away.\"","Ye Wangchuan still had the mood to chuckle lightly, his narrow eyes deep and lazy, looking aside: \"You’re not leaving, but what about Guan Yan? Would you trust leaving her to someone else?\"","Qin Si’s throat was filled with the taste of blood. He looked at him, then at Guan Yan, and as his hand left the wall, it left a bloody trail: \"You...\"","Guan Yan couldn’t stand the scene, inserting herself between the two somewhat helplessly: \"I say, if you’re going to have this conversation, can you leave me out of it?\"","Her joking manner quickly returned to seriousness as she spoke to Ye Wangchuan: \"I’m not leaving either. My decision has nothing to do with Qin Si, I made a promise to Zhui Guang.\"","Jian Jin raised her hand nearby: \"Me too, I promised Qiao Nian.\""]},{"number":3932,"title":"Chapter 3932: Jian Jin: I’m Leaving","paragraphs":["Ji Lin said, \"Master Wang, it’s impossible for me to leave on my own. Besides, if no one else is leaving, I can’t go out by myself either.\"","Ye Wangchuan glanced at the determined faces around, giving them no chance to accompany him to death: \"What I mean is also what Qiao Nian means.\"","Ye Wangchuan didn’t give them a chance to refute, the thick darkness dissolved into a pool of spring water: \"She wouldn’t want you to die with me here... don’t expect me to do what you can’t.\"","Guan Yan and Jian Jin fell silent simultaneously.","It was Jian Jin who acted first, standing up straight, looking at him earnestly, her face serious: \"Have you thought it through?\"","Ye Wangchuan gave her a calm look for her to understand.","\"Alright.\" Jian Jin nodded, getting the answer: \"As long as you’ve thought it through.\"","Their conversation was cryptic, making Qin Si frown deeply. Before he could ask, Jian Jin turned to the others and said, \"I’ll follow Young Master Ye’s arrangement.\"","\"You...\" Ji Lin’s gaze at her was not polite.","Jian Jin shrugged, meeting their doubtful eyes: \"I know what you’re thinking, and I know some of you don’t fully trust me. I did come for QIAO, and I’m prepared to die here tonight. But shouldn’t we respect the wishes of the person involved?\"","\"Young Master Ye himself said not to impose our thoughts on him. He doesn’t want to make the decision that QIAO herself wouldn’t make here. So, I’ll go along with the arrangement, got a problem?\"","Those present, including Ji Lin, were rendered speechless by her question, unable to refute for a long time.","Qin Si looked deeply moved as he gazed at Ye Wangchuan, his brows furrowed into the character ’Chuan’, asking in a deep voice, \"Do you really want to stay behind alone?\"","Seeing Qin Si’s reddened eyes, Ye Wangchuan chuckled, leaning back, resting lazily against the wall: \"Don’t look at me like that, as if I’m going to die immediately.\"","Qin Si said nothing, his eyes said it all.","\"... Isn’t that so?!\"","Ye Wangchuan’s smile faded from his lips, his dark eyes like deep, serene seas, he said calmly: \"Don’t worry, I’m not so eager to die. I’ll try to wait for Mo Xi to arrive.\"","He had promised to give Qiao Nian a wedding that everyone would envy. He didn’t want to die, nor would he, before fulfilling that promise...","Just then, Guan Yan interrupted everyone’s conversation.","\"They’re coming up!\"","\"...\"","The atmosphere plummeted to freezing point.","Everyone’s gaze involuntarily fell on Ye Wangchuan.","Ye Wangchuan stood up, tidied his clothes, picked up the smoke bombs he had placed by the wall earlier, grabbed a weapon, and without looking back, said to the others: \"What Jian Jin said is what I want to say. This is my will, please cooperate.\"","Ji Lin’s face was filled with sorrow as he shouted, \"Master Wang.\"","Ye Wangchuan didn’t look back as he walked away, his steps unwavering.","Ji Lin watched his back, still wanting to say something.","But Qin Si pulled him away, handed him a weapon, and reprimanded coldly: \"Can’t you understand? This is what he wants us to do.\"","Ji Lin still didn’t want to leave.","Qin Si gritted his teeth and whispered: \"Only if we get out, do we have a chance to cooperate with Mosili from outside to rescue him. Staying inside, except for dying, do you have any other use?\"","Ji Lin also realized, gripping the gun in his hand tightly: \"Young Master Qin, do you mean...\"","Qin Si, having matured overnight, looked at the man’s back and said mournfully: \"Momentary impulse is useless, we must fight for a greater chance of victory for him.\""]},{"number":3933,"title":"Chapter 3933: Only Master Wang Remains","paragraphs":["His thoughts were simple.","Since Ye Wangchuan wouldn’t let them stay, they would leave.","If they managed to break out, there might be a chance to get close to Lu Zhi; as long as one of them could control Lu Zhi, would the others inside dare to act recklessly?","Guan Yan glanced at him and said, \"You’ve grown up.\"","In the past, Qin Si would definitely have flirted a bit with her, but now Ye Wangchuan was going alone to buy them time to break out of the siege.","He really didn’t feel like being nonchalant as before, and he had no interest in bantering with Guan Yan, his mind filled only with thoughts on how to approach Lu Zhi...","Outside, they had no idea what Ye Wangchuan was doing.","All they heard was a loud crash as if something had been knocked down, followed by shouting, \"Damn, it’s a bomb! Get down!\"","Then they heard Ye Wangchuan’s calm, commanding voice: \"Go!\"","Jian Jin, Guan Yan, Qin Si, and others immediately ran toward the stairwell.","Upon reaching there, they saw thick smoke obscuring the stairway, only glimpsing a few people lying on the ground moaning.","Someone noticed Guan Yan and others, immediately shouting, \"Sangs, they’re escaping!\"","Before he finished speaking, he saw a pair of shoes stop beside him, then someone squatted down, cold and slender fingers pinched his neck, he met the man’s icy, domineering gaze, without giving him any time to react, a cold gun muzzle aimed at his forehead, and the trigger was pulled.","\"Bang!\"","This time, the gun wasn’t equipped with a silencer.","Everyone present heard the gunshot.","The man fell into a pool of blood.","Meanwhile, Ye Wangchuan calmly stood up from the ground, looking at the chaotic crowd at the stairwell, coldly saying, \"Lu Zhi should have ordered you not to mess with people from the Red Alliance, right? If you don’t want to cause accidental injuries, don’t shoot recklessly.\"","He glanced back at Guan Yan and others, signaling them to go first, as he stayed behind to cover.","Guan Yan took a deep breath, looked at Jian Jin with deep eyes, and then bit her lip before rushing into the thick fog...","Jian Jin pushed Qin Si and Ji Lin, letting them walk in the middle, while she walked at the end. Before plunging into the thick fog, she looked back at the man standing on the steps.","\"I finally understand why Qiao Nian is so resolute in choosing you.\"","Facing the same choice.","Boss Lu had always been persistent about his own feelings, while Ye Wangchuan was different; Ye Wangchuan thought of Qiao Nian’s feelings at this moment.","Keeping them was because Qiao Nian wanted them to protect him.","Sending them away was because he didn’t want Qiao Nian to lose friends and partners.","She was also a woman.","Faced with two similarly outstanding men with completely different styles in front of her, forced to choose, she would make the same choice as Qiao Nian.","Ye Wangchuan was suitable for romance.","Because this man knows how to pamper someone too well.","Boss Lu’s affection wasn’t lacking, but he didn’t know how to love properly.","Between a man who knows how to love and pamper and a man who doesn’t know how to love or express it, even an idiot would know whom to choose.","Before Jian Jin left, she said, \"Hold on, Qiao Nian is rushing over here. At least you have to see her once.\"","\"Understood.\"","Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes dangerously, watching her step into the fog created by the smoke bomb until she disappeared, then slipped away from the stairwell.","Everyone was gone.","Now he had to drag it out on his own.","**","Ten thousand feet above the ground.","Qiao Nian was flying a helicopter and almost at her destination.","She received a message from Jian Jin — [Young Master Ye stayed alone at the headquarters, we all made it out.]"]},{"number":3934,"title":"Chapter 3934: The Reclusive Family’s Loyal Dog","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian skimmed through the text message in one glance, her beautiful face sinking, her dark eyes losing all light, leaving only a cold edge.","\"How much longer until we arrive?\"","The driver in the front passenger seat glanced at the numbers on the dashboard, mentally calculating flight speed and distance. He finally got the answer and looked over: \"We still need ten minutes.\"","\"Ten minutes, huh.\" Qiao Nian lowered her eyes, her eyelashes slightly drooping to cover the emotions in her gaze, forcing down the violent aura all around her.","But the co-pilot sitting next to her could still feel the explosive irritability coming off the girl, and immediately tried to lower his presence.","Zhui Guang had just finished reading his phone when his expression turned extremely ugly. So what exactly had happened?","Qiao Nian didn’t have Mind Reading Technique and had no idea what the person in the front passenger seat was thinking, so she naturally couldn’t answer his doubts. Right now she was burning with anxiety, wishing she could arrive at their destination immediately.","...","Outside the Red Alliance headquarters where Lu Zhi was.","The man inside bent over and lowered his voice to report the situation to him: \"Mr. Lu, those people used smoke bombs to break out.\"","\"Do you want us to just...\" The man made a throat-slitting gesture.","Lu Zhi lifted his eyes and gave him a faint look, folding his hands over his knees: \"Did you forget my orders?\"","The man was so scared he almost slipped to his knees on the floor. \"I’m sorry, Mr. Lu, I’m sorry.\"","Fortunately, Lu Zhi didn’t look like he intended to hold it against him. He raised his hand slightly and told him: \"Get lost.\"","\"...\" The man didn’t dare stay for even a second, walking off without looking back, terrified that this moody big shot would change his mind.","Shadow also walked over quickly at this moment, stopped in front of him, and said, \"Why didn’t you make a move, Lu Zhi?\"","Lu Zhi spoke in an extremely flat tone: \"I said I wouldn’t touch the Red Alliance people. Besides, my Assistant is still inside. How do you expect me to make a move?\"","\"But Ye Wangchuan could be in there too!\" Shadow was agitated.","Lu Zhi swept a glance over his flailing gestures, still unmoved: \"So the empress wants to unilaterally tear up the cooperation?\"","Shadow choked on that, his face turning iron-blue as he flung out his hand: \"That’s not what I mean.\"","\"Good.\" Lu Zhi turned his wheelchair and headed back, the wind scattering his voice: \"I won’t touch her people. My only target is Ye Wangchuan.\"","This Lu Zhi is a total Madman! Shadow forced his temper down, moved off to the side, and called Nie Qingru to report the progress on this end.","...","The time tonight seemed to stretch on infinitely.","As soon as Qin Si, Guan Yan, and the others came out, they were immediately surrounded by Lu Zhi’s people, who had already received the news. They didn’t see Lu Zhi, but they did see Shadow walking over in a black suit.","Qin Si saw Shadow appear and immediately spat out, \"Good dog of the reclusive family!\"","Dozens of gun barrels outside were pointed like black holes straight at their heads, and he was still the only one who could curse without changing expression at a time like this.","\"Quite the temper.\" Shadow narrowed his eyes, a dark gloom filling his gaze as he looked at him and said, \"Lu Zhi only said to keep the Red Alliance and Assistant Jian. He never said I had to care about you. I can send you on your way anytime.\"","Guan Yan didn’t waste words. She stepped forward to stand in front of Qin Si, her peach blossom eyes lifting slightly, fearless and fierce: \"If you want to touch him, you touch me first.\"","Shadow raised his brows, his gaze sweeping over the two of them: \"Oh? Didn’t think someone from the Red Alliance would take a liking to a rich young master from Beijing.\"","Qin Si immediately wanted to make a move, but Guan Yan blocked him, signaling him to wait with a gesture behind her back, while outwardly she calmly tried to draw Shadow out.","\"Where’s Lu Zhi? I want to see him.\"","\"Lu Zhi’s busy.\""]},{"number":3935,"title":"Chapter 3935: Everyone Is Striving","paragraphs":["Guan Yan, undeterred, said, \"He’s a good friend of our boss. Tonight, after causing such a commotion, shouldn’t he give us an explanation?\"","Shadow laughed, \"You’re mistaken. Tian Chen wasn’t involved; tonight is a private agreement between Lu Zhi and our empress. He owes our empress a big favor and had to lend us some manpower. It’s us taking action tonight.\"","\"Heh.\" Guan Yan looked at him with deep eyes, \"Do you believe what you’re saying yourself?\"","Shadow squinted at her, then suddenly said after a moment, \"Are you stalling for time?\"","Guan Yan seemed unresponsive, but in reality, you could see her fingers curl slightly, a natural reaction when one is nervous.","Shadow, sharp-eyed, noticed her subtle movement and looked past them towards the mansion behind, where sounds of gunfire could be heard.","Because the radio signals inside were cut off, he didn’t know the specific situation at the moment.","But with Qin Si, Jian Jin, and others outside, only Ye Wangchuan was left inside; he didn’t think one person could cause much trouble.","So disdain filled his eyes as he softly said to Guan Yan and the others, \"You don’t think Ye Wangchuan can walk out alive, do you?\"","\"What a joke!\"","He said it, and he did it.","Shadow mercilessly mocked, \"He’s human, not god. Even if god came tonight, they’d go to Hell! Stalling won’t help. The empress just wants to teach Qiao Nian a lesson, especially since he’s repeatedly ruined the empress’s plans; he’s asking for death!\"","\"You damn...\" Ji Lin cursed aloud, drawing his gun.","Dozens of guns aimed at them were immediately cocked.","The scene was on the verge of erupting.","Fortunately, Jian Jin stepped forward, pressing down Ji Lin’s gun barrel, and then threatened those surrounding them, \"Open your damn eyes and see who I am! Let me see who dares to make a move! If anyone makes a move tonight, as long as I, Jian Jin, have a breath left, I will remember him and retaliate against his entire family at any cost!\"","The guns aimed at them shifted, Lu Zhi’s men began to eye each other uncertainly, unsure how to proceed.","They knew Jian Jin, and their attitude towards her was certainly different from that of an ordinary person.","Jian Jin made her threat clear; anyone who ignored it was asking for trouble.","Shadow, seeing everyone wavering because of Jian Jin’s few words, looked extremely displeased and sternly reminded, \"Don’t forget who your master is!\"","The scene shifted to a confrontation.","Neither side was willing to yield.","But those surrounding Jian Jin were mainly Lu Zhi’s people; Lu Zhi had ordered not to harm Guan Yan and Jian Jin. Coupled with Jian Jin’s harsh words, for the moment, truly no one dared forcefully to act and seize them.","Although the process differed from what they imagined, this back-and-forth effectively stalled for time.","Only the continuous sounds of explosions and gunfire from the mansion behind tortured Qin Si and the others’ hearts every second.","They could only stall for time here; they couldn’t see Lu Zhi, nor did they have any other viable way of rescuing anyone, hoping Master Wang could hold out.","**","Five minutes in normal times is nothing more than a blink of an eye, not enough to eat a bowl of noodles or finish a game... But in life-and-death moments, five minutes is long enough, long enough to experience life and death several times.","Ye Wangchuan, on his own, had to hold off dozens of people himself, an extremely challenging feat. These people weren’t just randomly picked by Lu Zhi; they were figures from dangerous lists rich in combat experience."]},{"number":3936,"title":"Chapter 3936: Capture Alive or Kill on the Spot","paragraphs":["He was accidentally shot in the right shoulder, and a glaring bloodstain blossomed on his shirt as his rose-colored lips quickly lost color.","Someone below saw it and immediately shouted excitedly, \"He’s been shot! Quick! Keep suppressing him with firepower!\"","The young man’s eyes were bloodshot. Hearing this good news, he made a ’continue’ gesture and said in a deep voice, \"Don’t give him a chance!\"","No wonder they were so excited.","This Y was just too formidable a fighter.","Several of their brothers were taken down here, and if this continued, they might all have to stay behind as well.","This went against their original intention.","They had counted on their numerical advantage to keep their losses between 1 to 3 people.","But now...","The young man looked at the brothers fallen on the ground in disarray, at least a dozen, far exceeding their psychological expectations.","Thinking of this, he steeled his resolve and shouted even more intimidatingly, \"Suppress them for me!\"","...","A slew of bullets rained densely toward the second-floor stairway, as if they had decided to take advantage of Ye Wangchuan’s gunshot wound to finish him off.","Amidst the dense fire suppression, there was no sound from the second floor.","The young man decisively called a few people, leaned down to grab weapons and said solemnly, \"You follow me upstairs.\"","The few people he mentioned happened to be Nie Qingru’s trusted aides. They exchanged glances and raised their weapons to follow.","Ye Wangchuan was more challenging than anyone had anticipated; under these circumstances, it was difficult to distinguish whose side everyone was on, so they now collectively took orders from Sangs.","The young man carried an aggressive aura, leading Nie Qingru’s forces to raid upstairs while still softly ordering the people below to keep applying fire pressure to give them the opportunity to advance.","Despite all this, it was extremely difficult for them to go up.","Ye Wangchuan had just sent others out but had occupied the stairway position alone, driving them from the fourth floor to now the second floor.","Any further retreat, and they would be chased by Ye Wangchuan into the living room, or worse, driven out. That was not an acceptable outcome!","After all, they held an absolute advantage in terms of numbers, yet were being dominated by one person, which left anyone feeling frustrated.","The young man was no exception.","Since being recruited by Lu Zhi into the illegal zone, he had always performed swiftly and rarely failed. Facing Y this time, despite his apprehension, he still held confidence in challenging his opponent.","Yet, with such an advantage, he found himself at a disadvantage, feeling extremely irritated. As they approached the stairway, the young man turned back to solemnly urge his team.","\"Be careful when we get up there. He was shot once, but we aren’t sure where or how severe it was. It’s always wise to be cautious.\"","\"Shall we capture him alive or...\" The reclusive family’s people instinctively sought his opinion.","The young man pursed his lips and remembered Lu Zhi’s orders, declaring without hesitation, \"Kill on the spot!\"","Nie Qingru’s close aides showed a knowing expression.","They exchanged no further words, waiting for Sangs’ order to charge ahead.","However, just then, a change occurred.","A small drone flew out from the second-floor stairs, and Sangs looked up, vaguely seeing something tied to it.","As the drone got closer, he finally saw clearly what the black circular object attached to it was, and his expression changed instantly as he fell to the ground, shouting, \"Don’t shoot! Stop! Stop immediately!\""]},{"number":3937,"title":"Chapter 3937: Master Wang Is Injured","paragraphs":["Before they went up, he specifically ordered the firepower below to provide cover.","They approached the second-floor staircase, but the people below were still some distance away and hadn’t immediately noticed the items tied to the drone like Sangs and his team did.","Everyone instinctively wanted to shoot down the flying drone.","Ye Wangchuan used human instinct.","The next second, the drone was hit, and the sparks from the bullet ignited the objects tied to it.","All they heard was a \"boom!\"","A huge flame rose, and the wave of heat blew Sangs and his team, who had just managed to get up there, back down.","He himself, being experienced and quick to react, noticed the dangerous items on the drone and immediately ducked in the opposite direction to avoid it.","Nie Qingru’s close aides weren’t as fortunate; they reacted slower, similar to those below the stairs, still looking up to see what on earth was tied to the drone flying above them.","Before they could see clearly, the explosion blinded them, and they were knocked away, inevitably penetrated by debris from the blast.","Several people hit the ground, spat out a mouthful of water, and then fainted.","Even Sangs himself was struck by the blast’s impact, seeing stars, and for several seconds his vision was black, unable to regain his senses.","...","Upstairs.","The man, who calmly exploited human weaknesses to repel their strong assault, also suffered internal injuries from being too close.","Ye Wangchuan calmly wiped the blood from the corner of his lips, indifferently tore his clothes, and used fabric strips to bind the wound on his shoulder, temporarily staunching the bleeding.","This time his injury was in an unfavorable spot, right on the right shoulder, greatly affecting the flexibility of his right hand; an ordinary person might have already given up.","But Ye Wangchuan didn’t react much, simply treated his injury and then bowed his head to move his left wrist, bent to pick up the gun from the ground with his left hand, and headed toward the window.","The windows of the Red Alliance headquarters could offer a view of the situation outside. Ye Wangchuan dragged his injured right hand closer but didn’t directly stand in front of the window to look.","Instead, he pressed his body against the wall at a 45° angle to look outside.","He was very clear that with Lu Zhi’s personality, it was impossible for him to overlook such an obvious escape route as the window, so there must be a large number of snipers outside targeting this spot.","Anyone attempting to break through the window to escape from inside would be shot like a sieve by external snipers!","He squinted at the outside, in the pitch-black night, only seeing a few scattered light spots moving, without hearing any sounds of gunfire outside.","It seemed Jian Jin and the others were at least temporarily safe.","Ye Wangchuan lowered his gaze, his face expressionless. Now he was unusually a bit disheveled, the dark hair hanging down covering his smooth forehead, the shirt stained with blood, but the long legs outlined by the black pants were still straight and long, standing there exhibiting the aristocratic temperament of a well-bred young lord.","Despite his dire situation, Ye Wangchuan only lowered his head, tightened the fabric on his right shoulder, picked up his weapon, and pushed the door to enter the warehouse where Qiao Nian had stored things.","The communications inside were completely cut off.","He couldn’t even accurately tell the time, relying only on mental calculations to roughly estimate how much time had passed.","Ye Wangchuan walked to the warehouse, casually picked up a small item from one of the boxes, and pondered how he could delay further.","... I wonder how Mo Xi’s side is progressing."]},{"number":3938,"title":"Chapter 3938: It’s Only a Matter of Time Before He Is Dealt With","paragraphs":["The illegal zone is destined to be restless tonight.","Lu Zhi personally took action to minimize the commotion.","Initially, not many people noticed tonight’s unusual activity, but Jian Jin specially investigated the Red Alliance headquarters after receiving a call from Tattoo Arm... As a result, the information was leaked.","By the time it was close to dawn, many major forces in the illegal zone had already received the news.","Quite a few big shots were already asleep, only to be awakened by this urgent news, and gathered their main members for a night meeting with panda eyes.","\"I heard Tian Chen is in conflict with the Red Alliance? Why would Lu Zhi quarrel with Zhui Guang? Aren’t these two always on good terms?\"","\"No idea.\"","The others exchanged glances, also quickly changing clothes upon receiving the news and hurried over.","Someone frowned and suggested, \"Could it be that there’s some resource we don’t know about that fell into the illegal zone, and they’re fighting over it?\"","This theory isn’t impossible.","The others furrowed their brows and pondered.","But the information they have is too limited.","Besides knowing Lu Zhi led his men to surround the Red Alliance headquarters, all news is now under lockdown. They are clueless about what is happening inside!","\"If only we could sneak one or two of our people in!\" someone slapped the table and sighed.","Most people were rational and quickly shook their heads to stop: \"No, let Tian Chen and the Red Alliance fight, we should just watch the fun from the side. Which of these two is someone we can afford to provoke? Sending people in to gather information recklessly, if caught by Lu Zhi... We all know his methods, he’s a superficially kind but ruthless figure, doesn’t blink when he makes his move.\"","Everyone present remembered the methods Lu Zhi used in the illegal zone over the years, one by one, their backs tensed with fear, no longer fantasizing about sending someone to gather intel.","...","Meanwhile.","The manor where Nie Qingru resides was brightly lit, as bright as daylight.","Shadow took all the personnel they brought from the reclusive family to cooperate with Lu Zhi. Only patrolling mercenaries and secret guards dedicated to Nie Qingru’s safety remained in the manor.","Because Qiao Nian is still in the north, the manor’s defenses are extremely weak right now, arguably the least protected time around Nie Qingru during this period.","Everyone focused their attention within a hundred miles outside the Red Alliance headquarters, very few paid attention to the reclusive family empress who stirred up waves upon landing in the illegal zone.","Even Nie Qingru herself paid little attention to the surrounding environment, focusing all her energy on the cooperation with Lu Zhi.","Shadow kept her updated via video reports.","\"...Jian Jin and others have come out. Including Guan Yan from the Red Alliance, their cooperation is very poor, but Lu Zhi won’t allow any action!\"","\"If he doesn’t allow it, then just leave them. Our only target is Ye Wangchuan, the others are small fries, we can deal with them anytime once we have the chance.\"","Nie Qingru adjusted the scarf at her collar, elegantly sitting in front of the projector. She bent down to take a sip of the tea brewed by the servant on the table, her demeanor aristocratic and graceful as she lightly placed the cup down, raising her eyes to look at the man in the video, her gaze sharp.","\"Lu Zhi’s people haven’t taken Ye Wangchuan down?\"","\"Not yet.\"","Nie Qingru seemed to recall something, slightly impatient and chuckled lightly, \"What a joke, for someone claiming to be the Crowned King of the illegal zone, yet he can’t handle an outsider effectively after so long.\"","Shadow understood what Nie Qingru wanted to hear: \"...Empress, he has only one person left. It’s only a matter of time before we resolve him.\""]},{"number":3939,"title":"Chapter 3939: Someone Forced Their Way In","paragraphs":["Nie Qingru’s wrinkles around her eyes smoothed out, feeling much more relaxed, she sneered, \"I just want to see that little wolf cub face the loss of a loved one! She always thinks I’m wrong, but I want to see how calm she remains when the same thing happens to her.\"","Her reason for targeting Ye Wangchuan was quite simple—disgust Qiao Nian!","Besides, there was also the reason Shadow had previously mentioned to Jian Jin and others—Ye Wangchuan had repeatedly disrupted her plans, becoming quite an eyesore.","This time, she cooperated with Lu Zhi to target Ye Wangchuan as a deep lesson for Qiao Nian, while also removing a good helper of the wolf cub, redirecting Beijing’s hatred towards the illegal zone, perfectly concealing herself, and rescuing Continent M from the struggle with Beijing...","For her, the death of one person could solve so many problems, if Ye Wangchuan didn’t die, who would?","\"Remember, if Lu Zhi doesn’t act soon, you order our people to take action secretly, no matter what, we must solve him tonight.\"","Nie Qingru narrowed her eyes, speaking lightly.","\"Actually, if she didn’t oppose me, it wouldn’t have come to this. She is my granddaughter, carrying my blood... I’m willing to give her a chance, but she never cherishes it, constantly clinging to her mother’s death, demanding answers from me. Do I need to answer to anyone in my position now? She clearly could listen to me and in the future, I wouldn’t treat her unfairly after I pass, but she stubbornly does not listen, so it’s not my fault.\"","Shadow naturally spoke for her: \"You have already given Miss Qiao too many opportunities.\"","\"Yes, I have already given her so many chances, and yet she refuses to bow down for a dead person.\" Nie Qingru’s face was covered with frost, eyes showing a faint sinister emotion.","Actually, even losing Qiao Nian like this, Nie Qingru still felt reluctant... It’s just a pity that such a useful blade refuses to be used by her, it has no meaning to keep it.","Nie Qingru knows well how to drive a person mad, casually instructing Shadow: \"Make sure when our people act, they understand the art of it, don’t kill him all at once, play with him a bit.\"","Only when Qiao Nian rushes back to see her beloved being brutally killed can a person be pained to the point of mental collapse.","If she cannot make Qiao Nian her own, she must destroy her completely!","\"Understood, Empress.\" Shadow, who has been by her side for many years, understood the hidden meaning in Nie Qingru’s every word.","Nie Qingru dismissively hummed, as if she could already see the scene of Qiao Nian breaking down when she arrived, feeling much better.","As the two spoke.","Suddenly, there was an urgent knock on the door.","Shadow also heard it, immediately speaking worriedly: \"Empress, what’s going on?\"","Nie Qingru had not expected someone outside to be so indiscreetly knocking on her door in such a panic, so she had to get up with a stern face and open the door.","She saw the servant outside and her mouth pulled down: \"What are you doing? Didn’t I say not to disturb me unless it’s necessary?!\"","The servant, panicked and lost, said to her: \"Empress, someone has broken in, insisting on seeing you.\"","Nie Qingru sharply caught her wording: \"Broken in?\"","This is her residence, who dares to ’break in’?!","The servant nodded like a chick pecking rice in confirmation: \"Those people broke in, they’re in the living room right now, insisting on seeing you.\"","...","In the living room.","Nie Qingru, led by the servant, walked out of the room, and saw more than a dozen swaggering men standing in the hall as she descended the stairs."]},{"number":3940,"title":"Chapter 3940: Out of Respect for the Buddha","paragraphs":["All of these people, without exception, were armed and exuded an intense aura of danger, akin to desperados.","The leader, however, was a man with gold-rimmed glasses who looked refined and scholarly, standing out awkwardly among these fierce individuals.","The servant led Nie Qingru down the stairs. Faced with a group of armed intruders, she was so frightened that she trembled and whispered, \"Empress, it’s them.\"","Mo Xi also saw Nie Qingru come down, adjusted the edge of his glasses, and greeted her politely, \"You must be the empress of the reclusive family. I’ve heard so much about you!\"","When Nie Qingru saw the hand extended in front of her, she neither moved nor reached out to shake it. Instead, she retracted her gaze, slightly raised her chin with an imperious attitude, squinted, scanned the group, and said directly, \"What do you want with me? Just say it.\"","\"Hehe.\" Mo Xi withdrew his hand, touched the bridge of his nose, unfazed by the slight, smiled, and said to Nie Qingru, \"Allow me to introduce myself to the empress first. I am Mo Xi, from the Dark Fort on Continent F, and these are my brothers.\"","When Nie Qingru heard the keywords ’Continent F’ and ’Dark Fort,’ her expression shifted slightly, the situation she most wanted to avoid had occurred.","Restraining herself, she looked at the person in front of her, took a step back, and asked, \"What do you want?\"","Mo Xi ignored her retreat, still as refined and polite as when they first met, smiled, and looked at her, \"No need to be nervous, we’re not here to do anything, just want you to make a call.\"","As he spoke, he took out a phone and handed it over, maintaining his courtesy, but his smile did not reach his eyes: \"It’s the one called Shadow by your side, right? Just give him a call and tell him we’re visiting the manor.\"","Nie Qingru did not extend her hand, merely looked at him coldly, \"You don’t think just a few of you can hold me here, do you? This is the manor!\"","She still had secret guards protecting her; should Mo Xi and his men make a move, the secret guards would appear.","Mo Xi paused only slightly at her words, lazily lifted his eyelids, adjusted his glasses, smiled faintly: \"Empress, why make things difficult for us?\"","\"Since we came to find you, we are prepared. We are just a bunch of rough men, tough and unafraid of death. But you’re different, you hold an exalted status as the empress of the reclusive family, to perish together with us...tsk, it’s not worth it.\"","Nie Qingru heard the implication, \"Are you threatening me?!\"","Mo Xi took off his glasses, revealing his hawk-like eyes, and smiled, \"I can’t just chitchat with you here.\"","Their boss was still trapped inside the Red Alliance headquarters by those bastards, and he had risked everything with his brothers to deal with the mercenaries outside.","Did Nie Qingru really think they were here to chat?","With their intentions bare, Nie Qingru’s expression changed from ugly to cold and fierce, and she threatened in a low voice, \"You know the consequences of offending me...\"","\"Haha.\" Mo Xi laughed lightly, then became serious, \"Empress, don’t scare us, the brothers are timid, if someone panics and misfires, it would be unfortunate if you got hurt. After all... you share some blood with Miss Qiao, and out of respect for her, we must give you some face, don’t you think?\""]},{"number":3941,"title":"Chapter 3941: In the End, She Still Relies on Qiao Nian’s Reputation","paragraphs":["Nie Qingru’s face instantly turned ashen, her fingernails dug into her flesh without her noticing the pain. She glared at Mo Xi intensely.","One moment, she was saying that Qiao Nian should be proud of having her blood flowing through her veins. The next moment, someone was pointing out that she relies on a blood relation with that wolf cub to stay safe. Nothing could be more humiliating than this.","Mo Xi ignored her glare, once again pushing his phone towards her, politely saying, \"Empress, please.\"","\"...\" Nie Qingru looked at the phone pushed in front of her again, trembling with rage and feeling utterly embarrassed.","But given the current situation, she had no choice. A dozen pairs of eyes stared at her, and Nie Qingru was fully aware that if she didn’t comply, these people wouldn’t continue to ’politely’ chat with her...","As the empress of the reclusive family, being intruded upon and threatened at home was unbearable, akin to being slapped in the face.","She slowly reached out to take the phone, her expression cold, saying, \"Even if I have my people stand down, it’s useless. Lu Zhi’s people won’t listen to me.\"","Mo Xi laughed, \"No need for you to worry about that.\"","Nie Qingru vaguely sensed what they wanted to do, but with so many eyes watching her every move, she had no choice but to make a forced call to Shadow.","\"Beep.\" The tone just sounded.","On the other end, Shadow immediately answered, \"Hello?\"","Nie Qingru glanced at the fierce men who had barged into the living room, took a deep breath, and said quietly, \"It’s me.\"","Shadow recognized her voice, quickly saying, \"Empress, are you alright? Just now...\" Just now Nie Qingru didn’t have time to cut off the video upstairs, and he vaguely heard something happened at the manor.","Nie Qingru put it on speaker, pressed her lips and interrupted him, \"A few guests came to the manor just now, I went out.\"","Shadow clearly sensed the implication in her words, somewhat urgently, \"Empress...\"","Nie Qingru didn’t give him a chance to continue, \"Notify our people to stop immediately.\"","The phone was quiet for two seconds as if analyzing Nie Qingru’s current situation, and quickly compromised, \"Yes! I understand.\"","Nie Qingru raised her eyes to look at the man wearing glasses, indicating with her gaze, ’Is this enough?’","Mo Xi smiled lightly, casually saying, \"Thank you, Empress.\"","Nie Qingru hadn’t hung up, meaning Shadow could hear their conversation.","When a strange man’s voice appeared on Nie Qingru’s call, Shadow immediately understood, coldly saying, \"I warn you not to mess around! Otherwise, I will tear you to pieces, drawn and quartered!\"","Mo Xi took his phone from Nie Qingru, hearing the furious threat, gently pushed the gold-rimmed glasses on the bridge of his nose, responding in good humor, \"That’s what I wanted to say. If you want the Empress to remain unharmed, it’s best to protect Master Wang for us. Otherwise, you might only end up burying the Empress...\"","\"You dare!\" Shadow was furious.","Mo Xi was much calmer, \"Whether I dare depends on how well you do, if you fail, I wouldn’t have any reservations.\"","\"Don’t harm the Empress, I...\" Shadow still had something to say.","Mo Xi didn’t give him the chance, elegantly and casually hung up the call, interrupting Shadow’s urgent voice, leaving the living room in silence once again."]},{"number":3942,"title":"Chapter 3942: What We Need Is Your Non-Cooperation","paragraphs":["Nie Qingru had just heard clearly, and a sense of crisis had already formed in her heart, but nothing showed on her face. Instead, the moment Mo Xi hung up, she pretended to stay calm and opened her mouth first: \"I’ve already done what you said. You can leave the estate now, right?\"","\"No rush.\" Mo Xi looked at her with a half-smile and said, \"We still have something we need you to help with.\"","He said he was \"asking\" Nie Qingru for help, but from head to toe, there wasn’t the slightest trace of someone requesting a favor.","More like blatant, naked threats!","\"What else do you want me to do?\" Nie Qingru couldn’t help getting annoyed.","\"You just reminded me.\" Mo Xi deliberately needled her, speaking unhurriedly: \"Lu Zhi’s people really don’t listen to you. To make him obey, we’re going to have to trouble you, old lady, to record another video.\"","Nie Qingru almost spat blood, glaring at him as if she could bore a hole straight through that fox-like face of his, her expression ice-cold: \"You think I’m going to cooperate with you?\"","Mo Xi raised his brows, looking very surprised. \"You’ve misunderstood, old lady.\"","He made a forward gesture to the others, then turned back to Nie Qingru with a smiling gaze: \"What we want is for you not to cooperate! If you cooperate, the video we get won’t have enough impact. The less you cooperate, the better!\"","\"What are you trying to do!\"","This time Nie Qingru’s face really went green.","Mo Xi ignored her now, turned and said to the brothers he’d brought, \"Move. Get to work.\"","...","Three minutes later.","Continent M.","In the most central area of the reclusive family, the major faction leaders of the Privy Council each received an anonymous video.","After watching the contents, their reactions were almost identical: they immediately called the others, demanding a private, confidential meeting in the parliament hall.","Luke’s workplace was closest, so he was the first to arrive at the parliament hall.","Right after him, Old Xue came hurrying in, wearing a freshly washed but old Tang suit, and finally the archbishop strode in with a grim expression.","The three were all there.","Quentin instructed the trusted aide beside him: \"You go out first, and shut the door on your way. Don’t let anyone in during this time.\"","\"Yes.\" Jacob didn’t say much, quietly bowed and backed out, closing the parliament hall’s main doors for them and standing guard outside himself.","The parliament hall could easily accommodate a three-hundred-person meeting, which showed how large the place was; the tiered seating alone ran in dense rows for dozens of tiers.","Right now, in this huge space, only the three of them were present; their voices echoed in the emptiness.","\"You all got the video?\"","True to being the most strong-willed and direct of the three, Quentin broke the silence first. While the other two were still mulling over how to bring up the video they’d received, he flicked his sleeve, took a seat, and shattered the equilibrium in the parliament hall.","Luke exhaled in relief, quickly sitting down beside Quentin and tilting his head to ask, \"The archbishop also got that video?\"","\"If I hadn’t, what would I be doing asking you here?\" Quentin looked, rather impatiently, toward the only one who hadn’t spoken yet. \"And Old Xue? You didn’t get the video?\"","He didn’t believe Old Xue hadn’t received it—otherwise, with that old man’s cautious way of doing things, he wouldn’t have come to meet them at the parliament hall without even asking what was going on.","Sure enough, after a brief stiffness in his expression, the old man in the green robe relaxed his shoulders and spoke as if resigning himself: \"I also received the video you’re talking about.\"","Quentin brushed the wrinkles from his sleeve, and said carelessly, \"Since we all got that video, let’s hear it—what are you planning to do?\""]},{"number":3943,"title":"Chapter 3943: Still Want to Chat with Sister Nian? Keep Dreaming","paragraphs":["Old Xue furrowed his brow and paced back and forth: \"We should immediately convene an internal meeting, take a vote to see...\"","\"Do you want everyone to know that our empress of the reclusive family has been taken hostage?\" Quentin interrupted him instantly.","Old Xue’s expression stiffened, his eyes, despite being murky, had a shrewd look as he turned to him: \"Then what do you want to do?\"","Quentin made no effort to conceal his thoughts, openly saying: \"Let’s do what was demanded in the video, pacify them first and then talk.\"","\"No way!\" Old Xue responded immediately.","Luke also chimed in from the side: \"I think what the archbishop said makes sense; risking the empress’s safety is out of the question. The best approach is to comply with their demands first, and once the empress is safe, we can plan what to do next.\"","Old Xue saw the Radical Faction’s Elder Leo also agreeing with the Church’s proposal, and could only fall silent, hoarsely speaking after a long pause: \"If we do this, then all the efforts we’ve laid out in the illegal zone for so long will be wasted.\"","\"Compared to the safety of the empress, these are secondary.\" Quentin said nonchalantly.","Old Xue pulled a sardonic smile, yet refrained from exposing that those families under the Neutral Faction hadn’t been involved in the illegal zone’s operations.","They hadn’t committed financial resources, material aid, or effort; of course, it was easy for them to say ’let it go’.","But many families in the Conservatives had been involved, with years of effort put into it, now having to destroy their painstaking work for the empress.","Who could remain indifferent?","He understood very well what Quentin was planning.","Once the empress returns from the illegal zone, the Privy Council will initiate an impeachment, involving all family members of the reclusive family.","When the time comes, families of all ranks will cast their votes.","They, the Conservatives have supported the empress’s rule for many years, and even within the Radical Faction there are empress supporters; his proposed impeachment might not succeed.","But if... the empress’s years of scheme in the illegal zone get destroyed, harming these families’ interests, then whether they would still support the empress is uncertain.","The archbishop evidently doesn’t want to give the empress a chance to turn the tables upon returning!","\"...As long as you’ve thought it through.\" Despite knowing the other’s calculations, Old Xue couldn’t help but endure it, as the empress is indeed in the hands of outsiders.","Fully aware of the archbishop’s schemes, yet he had to stiflingly tolerate it, Old Xue said: \"This matter involves Qiao Nian, I want to communicate with her first. If she can make a concession for the empress, perhaps it doesn’t need to escalate to the level we’re discussing.\"","\"Hmm.\" The archbishop lifted his gaze, signaling ’go ahead,’ choosing to be a spectator, his demeanor showing a dismissive attitude all around.","Old Xue’s face sank, he pursed his lips as he walked aside to make a call... He knew what the other expected, probably thinking that Qiao Nian would not agree to concessions.","But he felt that the relationship between the empress and Qiao Nian was already conspicuous. If he communicated the empress’s current plight well to Qiao Nian, given they are family, perhaps Qiao Nian wouldn’t let the empress die without lifting a finger.","In a short time, Old Xue had already composed a set of statements in his mind, ready to speak with the girl once the call connected.","Until a mechanical voice sounded from his phone: \"Sorry, the number you dialed is temporarily unavailable.\"","Old Xue immediately frowned, taking the phone out and redialed, placing the phone back to his ear.","This time, he paid extraordinary attention, discovering there wasn’t any dialing tone from the other side but directly the mechanical announcement: \"Sorry, the number you dialed is temporarily unavailable.\""]},{"number":3944,"title":"Chapter 3944: I Heard It, So What","paragraphs":["Old Xue’s face turned dark.","He slowly put down his phone, falling into complete silence.","He had never thought Qiao Nian would block his number!","But when he called just now, it hadn’t even rung once before the mechanical voice said the call couldn’t go through—that meant his number was blacklisted.","Realizing he’d been blocked by Qiao Nian, Old Xue had no choice. He went back to the archbishop and Luke and said, \"We’ll do as you said.\"","The archbishop had already expected this outcome. He rose leisurely to his feet, not forgetting to mock the man in the blue robe: \"Old Xue, you’ve made up your mind? Not going to make another call and ask?\"","Sure enough, Old Xue’s face turned even darker, like soot at the bottom of a pot. His stiff features were even more sour as he said, \"No need.\"","Quentin didn’t tease him any further. Wearing that faint, half-smile, he headed for the door: \"Since this is something we’ve decided together, I’ll trouble you both to notify the families under your jurisdiction.\"","Luke watched his back as he walked away, then politely said to the man in the blue robe, \"Old Xue, I’ll go inform my people first.\"","\"Go.\" The man in the blue robe held back his temper and nodded. Only after Luke had left as well did he press his lips together, swallow his humiliation, and follow them out.","This whole mess, now that it had blown up, would hurt The Conservatives’ families the most. He still had no idea how he was supposed to explain it to those families below.","Just picturing himself announcing this to them later was enough to give Old Xue a splitting headache.","But this was something everyone had already discussed and decided; he didn’t get to back out now. No matter how much his head hurt, he had to grit his teeth and say it.","**","Meanwhile.","Outside the Red Alliance headquarters, spring felt bleak and desolate.","The wind tonight was unnaturally restless, whipping across everyone’s hearts, weighing them down so heavily they couldn’t find peace.","Ever since Shadow received that call from Nie Qingru, he’d rushed to find Lu Zhi and told him about Nie Qingru’s situation.","He demanded Lu Zhi stop immediately.","But to his surprise, Lu Zhi didn’t stop like he’d assumed. Sitting in his wheelchair, one hand resting on the side, he tilted his head slightly, as if he’d just heard something amusing, and looked at him: \"You’re telling me to stop at a time like this.\"","Shadow instantly caught his meaning and frowned. \"The empress is in Ye Wangchuan’s hands!\"","Lu Zhi propped his chin up with one hand, starlit eyes flickering with an unreadable light as he looked at him, leisurely asking back, \"So?\"","Shadow didn’t understand what he was getting at, so he forced himself to be patient and emphasized again: \"The empress is in Ye Wangchuan’s hands. They said if anything happens to Ye Wangchuan, they’ll hurt the empress... so we have to stop immediately to ensure the empress’s safety!\"","\"Oh, now I get it.\" Lu Zhi finally shifted his gaze and said slowly, \"But it seems you still don’t understand our relationship. We’re not subordinate to each other—we’re just cooperating. You have your goals, I have mine. Something happened to your people; that only proves you didn’t think things through. It has nothing to do with me as a partner.\"","\"Lu Zhi, what are you saying?\" Shadow’s face stretched tight.","Lu Zhi’s fingers tapped rhythmically on the armrest of the wheelchair. The corners of his lips held a careless smile as he lazily lifted his eyelids. His eyes were breathtakingly beautiful, but there wasn’t the slightest trace of emotion in them: \"Was I not clear enough? I’m not responsible for the empress.\"","Shadow felt a mouthful of blood surge up his throat. Murder flickered in his eyes as his hand quietly moved to the weapon at his waist. \"You’re going to gamble with the empress’s life?!\"","At that moment, the bodyguard behind Lu Zhi warned him in a deep voice: \"I’d advise you not to move.\""]},{"number":3945,"title":"Chapter 3945: Only Now Realizing Sister Nian Isn’t on the Speedboat","paragraphs":["Lu Zhi lightly stopped him: \"339, be polite to our partners.\"","\"Yes, Mr. Lu.\" The bodyguard, as solid as a tower, immediately bowed his head to admit the mistake, very obedient like a well-behaved child.","Meanwhile, Shadow quickly noticed that the moment he attempted to reach for his gun, a red dot appeared on his forehead. Being battle-hardened, he knew exactly what that red dot on his head signified.","—It meant there was a sniper in the shadows aiming at his head. A slight move would lead to a bullet through his skull!","Shadow couldn’t suppress his surprise and anger, abruptly staring at the young man sitting in the wheelchair: \"Lu Zhi, are you crazy? If you don’t stop tonight, leading to the empress’s accident, the reclusive family won’t spare you.\"","Lu Zhi lowered his eyes, focusing on turning the Blood Jade Ring on his thumb, as if the jade was more interesting than the words Shadow was saying. Without lifting his head, he said: \"Then let them not spare me. Tonight, I won’t spare Ye Wangchuan no matter what!\"","Shadow was exceedingly anxious at heart, but soon two strong men approached him from the left and right, restricting his movements.","\"Sorry, we need your cooperation.\" The two big men smiled kindly.","Veins popped on Shadow’s neck, angrily looking at Lu Zhi: \"Mr. Lu, what’s the meaning of this?\"","Lu Zhi did not hide his intentions, speaking quite openly: \"Before eliminating Ye Wangchuan, I’ll have to trouble you to cooperate a bit.\"","\"You!\" Shadow was so angered that he leaned backward, wishing to rush up and end it swiftly.","However, Lu Zhi had the advantage in numbers and was surrounded by a mysterious bodyguard who was with him 24/7. Even if he was trembling with rage, he had no way to approach, let alone stop him...","Shadow looked towards the young man at the center of the crowd being protected, clenched his fist, and said in a deep voice: \"Lu Zhi, you’ll regret this!\"","Lu Zhi seemed not to hear him, turning to ask someone beside him, glancing at the mansion where no one had yet come out: \"What’s going on inside?\"","The person responsible for passing messages was sweating profusely, wiping the sweat and lowering his voice: \"Maybe... they haven’t dealt with that person yet.\"","Lu Zhi’s gaze darkened, a slight lift to his rosy lips, with an emotionless tone: \"It’s been almost half an hour, and with so many of us going in, you haven’t dealt with one person? Do you think that’s reasonable?\"","No one dared to provoke him, and a collective silence ensued around him.","Lu Zhi impatiently scanned the crowd, seemingly unwilling to waste more time tonight: \"Send another team inside to provide support.\"","\"Yes, Mr. Lu.\" The person ran off to gather people.","Lu Zhi turned and asked someone else: \"Where is that speedboat now?\"","\"Still 300 nautical miles north, hasn’t gone far.\" said a man with an earpiece, in front of a computer ready to be moved at any time.","Lu Zhi’s eyes flashed, pondering briefly until a spark of inspiration caught his mind: \"You said the speedboat moved only 300 nautical miles?\"","\"...Yes, that’s right.\" The man confirmed the satellite monitoring data again, reporting to Lu Zhi: \"Mr. Lu, I checked the map; the speedboat only moved 300 nautical miles.\"","Lu Zhi gripped the armrest, a storm brewing on his handsome face: \"She’s not on the speedboat! Find out where she is immediately!\"","\"...\" Everyone was stunned, unable to react for a moment.","Zhui Guang wasn’t on the speedboat; she couldn’t possibly be flying in the sky.","Just as this thought arose, everyone heard the sound of helicopter blades tearing through the air above."]},{"number":3946,"title":"Chapter 3946: Lu Zhi, What Are You Doing","paragraphs":["Damn, a helicopter!","Before everyone looked up to the sky, their brains had already realized what might be the source of the rotor sound.","They all heard the sound.","Lu Zhi naturally also heard the increasingly closer rotor sound above his head. He looked up, squinting slightly, his expression changed.","The bodyguard behind him leaned close and said in a low voice, \"Mr. Lu, should we have someone shoot it down?\"","The helicopter flying in the sky isn’t easy to shoot down, but that doesn’t mean they don’t have a way to do it; they also have portable missiles.","It’s just that Lu Zhi didn’t want to damage the Red Alliance headquarters building. Otherwise, they could easily and brutally bring down the building, burying people inside without needing to waste so much manpower and resources to capture people.","Lu Zhi didn’t do that. Instead, with a complex expression, he said, \"Tell them to stop; don’t touch the helicopter.\"","\"Mr. Lu?\" The bodyguard, with a sturdy build, looked puzzled.","Lu Zhi didn’t explain to him: \"Just do it!\"","Despite not understanding, 339 still followed his orders to stop the ground missile operation team from targeting the helicopter.","\"Mr. Lu doesn’t want the helicopter touched.\"","The people in charge of locking onto the airborne target were already raising the torpedo missile behind the Jeep. Hearing this, they had to stop their actions, looking at the helicopter about to land and then at Lu Zhi’s unwaveringly close bodyguard, they were clueless and said: \"But the helicopter clearly wants to land.\"","The bodyguard simply repeated Lu Zhi’s order: \"Mr. Lu doesn’t want it touched.\"","The people looked at each other, then quickly gave up the plan to shoot down the helicopter, stopping their actions: \"...Alright then.\"","Like a tower, the bodyguard conveyed the message as per Lu Zhi’s request and then returned without saying much to those people, heading back to Lu Zhi’s side.","Shadow stood about three meters away, watching the gradually descending helicopter, harboring a peculiar suspicion at heart, facing Lu Zhi: \"Could it be Qiao Nian?\"","Lu Zhi did not answer, his gaze firmly locked on the helicopter, as if he could see through the metal to the person flying it inside.","Shadow had an idea.","The arrival could very likely be Qiao Nian!","He was both amazed at how Qiao Nian managed to break through their surveillance and return from the north in such a short time, and secretly relieved that Qiao Nian arrived in time... Otherwise Nie Qingru would be in danger tonight.","The helicopter soon landed on the ground, and the dust stirred up by the rotors blinded the nearby people’s eyes, making everyone raise their hands to cover their mouths and noses.","Everyone watched intently as the girl jumped off the helicopter. She leapt down with grace and landed steadily on the ground.","She wore a cap, her expression unclear, yet it was evident she hurried over, travel-worn.","Alone.","Everyone was waiting to see if anyone else would come off the helicopter, and just as the girl was about to reach their leader, no one else emerged.","In other words—it was just one person!","Most of Lu Zhi’s people had been working with him for years, and some of them knew Jian Jin. Naturally, quite a few had seen Qiao Nian in person.","\"It’s Zhui Guang.\"","\"She really came.\"","\"Alone, impressive!\"","For a moment, there were remarks of all sorts on this open ground. Everyone lowered their voices, whispering, yet the murmurs still reached the girl’s ears.","Qiao Nian walked straight ahead, ignoring the surrounding murmurs.","She stopped in front of Lu Zhi, looking at the young man sitting in a wheelchair. Lips pressed, her eyes trying hard to restrain her anger, yet three parts of her fury were still revealed: \"Lu Zhi, what are you doing.\""]},{"number":3947,"title":"Chapter 3947: Jian Jin Was Furious","paragraphs":["The man sitting in the wheelchair remained unmoved all night, and only at this moment did he show some emotion. He raised his head to meet her gaze, revealing a hint of bitterness on his pale yet handsome face: \"What do you think?\"","He tightened his grip on the wheelchair’s armrest, his knuckles turning white: \"Your arrival won’t help; I must keep him here tonight!\"","Qiao Nian suppressed her anger and coldly asked, \"What did Ye Wangchuan do to offend you?\"","Lu Zhi didn’t answer directly, turning his head: \"He offended someone he shouldn’t have. I owe Nie Qingru a favor, and this is the exchange condition.\"","Qiao Nian didn’t know if she believed this reason, but she turned her head and was about to leave.","Lu Zhi saw her turning to leave and immediately called out to her: \"Where are you going!\"","Qiao Nian stopped in her tracks, slightly turned her head but didn’t look back: \"I’m going inside to find him. Aren’t you repaying Nie Qingru’s favor? Just as well she also quite hates me. You might as well solve it for her and let her vent her anger!\"","\"You!\" Lu Zhi’s lips lost color, the veins on his neck bulged, and he tried to stand by forcefully pushing his arms, but his legs were too weak and he sat back down.","\"Mr. Lu.\" The bodyguard immediately supported his body, worrying: \"Don’t rush, I’ll have someone stop her.\"","Lu Zhi watched the girl heading inside, remained silent for a moment, and said: \"No need, you can’t stop her.\"","The bodyguard blinked, showing a puzzled expression on his wooden face, and before he could say anything, he heard Lu Zhi’s low voice mixed with anger: \"If she wants to go in, let her, but tell the people inside not to hurt her. As for Ye Wangchuan... kill him as planned!\"","Not far away, Shadow was shocked to hear his order and found himself completely unable to understand Lu Zhi anymore.","He thought that once Qiao Nian arrived, Lu Zhi would back down.","But from the looks of it, Lu Zhi had no intention of stopping, and even planned to continue in front of Qiao Nian. Has Lu Zhi gone mad?","Shadow could only think of the word ’madman’ and couldn’t help but shout: \"This will only make Qiao Nian hate you.\"","Lu Zhi curled his lips, as if he had heard something ridiculous, lowered his eyes and muttered, \"What’s wrong with hating me? Hate is also an emotion.\"","Do these people understand her? He understands her.","Since childhood, Qiao Nian had little emotion towards the outside world, seemingly interested in nothing, always maintaining an indifferent attitude towards people and matters.","If he can’t gain her intense love, getting her intense hate isn’t bad either.","Even as Lu Zhi said this, his hands tightened even more on the armrest, his knuckles revealing a bluish-white hue. If... if he could stand, would he still miss her?","...","Guan Yan called out, \"Zhui Guang.\"","\"QAIO, you’re here.\" Jian Jin jumped in before Guan Yan could speak, nervously asking: \"Have you seen Lu Zhi? What did he say, is he willing to stop?\"","Qin Si and Ji Lin were still trapped in the middle of Lu Zhi’s men, dozens of guns still pointed at them, restricting their movement.","Only Qiao Nian moved freely in this area, unbothered by anyone, and yet everyone watched her.","This was why Guan Yan and Jian Jin noticed Qiao Nian’s arrival right away.","Qiao Nian saw Jian Jin and others trapped inside, met Jian Jin’s urgent and painful gaze, shook her head, and said nothing.","Jian Jin was immediately disheartened, biting her lower lip, and squeezed out: \"...Madman!\"","This time she was truly angered by Lu Zhi.","She knew Lu Zhi’s emotional intelligence was low, but she never thought it was to an outrageous degree. QIAO is here, yet he’s still not stopping, what is he thinking?"]},{"number":3948,"title":"Chapter 3948: Sister Nian Kicked the Door Open","paragraphs":["Despite being infuriated, Jian Jin considered both Lu Zhi and Qiao Nian the most cherished people in her life.","She had no choice but to look up, with a slight tremble in her eyes, and said, \"Young Master Ye is still inside, be careful. I’ll make him stop, don’t worry.\"","Qiao Nian didn’t say anything, only nodded and went inside.","Qin Si watched her determined figure and shouted, \"Sister Qiao, I’ll leave Master Wang to you!\"","\"OK.\"","Qiao Nian waved her hand without looking back.","As she kicked open the mansion door and went in, Jian Jin steeled herself, gritting her teeth as she pulled out a gun and pointed it at her own head, shouting fiercely at the people surrounding them, \"Take me to Lu Zhi, or I’ll shoot.\"","Lu Zhi’s people were dumbfounded, not knowing how to respond for a moment.","Jian Jin pressed the gun hard against her head, not giving them time to think, and said coldly, \"Lu Zhi won’t let you touch me. If I die here, you’ll be held responsible, right? What are you hesitating for? Go find him and say I’m going to commit suicide.\"","\"... F*ck, who talks about suicide so lightly.\"","Lu Zhi’s people exchanged glances. The leader reluctantly instructed a subordinate, \"Go tell Mr. Lu about the situation.\"","\"Yes.\" That person jogged off to call for help.","The leader, with his shiny bald head, watched Jian Jin, his eyelids twitching, smiled apologetically, and said, \"Assistant Jian, please don’t make it difficult for me, just put the gun down first...\"","Jian Jin stopped him, \"Stay where you are.\"","The leader reluctantly halted, making don’t-act-recklessly gestures to calm her down, \"I’m not moving, see, I’m not moving. You shouldn’t act impulsively either...\"","Jian Jin loaded the gun without any expression, threatening, \"If you don’t come over, I won’t move. If you try to come over and grab it, I’ll shoot immediately. My death will be on your head.\"","F*ck.","The leader cursed silently, his cautious eyes fixed on Jian Jin, not daring to act rashly, and could only stand and wait for Lu Zhi to arrive.","What’s wrong with these people?","Zhui Guang went into the mansion alone.","Assistant Jian was risking her life to threaten Mr. Lu with suicide.","Have they all gone crazy?","Though the leader felt utterly distressed inside, he maintained a smile on the surface to control the scene as much as possible, \"Alright, I won’t go over, definitely won’t.\"","...","\"Assistant Jian has a gun to her head demanding you go over,\" one of the leader’s subordinates quickly found Lu Zhi, motioning to approach after being checked by the bodyguards.","\"What’s she trying to do?\" Lu Zhi rubbed his temples, then lowered his eyes and said, \"Forget it, 339, push me over.\"","\"Yes.\"","The towering bodyguard behind him said nothing, pushing him toward Jian Jin and the others.","...","At the same time.","Guan Yan was speaking in a low voice, \"What are you doing? Do you really want to die?\"","Jian Jin didn’t move, a hint of bitterness flashing in her eyes, \"If it were you, would you have a better idea?\"","Guan Yan was silent for a moment, then honestly said, \"No.\"","\"Exactly.\" With the relationship involving Qiao Nian between them, though not close friends, they had known each other for a long time, so Jian Jin spoke without reservation, \"Whether it’s Qiao or Boss Lu, I just hope they’re okay. I really have no better option...\"","The events of tonight have led to this point, and no one felt more upset than her.","Jian Jin, caught in the middle, felt her soul being torn in two—on one side was a friend, on the other, someone she had protected for many years. She truly didn’t know what else she could do to resolve this conflict, so she could only gamble with her life, hoping Boss Lu would buy it."]},{"number":3949,"title":"Chapter 3949: Lu Zhi Stopped","paragraphs":["When Jian Jin was feeling uneasy, Lu Zhi arrived, escorted by bodyguards.","The subordinates surrounding Jian Jin and the others stepped aside upon seeing him.","Lu Zhi glanced at Jian Jin in the crowd, who was pointing a gun at himself to threaten others, and pursed his lips, \"When did you become so childish?\"","Jian Jin stood opposite him, suppressing her anguish, and said, \"Boss, I’m serious.\"","\"You’re threatening me with your life?\" Lu Zhi seemed somewhat agitated, sparks hidden deep in his eyes, his face revealing nothing of his thoughts.","\"Yes.\" Jian Jin admitted frankly.","Lu Zhi’s deep gaze was dark; he took a deep breath and calmly said, \"What if I don’t release them? Will you really shoot?\"","Jian Jin said, \"Qiao is in there. I can’t let her be in danger, so you can try.\"","Lu Zhi gripped the railing tightly, looking at her with restraint, \"In your eyes, would I harm her?\"","\"I used to think you wouldn’t. Now, I don’t know anymore.\"","Jian Jin’s words pierced like a precise and cruel knife into Lu Zhi’s heart, leaving him momentarily numb, unable to believe she would say such things.","He thought that after all these years, only Jian Jin understood him, only to find that even she would say this now, going so far as to aim a gun at him to force his hand.","Lu Zhi paused, \"I won’t harm her.\"","Jian Jin didn’t respond directly, half-pulling the trigger, pressuring him aggressively, \"I can’t gamble with Qiao, I can’t afford it, so I want you to let her go.\"","Lu Zhi saw her pulling the trigger halfway; just a little more force, and Jian Jin would shed blood before him.","His pupils contracted an inch, just about to speak, when his phone rang on him.","Lu Zhi picked up the phone, \"Hello.\"","On the other end, who knows what was said, but everyone noticed his expression growing more serious, the surrounding air becoming more and more tense.","Until the atmosphere reached its peak, Lu Zhi gripped the phone tightly and said in a low voice, \"I didn’t expect you to stab me in the back.\"","The archbishop on the other end retorted unyieldingly, \"We didn’t expect Mr. Lu to know the empress was in danger and still won’t stop. So, we’re even!\"","Lu Zhi’s eyes were laden with an inky blackness that couldn’t dissipate. He curled the corner of his mouth, his gaze falling again on the anxious Jian Jin in the distance, finally relenting, \"I’ll remember your kind gesture.\"","He hung up the phone, put it down, looked at Jian Jin, his tone steady and unemotional, \"Put down the gun, I’ll have my people withdraw at once.\"","\"Really?\" Jian Jin hadn’t relaxed her grip, visibly not trusting him.","Lu Zhi didn’t say much, he turned his head and instructed the bodyguard, \"Order our people to withdraw!\"","\"Mr. Lu?\" The bodyguard was extremely shocked, looking between him and Jian Jin, unsure if Lu Zhi was serious or bluffing.","Lu Zhi remained composed and calm, \"Have them retreat!\"","After speaking, he turned back to look at Jian Jin again, \"Put the gun down, there will be no next time.\"","Jian Jin’s eyes heated up all of a sudden, unable to articulate her emotions, feeling countless sour bubbles rushing outward.","She understood that the reason Lu Zhi would retreat was partly due to that strange phone call, and partly because of her, even if her influence was minimal, likely not for love, but years of friendship that pushed him to give way a bit.","Yet it was this small concession that kept her from regretting her decision to stay in the illegal zone all these years.","Jian Jin no longer pressured him, slowly putting down the gun and softly saying, \"You should apologize to Qiao.\"","Lu Zhi ignored her, addressing the others, \"Let’s go back.\""]},{"number":3950,"title":"Chapter 3950: Boss, He’s Out of Ammo","paragraphs":["Inside the Western-style building.","\"Boss, he’s out of bullets.\" The young man had finally forced Ye Wangchuan into a corner with no ammo and no supplies; their nerves, stretched tight to the limit, began to relax.","A bald, burly man watched his partners fall one by one beside him until there were only a dozen of them left. As soon as he relaxed, he couldn’t help tilting his head and spitting: \"Tui, this punk is way too hard to deal with! If we didn’t have our people outside, I’m afraid we’d all be buried in here.\"","The young man let out the stale air from his chest, stared ahead, and said, \"Yeah. If he still had bullets...\" then tonight they’d be the ones turning from hunters into prey, and dying like that would be a fucking joke!","The bald man rubbed his palms together excitedly and urged him on: \"Then what the hell are we waiting for? I’ve been pissed off all night, just waiting to grab this kid and give him the beating he deserves!\"","The young man, on the contrary, glanced at him and said coolly, disapproving, \"He’s a worthy opponent. Give him a quick death later.\"","\"Tch!\" The burly man was unimpressed, but for the sake of face still agreed reluctantly: \"Since the boss said so, I’ll give him a quick one.\"","He muttered under his breath, \"That’s really letting that kid off cheap.\"","At the same time, it was like Ye Wangchuan had already become something they held in the palm of their hands, someone they could crush anytime. Arrogance flickered in his eyes and brows as he jeered, \"So what if he’s Zhui Guang’s man, he still has to die in our brothers’ hands. Looking at it this way, Red Alliance and Zhui Guang aren’t all that, at least when it comes to picking men they should learn from Assistant Jian. Our master is way better~\"","\"Enough.\" The young man cut off his smug rambling, his face grave, still paying close attention to the surroundings and keeping his mind on high alert. He warned, \"It’s not over until the end. Anything can happen at any moment. Talk less and be careful. Let’s finish the job and get out of here.\"","The burly man lifted his gun and said carelessly, \"He’s already out of bullets. If something still goes wrong, that’d be really something.\"","As they were talking, Ye Wangchuan reversed his grip on the gun, holding the barrel, ready to use the butt to smash the first person who rushed him, then snatch their weapon...","This move was extremely risky.","But he had no better option at the moment.","Because he really had fired his last round and had nothing left but close-quarters combat.","Their footsteps were getting closer and closer.","Ye Wangchuan’s usually arrogant face tightened with a rare hint of caution. He clenched the gun, the muscles in his forearm bulging as he primed himself to take down the first person to come at him with lightning speed.","Then, just when everyone was holding their breath, nerves taut, a huge kick to a door sounded from downstairs, abruptly shattering the tension in the air.","\"Bang!\"","The door Qiao Nian kicked flew into the wall and bounced back.","She didn’t even look back as she walked inside, heading straight up the stairs.","Tap, tap, tap.","The girl’s footsteps echoed in the hollow stairwell, every beat at that critical moment landing precisely on everyone’s heart.","One step, two steps.","The footsteps grew closer and closer.","The young man, the burly man, and the others exchanged glances, each seeing the same confusion in the other’s eyes.","\"Who is it?\"","\"Is it one of ours?\"","As the leader of this group, the young man had to keep his cool. He lowered his gun muzzle and said, \"Everyone stay sharp. Be careful.\"","In this urgent, harsh atmosphere, no one was thinking about dealing with Ye Wangchuan anymore; they all wanted to see who the hell had just kicked the door in.","Privately, they assumed it was most likely their own people."]},{"number":3951,"title":"Chapter 3951: Zhui Guang, Are You Kidding?","paragraphs":["However, the blood battle an hour prior had pushed their nerves to the limit, and they couldn’t relax until they saw someone.","Each second felt like a rapid drumbeat pounding on their hearts until finally, the person who came upstairs revealed their true form—a girl!","A very young girl, wearing a denim jacket over a cotton T-shirt, with a round neckline that outlined her slender neck. Her jawline was exceptionally refined, and a cap concealed the upper part of her face, leaving an impression of coolness at first glance. All around her was an aura of defiance and intimidation.","The girl stuck one hand in her pocket and raised the other to lift her cap, revealing those clear and stern eyes, scanning the ten or so people blocking the stairway.","She seemed to be assessing who was who.","After about a second, impatience flickered across her brow, and her slightly husky voice carried a hint of menace: \"Aren’t you going to move?\"","\"Damn!\" Someone realized it and showed anger on his face, immediately cursing rudely: \"Where’d this foul-mouthed woman come from? Need a beating?\"","No one saw how she moved, but the shouting man suddenly clutched his stomach, groaning in pain as he crouched down: \"Ah, my stomach...\"","Cold sweat ran down the others, and they immediately reacted by pointing guns at Qiao Nian at the bottom of the stairs, the atmosphere growing tense and hostile.","It was the young man who reacted fastest, reaching out to restrain his companions, lowering his voice while watching the person below: \"Don’t shoot, it’s Zhui Guang.\"","As the leader of the Red Alliance, Qiao Nian rarely showed up in the illegal zone, and while they had met Jian Jin and Guan Yan, few had seen Zhui Guang herself.","They were shocked that the legendary young Zhui Guang was so young and seemed to be of this nature.","Sangs looked grim, turning his head towards the person at the bottom of the stairs and saying loudly: \"Zhui Guang, we’re all people of the illegal zone here, and you’re a close friend of our master. We don’t want to trouble you, how about you also don’t trouble us? Tonight we only want Young Master Ye’s life. No matter how strong you are, you’re just one person, there’s no need to risk yourself...\"","\"You’re quite the talker.\" The girl looked slack and raised an eyebrow, without seeming to really listen.","Sangs couldn’t read the mood of this big shot and pressed on reluctantly: \"I just don’t want you to get accidentally hurt in the end.\"","\"Oh, you think you can hurt me.\" Qiao Nian nodded to show she understood, as a small remote-controlled device appeared in her hand.","As she raised her hand with the remote, Sangs’ forehead throbbed with veins, already sensing something bad, and he retreated vigilantly: \"Zhui Guang, what are you trying to do?\"","The next second, several small insect-like mechanical devices flapped their wings and flew into the crowd, as they panicked and tried to aim their guns at the small flying devices.","Qiao Nian blandly waved the remote in her hand: \"I advise you not to move, an explosion from even one can blow you all up here.\"","\"I’ve added a little something inside, ummm... it’s the stuff needed for making a missile head.\"","——Only one raw material is needed for making a missile head.","Everyone’s face turned purplish-blue as if they were immobilized, not daring to move!","They stared at Qiao Nian’s every move with frightened eyes, terrified she might accidentally brush the button on the remote.","Even the young man’s forehead glistened with sweat, gripping his fists tightly, trying hard not to appear overly fearful: \"Zhui Guang, you’re joking, right?\"","Qiao Nian looked at him seriously: \"...Do you think I’m joking with you?\"","\"...\""]},{"number":3952,"title":"Chapter 3952: Master Wang Is Truly Master Wang","paragraphs":["She spoke before the other party could, calmly saying, \"I’m serious, these are little gadgets I made and left in the Red Alliance before. They’re in the living room coffee table drawer, forgot to deal with them, isn’t this the right time? Now decide if you want to leave voluntarily or... I send you off?\"","Sangs tried to judge the truth from her eyes.","Because he was too nervous, he couldn’t ascertain whether Qiao Nian was truthful or deceptive, but he didn’t dare to gamble, so he smoothed things over, attempting to stall for time: \"Zhui Guang, please don’t make it difficult for me.\"","Meanwhile, the burly man, who had been with him for years, cleverly attempted to use the crowd as a shield to quietly go inside and find Ye Wangchuan.","His actions were skilled, and he felt for the gun on his leg, prepared to burst in and blow away the head of the person inside before Qiao Nian realized it.","\"Our master has reached an agreement with the reclusive family empress, he...\" To aid the bald hunk’s actions, Sangs intentionally diverted the topic to Lu Zhi and Nie Qingru, striving to capture Qiao Nian’s attention.","Their years of tacit cooperation almost proved effective in distracting Qiao Nian.","By the time she spotted the person sneaking out through the crowd, the burly man had already bypassed the wall within her line of sight, sneaking over.","\"Courting death!\" Qiao Nian’s eyes darkened, her body moved faster than her mind, immediately attempting to break through the people to chase after him.","Sangs and his men prepared to block her to buy time for the burly man.","At that very moment.","A scream echoed from inside.","\"Ah! You son of a...\"","\"Bang!\" Following that was the sound of a heavy object hitting the ground.","Qiao Nian’s eyelids twitched, desperately wanting to fly over like the wind to see what’s happening inside.","Seeing those people still intending to stop her, she disregarded her own safety, raised her gun and prepared to fight them head-on.","The mini drones she brought were merely a bluff; they couldn’t possibly contain nuclear warheads, such a small size couldn’t hold that thing.","Moreover, if placed in the unprotected living room, Guan Yan, Slim Waist Control, Tattoo Arm, who usually live here, would surely be exposed to radiation.","The reason she said that was simply to frighten these people, to find an opportunity to take a few out, and meanwhile break through the blockade.","Who would’ve thought they’d be so frantic to hold her back, sending someone inside.","When she came in, she heard these people mention that Ye Wangchuan’s gun was empty, meaning... Qiao Nian’s heart raced, she’d never been this flustered.","Ye Wangchuan...","She hardly considered her own safety, only the distance to the stairwell corner ahead.","Lu Zhi’s men were also startled by her reckless response, scattering the originally orderly team, leaving them dumbfounded.","At that moment.","A dark figure flashed by as they relaxed, darting to the back of the man in the center.","The young man was instantaneously restrained, sharp blade against his throat, a man’s deep voice sounded behind: \"Tell your men not to move!\"","Sangs broke into a cold sweat from his back, immediately halting those about to act: \"Everyone, stop!\"","Seeing that everyone ceased action, Ye Wangchuan, ensuring Qiao Nian’s safety, pressed his brow downward, then took the hostage out of the encirclement: \"Order them to move aside.\"","\"Move aside.\" Sangs caught the scent of blood from him, stiffened his spine, gesturing to others to clear a path.","Those people dispersed like a tide, freeing a narrow passage enough for one person to pass through."]},{"number":3953,"title":"Chapter 3953: I Choose to Leave, Will You Let Me Go?","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan reversed his grip on the blade and chuckled lightly, his tone quite proud and lazy: \"I advise you not to play tricks, or my knife will definitely be faster than the bullet.\"","\"...\" Sangs initially wanted to signal others to find the right time to shoot, but now he didn’t dare make a move.","Ye Wangchuan held him hostage and moved closer to the girl.","Qiao Nian, upon seeing that he was okay, suddenly relaxed her tense nerves, with a slight trace of fear she hadn’t even noticed.","As she saw him bringing the leader of this small group closer to her, she was the first to smell the strong scent of blood, and immediately frowned, her dark eyes looking at him: \"Are you hurt?\"","She was about to check: \"Where are you hurt?\"","Ye Wangchuan looked at her somewhat helplessly as she ignored everyone else and reached out to check, helplessly dodging aside, pretending to be relaxed: \"Nian Nian, it’s not possible right now. Wait until we go back tonight.\"","Qiao Nian pursed her lips, unusually serious, not letting him change the subject. She turned to the dozen or so people who had lost their leader and didn’t know what to do, and said: \"If you leave now, there’s still time.\"","\"Leaving now only means the task isn’t complete, you’ve done your best, and surely those behind you won’t say anything. But if you choose to stay here stubbornly and end up losing your life, don’t blame me.\"","The crowd began to buzz with discussions.","Qiao Nian ignored them and walked straight to the young man under Ye Wangchuan’s control, squinting as she recognized him: \"Sangs, right.\"","\"...I didn’t expect Zhui Guang to recognize me.\" Sangs looked a bit surprised, but given his current embarrassed situation, it wasn’t suitable to talk about this.","Qiao Nian nodded, pursing her lips: \"I’ve seen you at Jian Jin’s a few times, I have a bit of an impression.\"","She asked the young man who hadn’t recovered his senses: \"Have you made up your mind? Leave or stay.\"","Sangs didn’t initially recover from her question, but when he realized what Qiao Nian was asking, his lips curled into a bitter smile: \"Zhui Guang, you know Mr. Lu’s temper. What’s the difference between leaving now and staying here?\"","Qiao Nian disagreed, saying: \"Of course there’s a difference.\"","\"Choosing to leave gives you a chance to plead for mercy, even if you face punishment later, it may not cost you your life. But if you choose to stay...\"","Under Sangs’ gaze, she lifted her eyes, the words she left unsaid hovering in the air among the tiny airborne devices.","Sangs’ expression changed repeatedly, as if contemplating her words.","He wasn’t sure whether the tiny flying devices belonged to mini-bombs, or if they were enhanced with substances.","But he remembered that Qiao Nian had a remote control panel, so those flying devices were likely more than what Qiao Nian said, just flying devices.","The young man swiftly weighed the pros and cons—he had to admit Qiao Nian made a valid point. He quickly lowered his eyes, briefly pausing before saying: \"I choose to leave. Will you let me go?\"","\"I swear in the name of the Red Alliance.\" Qiao Nian raised three fingers.","Sangs felt relieved and turned to his team: \"You heard her. Leave or stay?\"","The others had already started feeling hesitant when Qiao Nian mentioned the enhanced small flying devices above their heads, now they were even less inclined to stay.","\"Leave.\" One person said.","The rest felt less pressure.","\"Leave!\"","\"I agree.\"","\"Let’s leave first.\"","Most chose to leave, even the hesitant ones were no longer crucial.","Qiao Nian signaled to Ye Wangchuan, saying softly: \"Let them go.\""]},{"number":3954,"title":"Chapter 3954: What a Coincidence, Master Wang and Sister Nian Did the Same Thing","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan released his grip without asking why, moved the dagger away, and signaled for the young man to leave.","Sangs initially wanted to take advantage of Ye Wangchuan, who was without a weapon, but when his peripheral vision caught the eyes of the girl playing with a remote control not far away, he hesitated, gritted his teeth, and told his men, \"Let’s go!\"","Lu Zhi’s people had long wanted to retreat, and were just waiting for his command. As soon as he gave the order, a group of people dropped their weapons and quickly left...","During this process, Qiao Nian had been playing with the black remote control in her hand, seemingly not caring about their departure, until the last silhouette disappeared at the door.","She suddenly released the remote control onto the ground, took three steps forward to grab the man’s shoulders, and asked sternly, \"Where are you injured?\"","When she touched his wound, Ye Wangchuan’s brow slightly twitched. He pulled her hand away, his pale lips still in the mood to joke with Qiao Nian, \"God Qiao, aren’t you going to take your micro-bombs back?\"","Qiao Nian roughly saw his shoulder shrink back in a moment, guessed where he was injured, furrowed her brows, and fixed her gaze on the area he had wrapped with a simple bandage, then looked up with her dark eyes devoid of light, \"You got shot in the right shoulder?\"","Ye Wangchuan avoided her hand trying to check, and said lightly, \"It’s just a minor wound. It doesn’t hurt. Let’s get out first and talk.\"","Seeing her left hand come up empty, Qiao Nian felt a surge of violent emotion but quickly controlled herself with reason. She said quickly, \"The people I arranged will be here soon, those outside won’t be able to escape.\"","\"You arranged more people?\" Ye Wangchuan was surprised.","\"Mhm.\" Qiao Nian responded, her left hand instinctively tried to check his wound again but only curled her fingers and put it back into her pocket, managing her tone as she said, \"I had Jian Jin investigate the situation here on my way in. I knew Lu Zhi was here, so I arranged for all available personnel to come over...\"","She paused, then added, \"There aren’t many people. Logically, it’s not enough to contend with Lu Zhi, but he brought few people tonight, so we have the advantage.\"","In the illegal zone, Lu Zhi is the Crowned King after all, while she usually stays around Rao City and only occasionally comes by when she went to college in Beijing. And her stay is limited.","The Red Alliance has never been strong in combative power and maintained its ranking among top forces in the illegal zone through the backing of David from Continent F and recent close ties with Tian Chen.","Tian Chen and the Red Alliance are completely different.","Lu Zhi is very strategic; he’s been setting up forces in the illegal zone early on, recruiting a large batch of capable helpers.","In the illegal zone, no one can stop Lu Zhi from acting against someone. The same goes for her!","But tonight Lu Zhi made a fatal error—assuming she couldn’t return in time and that Ye Wangchuan wouldn’t hold out for long. This led him to bring fewer people, giving her a chance to counterattack.","Sharp pain came from Ye Wangchuan’s shoulder, and the loss of blood gave him a slight sense of powerlessness. To hide his condition, he lightly leaned against the wall, stood with his arms crossed as usual, appearing proud yet lazy, squinting slightly, \"By coincidence, I also arranged for some manpower. Without any surprises, Lu Zhi is already planning to leave.\"","Qiao Nian immediately met his gaze, visibly surprised, \"You...\"","Her gaze slid down, catching the man’s pallid lips again, her brows furrowing as she stood up straight, unusually vexed, \"Forget it, let’s talk once we’re outside.\"","**","Ye Wangchuan’s guess was very accurate.","Outside, after Sangs and the others went out, they found Lu Zhi already preparing to retreat."]},{"number":3955,"title":"Chapter 3955: As Long As He Dies, I Will Have a Chance","paragraphs":["Jian Jin followed Lu Zhi silently, the atmosphere between them was unbearably awkward and heavy.","Why were even Mr. Lu and his people leaving?","Sangs and the others couldn’t figure out the situation at hand, but they still had to report to Lu Zhi what they had been through, so he braved himself and approached the wheelchair: \"Mr. Lu.\"","Lu Zhi looked up at him lightly, already understanding the implications of him seeking him out: \"Failed?\"","Sangs recounted the events inside in detail, acknowledging his own incompetence, and before Lu Zhi could speak, he knelt down on one knee, extremely pale and pleading for punishment: \"It’s my incompetence. Please punish me, Mr. Lu!\"","\"Tsk. You are indeed astute.\" Lu Zhi clicked his tongue with a laugh, without any murderous intent, though it was clear he was displeased that Sangs and his men did not manage to deal with Ye Wangchuan.","Sangs had been by his side for many years and felt he had grasped some of Lu Zhi’s ways, sensing that Lu Zhi’s words did not imply a threat to his life, he subtly relaxed.","Immediately, he looked up with astuteness at the person sitting in the wheelchair and spoke: \"Mr. Lu, our next steps...\"","Lu Zhi glanced at the subtly dark sky, and said upon hearing him: \"Let’s return first.\"","Though Sangs did not understand why Lu Zhi was eager to leave, given his failure, he was in no place to question his master’s intentions.","He obediently got up and followed Lu Zhi’s order to gather his people and prepare for departure...","...","Jian Jin stood nearby and naturally overheard their conversation, and upon realizing Ye Wangchuan was safe, she relaxed entirely, softly speaking to the man in the wheelchair sideways.","\"It’s a relief that Young Master Ye is alright, this way you and Jiang Yao have room to maneuver.\"","Seeing Lu Zhi unresponsive, even while instructing the tower-like bodyguard about the follow-up matters, she resisted, yet couldn’t help but block Lu Zhi’s view, her expression solemn.","\"Boss Lu, what are you thinking? Do you really want to fall out with Jiang Yao? Or are you indifferent to losing even friendship in the future?\"","\"You go ahead and take care of it first.\" Lu Zhi instructed the bodyguard calmly.","The bodyguard glanced at Jian Jin, then silently left to take care of Lu Zhi’s instructions. Soon, only Jian Jin and Lu Zhi were left in this small spot.","Lu Zhi’s cold, white, and slender hand gripped the wheelchair, himself operating it to change direction and drive forward, a blanket over his legs, ethereal and noble, he was a beam of light in the night.","Just as Jian Jin was in a daze, she heard his leisurely voice arise.","\"Does it matter if you care?\"","\"Being friends with her means I’ll only ever be friends; but what I want is not just a friendship.\"","\"Also, harassing Ye Wangchuan isn’t just because of her. Over the years, Beijing’s reach has extended too far, and part of his faction has repeatedly attempted to take a share in the illegal zone. He messed with my cake, is it wrong for me to deal with him? Why can’t I?\"","Jian Jin stared at his increasingly distant back, quickly returning to her senses and catching up, walking behind him: \"But you shouldn’t take advantage of Jiang Yao’s absence to cooperate with Nie Qingru. Knowing full well her relationship with Jiang Yao, you still did it... anyone would feel disheartened. Not to mention Jiang Yao had an unpleasant falling out with you over this previously...\"","Lu Zhi’s wheelchair suddenly stopped moving.","Jian Jin was forced to stop.","In her puzzled gaze, she saw Lu Zhi gripping the wheelchair tightly, veins bulging on the back of his hand, his voice still calm as always: \"As long as he’s dead, I’ll have a chance.\""]},{"number":3956,"title":"Chapter 3956: Sister Nian’s People Have Arrived","paragraphs":["\"Life is only a few decades long. I can apologize, I can compensate... someday she will forgive me. But as long as Ye Wangchuan is around, I will never have a chance to win her heart. Am I wrong to pursue what I want?\"","Jian Jin was momentarily speechless, standing dumbfounded in place.","Lu Zhi’s emotions came and went quickly. The wheelchair silently moved forward, like a stubborn minute hand trudging alone...","Jian Jin barely had time to feel sad when fireworks lit up the right side of the sky.","\"Boom!\"","The bursting fireworks illuminated the night.","Everyone noticed the unusual fireworks, and so did Jian Jin. Her expression changed immediately, and she quickly rushed over to push Lu Zhi away.","\"Quickly, it’s Qiao’s people!\"","She couldn’t bear to see Lu Zhi hurt Qiao Nian, nor could she bear to see Lu Zhi get hurt.","Jian Jin heard the urgent sounds of wind passing by, ignoring everyone else and even Lu Zhi talking to her, she stubbornly evacuated him to a safe place...","**","The people arranged by Qiao Nian quickly arrived, using the fireworks as a signal, surrounding the area tightly.","Lu Zhi and Shadow, who didn’t have time to retreat, were all trapped inside.","Fortunately for Lu Zhi.","Jian Jin reacted quickly, driving him away from that area in the first instance, and his bodyguards immediately hijacked a car to follow upon seeing Jian Jin take him away.","Meanwhile, Sangs and some nearby people also jumped into their cars with the intent to atone for their sins as others were still watching the fireworks.","Because of this serendipity, some of Lu Zhi’s people managed to withdraw.","Nie Qingru’s confidants weren’t so lucky.","Most of them remained there, still looking up at the fireworks to the southeast, completely unaware of the looming danger.","Only Shadow reacted slightly faster, quickly hijacking one of Lu Zhi’s cars, driving through the encirclement, and barely escaping.","By the time those who stayed behind realized something was wrong, Qiao Nian’s people had already surrounded them tightly.","This time, Qiao Nian mobilized David’s men in the illegal zone. David’s people were never short of advanced weapons.","Those rare new weapons, in the hands of these people, were just bigger toys. With a line of ’big toys’ displayed there, anyone with a bit of sense knew to give up resisting and raise their hands in surrender.","Jian Jin left, but Guan Yan and others remained.","Since the situation had changed, the threats that originally restricted their freedom naturally no longer existed.","Qin Si and Ji Lin immediately turned around and ran into the villa.","Just in time, they ran into Qiao Nian supporting Ye Wangchuan out.","Seeing Ye Wangchuan covered in blood, Qin Si’s expression changed drastically, immediately blocking their way: \"Sister Qiao, how is Master Wang...\"","Qiao Nian’s expression wasn’t pleasant, showing some irritation: \"If you don’t move, he’ll end up in trouble even if he was fine before!\"","Realizing he was in the way out of concern, Qin Si immediately stepped aside, following closely behind the two: \"Is Master Wang alright?\"","Qiao Nian, supporting Ye Wangchuan while walking forward, coldly answered his query: \"He got shot in the right shoulder. I’m taking him to get the bullet out first.\"","Without the necessary tools here, Qiao Nian would have directly helped Ye Wangchuan remove the embedded shrapnel in the villa.","Thinking about the bullet still lodged in Ye Wangchuan, she was restless and impatient: \"Guan Yan, you drive.\"","\"Okay.\" Guan Yan, without unnecessary words, quickly went to find a car.","Qiao Nian looked at Ji Lin, calmly saying: \"I’ll take him to the hospital first, I’ll leave here to you.\""]},{"number":3957,"title":"Chapter 3957: Sister Nian Always Plays Straight Balls","paragraphs":["Ji Lin saw that Ye Wangchuan was still conscious and knew that Master Wang’s injury was not serious, so he calmed down and obeyed the arrangements to make way: \"Okay.\"","Qiao Nian had one foot off the steps, and in her peripheral vision, she saw a few familiar faces. She remembered something, stopped, and turned back to instruct Ji Lin: \"Uh, those few people over there...\"","Ji Lin followed her gaze and saw a few of Lu Zhi’s people.","He didn’t understand but looked back at the girl: \"You speak, Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Nian said seriously: \"I promised to let them go before. Let them leave, you handle the rest.\"","Ji Lin looked at those people again.","Those people obviously heard Qiao Nian’s words, and for a moment they couldn’t tell if they were dreaming or in reality, only feeling that fortune had favored them.","Earlier in the western-style building, Qiao Nian did say that as long as they left, she wouldn’t harm them. But after the situation reversed, they didn’t dare hope to leave unscathed.","Unexpectedly, something they didn’t dare wish for, Zhui Guang remembered. And she really kept her promise to let them go!","Ji Lin confirmed with her which people and then promised earnestly: \"Rest assured, Miss Qiao, I will arrange everything.\"","\"Alright.\" Qiao Nian no longer worried about this matter, continued to bear most of the man’s weight, and tenderly said: \"Let’s go.\"","A trace of pleasure flashed in the depths of Ye Wangchuan’s eyes, not minding as he leaned a bit more on her, his thin lips slightly upturned, his voice deep: \"Okay.\"","If Gu San were here, he would definitely see that he could walk on his own; he just enjoyed Qiao Nian’s concern.","Unfortunately, Gu San stayed in Beijing and didn’t come along.","Qin Si, on the other hand, was still preoccupied with the thought of Qiao Nian mentioning a gunshot wound to the shoulder and didn’t notice the slight happiness on Ye Wangchuan’s face.","As for Ji Lin, there was no need to mention him, as he was busy carrying out Qiao Nian’s instructions.","Soon, Guan Yan drove over in a jeep, parked in front of the two, opened the driver’s door, and jumped out: \"Zhui Guang, you want me to take you there?\"","\"Your injury hasn’t healed yet, stay here and help Ji Lin handle the aftermath. I’ll go by myself.\" Qiao Nian opened the passenger door.","Turning her head, somewhat unsure how to take care of someone, she gently asked: \"Can you get in?\"","The dense night in Ye Wangchuan’s eyes turned soft like spring water, as if there was a small hook in them, one hand supporting the car door with an appearance of slight difficulty: \"I’ll try my best.\"","\"Alright.\" Qiao Nian slowly let go and still worriedly said: \"If you can’t, I’ll carry you up.\"","Her expression was quite earnest, even sincerely wanting to act.","\"Cough!\" Ye Wangchuan heard this and choked in his chest, steadied himself, and quickly got in.","Seeing him get in, Qiao Nian conveniently closed the car door for him, walked around to the other side to get in, put on her seat belt, and turned to say: \"You have a shoulder injury, so don’t fasten the seatbelt. I’ll try to drive slowly.\"","Ye Wangchuan had just been thrown off by her natural \"I’ll carry you up\" statement and didn’t say anything this time, just responded with a hum.","Qiao Nian then shifted gears, stepped on the gas, and as promised, drove as steadily as possible.","Used to speeding, this cautious driving was undoubtedly a form of torture for her, akin to moving like an old lady.","Her temper was usually bad, and her patience limited. But this time, she drove steadily the whole way without a word of complaint, even turning up the temperature of the car’s air conditioning. She turned her head to the slightly unwell-looking man with a hoarse voice: \"Get some sleep, I’ll wake you when we get there.\""]},{"number":3958,"title":"Chapter 3958: Sister Nian Still Takes Good Care of People","paragraphs":["\"Okay.\" Ye Wangchuan tilted his head back against the chair, closed his weary eyes, and let his body relax.","Qiao Nian glanced through the right side rear-view mirror at the man’s defined jawline, then quietly turned on the car’s music system, playing a soothing piece of instrumental music.","Warm air gently flowed inside the car, accompanied by the soft, relaxing music that eased the nerves.","The tension that gripped Ye Wangchuan all night loosened a bit, and the crease on his forehead smoothed out unconsciously. His long eyelashes quivered slightly, but he didn’t open his eyes.","As Qiao Nian drove, she kept an eye on his condition and whispered softly, \"Don’t worry, I’m right here beside you.\"","Ye Wangchuan’s heart skipped a beat; no one had ever comforted him like that before, but he couldn’t help the genuine trust he felt towards the girl beside him.","He actually allowed himself to slip into a half-conscious state with injuries in such a confined space and with someone else around...","**","Hospital.","Qiao Nian parked the car and turned her head, noticing the sleeping face of the man who seemed entirely unaware.","She unbuckled her seatbelt but didn’t rush to get out or call anyone. Instead, she found her phone and made a call: \"I have a patient with me, can you send two people down?\"","She deliberately lowered her voice as she spoke.","She didn’t speak loudly.","But with Ye Wangchuan’s usual alertness, it was impossible for him to miss it.","Qiao Nian set down her phone and glanced sideways, seeing the sleeping man slightly furrow his brow, his right shoulder shrinking back uncomfortably.","She pressed her lips together, a hint of curiosity flashing in her dark eyes, and called out, \"Ye Wangchuan.\"","The man in the passenger seat didn’t react; only his eyelashes fluttered slightly, and his lips were dry and pale.","Qiao Nian immediately realized something was off with him. She reached out to touch his forehead, feeling his skin burning hot against her palm.","He had a fever.","Qiao Nian withdrew her hand, pursed her lips tighter, and decisively opened the car door to call for help.","Fortunately, someone in the hospital hurried out just then, a young male doctor followed by several others in white coats.","He greeted her right away: \"Q. Where’s the patient you mentioned?\"","\"In the car.\"","Qiao Nian stepped aside to let them see.","The young man followed her gaze to the person inside the car, then looked back, evidently familiar with Qiao Nian: \"What happened to him?\"","This person was Zhong Yiliu’s disciple.","He had spent a long time at the Pharmacy Association but left later due to differences in research philosophies that didn’t align with the association’s rules.","He chose to leave and work independently, turning his back on the Pharmacy Association.","Many members of the Pharmacy Association didn’t know Yu Yan’s name, but Qiao Nian knew him and got along well with him.","Qiao Nian was also one of the few who knew that Zhong Yiliu and his former top disciple had not severed ties.","Most people who knew Yu Yan’s name thought he rebelled against and left the Pharmacy Association, assuming Zhong Yiliu, as his mentor, would be terribly disappointed in him.","However, Qiao Nian knew that Zhong Yiliu was a madman for pharmacology, and in this aspect, Yu Yan shared about eighty percent of his traits. As the association president, Zhong Yiliu was inevitably bound by regulations, but someone needed to set an example in the field. Being pushed to prominence, he had no choice but to compromise a bit.","Yu Yan left the Pharmacy Association for a gene medicine. Though publicly Zhong Yiliu seemed heartbroken over losing such a pride-worthy top disciple, in private, Qiao Nian had dined with them and knew that not only was Zhong Yiliu not angry, but he also strongly supported Yu Yan’s actions."]},{"number":3959,"title":"Chapter 3959: Master Wang’s Condition Is Worse Than Expected","paragraphs":["Yu Yan left the Pharmacy Association and went to the illegal zone. Qiao Nian, due to her connection with Zhong Yiliu, secretly supported him, providing him with considerable research funds and convenience.","He stayed anonymous in this hospital, conducting his gene medicine research plan.","If it weren’t for Qiao Nian’s phone call, he would still be immersed in his small medicine laboratory, refusing to come out.","\"He got shot in the shoulder.\" Qiao Nian tried to control her emotions and said concisely: \"I just touched his forehead, it’s a bit feverish.\"","Yu Yan seldom saw her so emotionally disturbed and looked at her in surprise: \"You... you and him...\"","He had stayed in the hospital’s medicine laboratory for years, his impression of Qiao Nian remained from back when she spent time at the Pharmacy Association.","At that time, Qiao Nian had stormed the place, impressing Zhong Yiliu with her exceptional skill in Traditional Chinese Medicine and her expansive knowledge of pharmacology.","Consequently, Yu Yan, who was still by Zhong Yiliu’s side, also found Qiao Nian impressive. He only remembered her as reclusive, aloof, and uninterested in anyone.","Back then, he wondered if such personalities were common among Orientals, so defiant and fearlessly arrogant.","It wasn’t until now that he saw the girl’s undisguised worry and irritation, obviously moved by the man’s condition in the car.","Yu Yan curiously asked her.","\"Are you and him... in those kinds of relations?\"","\"What kind?\"","Before he could answer, Qiao Nian interpreted his body language and candidly acknowledged: \"Well, he’s my boyfriend, the kind meant for marriage, the kind you mentioned.\"","\"?!\"","The mention of a boyfriend wasn’t a big shock to Yu Yan, but the idea of marriage, coming from Qiao Nian, was more disconcerting to him.","\"You...\"","For a moment, his mind buzzed and he couldn’t quite react.","Qiao Nian lifted her legs and, not wanting to waste time, decisively interrupted him, saying: \"Help me get him into the operating room, and I’ll take the bullet out of his shoulder.\"","\"I suspect it’s explosive rounds.\"","Yu Yan suddenly looked at her: \"Explosive rounds?\"","Qiao Nian’s tone wasn’t good: \"Mm.\"","Explosive rounds are no longer permitted internationally because they’re extremely cruel. Upon impact, the bullet head explodes, releasing 10-30 small steel pellets, causing extensive damage to the wound, inflicting unbearable pain on the victim.","Due to the inhumanity of such bullets, most countries globally banned their use shortly after they were introduced.","As a doctor, Yu Yan naturally had heard of the injuries such inhumane bullets cause, immediately abandoning gossip and snapping into professional mode.","\"Alright. I’ll have someone prepare for an anesthetic surgery.\"","Qiao Nian walked inside: \"I’ll perform this surgery!\"","**","kilometers from the Red Alliance headquarters.","Jian Jin slammed the brakes and stopped by the roadside, seeing the blazing fire not far away through the windshield, its flickering light casting shadows on her face.","She placed her hands on the steering wheel, and after a long silence, softly said: \"Boss, all our people are caught up in there.\"","Lu Zhi sat in the back seat, his fair face showed little reaction as he coldly glanced at the fire outside, casually saying: \"That’s the result you wanted.\"","Jian Jin looked back at him, momentarily at a loss for words, then awkwardly averted her gaze, murmuring: \"That’s not what I wanted! I just... never mind.\""]}]);
